          "content": {
            "size": 12579,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"code\":\"00000\",\"data\":[{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Anime\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211208/1638935650610_761ad4afdf14d955a528348b0bb306echYC6uetTLSqbLZ3dFY0IfXWhl93.jpg\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211208/1638935645297_5e085567f2757d578a4bdb7a91a1bc38fcXdJlbSdUEeMSJFsXKsznGwwok.jpg\",\"domainType\":1,\"episodeVo\":[{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":1},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":2},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":3},{\"ellipsis\":true,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":0},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":1175},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":1176},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":1177}],\"id\":\"8220\",\"introduction\":\"There once lived a pirate named Gol D. Roger. He obtained wealth, fame, and power to earn the title of Pirate King. When he was captured and about to be executed, he revealed that his treasure called One Piece was hidden somewhere at the Grand Line. This made all people set out to search and uncover the One Piece treasure, but no one ever found the location of Gol D. Roger's treasure, and the Grand Line was too dangerous a place to overcome. Twenty-two years after Gol D. Roger's death, a boy named Monkey D. Luffy decided to become a pirate and search for Gol D. Roger's treasure to become the next Pirate King.\",\"name\":\"One Piece\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"1999\",\"resourceNum\":1177,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":8.8,\"sort\":\"244.89859,8220\",\"subType\":\"COMIC\"},{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"},{\"id\":52,\"name\":\"South Africa\"},{\"id\":60,\"name\":\"U.K\"},{\"id\":61,\"name\":\"America\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"id\":8,\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230719/1689735840332_e7b0954a54acadf2169659078dc47104海贼王 横.jpg\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230831/1693462800942_6d56cc6fd90474a6dc47161c9f0fa7bd6.jpg\",\"domainType\":1,\"episodeVo\":[{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":1},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":2},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":3},{\"ellipsis\":true,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":0},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":6},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":7},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":8}],\"id\":\"35698\",\"introduction\":\"An alternate version of Earth, and one that is currently in the midst of the 'Golden Age of Pirates'. Ruthless cut-throat pirates rule the seas, and only the strongest have the chance to lay claim to the mythical treasure known as 'One Piece' that was left behind by the greatest pirate of them all Gol D. Roger. Years after the death of Gol D. Roger, a young boy by the name of Monkey D. Luffy has dreams of raising his own crew, finding One Piece, and declaring himself as Pirate King. After eating a devil fruit that grants Luffy the power to make his body like rubber, it gives him enormous strength and agility. When Luffy finally comes of age, he sets sail from Foosha Village in East Blue and sets upon his grand adventure to become the next Pirate King.\",\"name\":\"One Piece\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"2023\",\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"sort\":\"237.63489,35698\",\"subType\":\"TV\"},{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Anime\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Comedy\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250423/1745409620104_56c7a841e71aab28086a6a8e65f0b8d9横.webp\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250423/1745409615580_f09e1009bde24b22c2da3d70042bb683竖.webp\",\"domainType\":1,\"episodeVo\":[{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":1},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":2},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":3},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":4},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":5}],\"id\":\"87315\",\"introduction\":\"A high school student named Yamamoto Ruff is ridiculed and teased because his name is the same as the protagonist of the best-selling comic. However, he also made several friends whose names are also related to the comics. Nami Koyama has a good impression of Ruffy Yamamoto and secretly has a crush on him. Because the name pronounced the same as Nami, she immediately became friends with Yamamoto. Nakatsugawa Shufeng, whose name is pronounced the same as that of a lie. As a pirate fan, he found \\\"Rufu\\\" and \\\"Nami\\\", and forced them to establish a Pirate Club together, which started a series of hilarious stories.\",\"name\":\"One Piece in Love\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"2025\",\"resourceNum\":5,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"sort\":\"211.51297,87315\",\"subType\":\"COMIC\"},{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Anime\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211025/1635140910945_652313333dfba7d3bd46add6e94f2ec6635qI5pWhQSUaTnOkMo4GLCe8sV.jpg\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211025/1635140907308_455bc0b847c5187c1df390a5282684626QOrTYafoqzXPWLnR2K8129jTHH.jpg\",\"domainType\":0,\"episodeVo\":[],\"id\":\"4337\",\"introduction\":\"There once was a pirate known as the Great Gold Pirate Woonan, who obtained almost 1/3 of the world's gold. Over the course of a few years, the pirate's existence faded, and a legend grew that he disappeared with his gold to a remote island, an island pirates continue to search for. Aboard the Going Merry, Luffy and his crew, starved and reckless, are robbed of their treasure. In an attempt to get it back, they wreck the getaway ship, guided by a young boy named Tabio, who's a captured part of El Drago's pirate crew. El Drago's love for gold has driven him to look for Woonan's island, and thanks to Woonan's treasure map, he finds it. During this time, Luffy's crew have been split up, and despite their own circumstances, they must find a way to stop El Drago from obtaining Woonan's gold.\",\"name\":\"One Piece: The Movie\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"2000\",\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"sort\":\"210.75217,4337\",\"subType\":\"MOVIE\"},{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Anime\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230617/1686978150509_30c28d2d3064bec9fe675ba179d29900海贼王 特别篇 .jpg\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230617/1686978137238_e0463a8fb9a65db1afd69c9b29a3b08a海贼王 特别篇1.jpg\",\"domainType\":1,\"episodeVo\":[{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":1},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":2},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":3},{\"ellipsis\":true,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":0},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":10},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":11},{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":1,\"seriesNo\":12}],\"id\":\"34845\",\"introduction\":\"Follows the adventures of Monkey D. Luffy and his pirate crew in order to find the greatest treasure ever left by the legendary Pirate, Gold Roger. The famous mystery treasure named \\\"One Piece\\\".\",\"name\":\"One Piece SP\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"1999\",\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.9,\"sort\":\"210.53189,34845\",\"subType\":\"COMIC\"},{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Anime\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260408/1775634563228_3e90b226362b00724a7ef6d62eab71e2dQCBqCkoXz2PCqApTNXZ007QwNb.webp\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260408/1775634547321_94f6582cdf63d199c71310102b86bee4hbRXvcckbdKMhCea1JalPnSQQge.webp\",\"domainType\":1,\"episodeVo\":[{\"ellipsis\":false,\"paidMode\":0,\"seriesNo\":1}],\"id\":\"132694\",\"introduction\":\"Go behind the runway as style icon Nami stars in a life-changing fashion show, observe wise Robin as she helps to decipher an ancient tablet with Koala and Sabo, watch as solemn Princess Vivi receives a love letter from an unexpected admirer, and check out Ghost Princess Perona's battle over the last bottle of wine with Zoro and Mihawk!\",\"name\":\"One Piece Heroines\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"2026\",\"resourceNum\":1,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"sort\":\"210.00803,132694\",\"subType\":\"COMIC\"},{\"areas\":[{\"id\":44,\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"categoryTag\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Anime\"},{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"Fantasy\"}],\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220517/1652757440758_45299138fd2b14182dcb4c691e58b683iGnCzXEx0cFlUbpyAMeHwHWhPhx.jpg\",\"coverVerticalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220517/1652757438028_2d79671e6124d2963b4befaacd8b66a94E2lyUGLEr3yH4q6kJxPkQUhX7n.jpg\",\"domainType\":0,\"episodeVo\":[],\"id\":\"18160\",\"introduction\":\"Pirates from around the world gather at the Pirates Expo to join the hunt for Gol D. Roger's lost treasure.\",\"name\":\"One Piece: Stampede\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":\"2019\",\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"sort\":\"209.6194,18160\",\"subType\":\"MOVIE\