            "size": 574988,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"code\":\"00000\",\"data\":{\"navigationId\":null,\"page\":1,\"recommendItems\":[{\"bannerProportion\":2.0,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"Banner-TV/PC端（首页）\",\"coverType\":null,\"homeSectionId\":84251,\"homeSectionName\":\"\",\"homeSectionType\":\"BANNER\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"151436\",\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251923,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260713/1783939053306_b27b91c5836fba6daa7adf85522d1f01给你梦想.png\",\"introduction\":\"A romantic comedy exploring the lives of two individuals at different crossroads in life. Reporter Lee Jae has transitioned from a fearless teen driven by dreams to a disillusioned 20-something facing the harsh realities of life, and finally becoming an adult in her 30s who feels like she has settled into mediocrity. On the other hand, film director Su Bin has lived a life designed by his parents during his teenage years but eventually broke free and charged through his 20s and ultimately achieved the dream he had longed for by his 30s.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151436&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"Romance list Top 2\",\"rankId\":91,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Dream to You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Dream to You\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"151509\",\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251917,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260713/1783910648329_b0c5d243ddde54bb531e3160840f1747海洋七元.png\",\"introduction\":\"Live-action adaptation of the 2016 Disney animated film 'Moana.'\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151509&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":8,\"rankDesc\":\"Crime list Top 1\",\"rankId\":138,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Singing & Dancing\"],\"title\":\"Moana\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Moana\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"146964\",\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251865,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260629/1782727488651_4f2206dca89a18c0e6159612463e93c8进特务.png\",\"introduction\":\"Manager Kim works at a small savings bank. He seems like an ordinary single father, raising his daughter Min Ji. He has a secret that he can't reveal, even to his own daughter. His secret is that he is a former spy and he was dispatched on countless special operations. He is on North Korea's most wanted blacklist and his existence in South Korea is like a time bomb that should not be revealed. Hiding his past, he lives like an ordinary citizen, but his beloved daughter Min Ji goes missing. He struggles to save his daughter, not hesitating to reveal his secret and risking everything.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=146964&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 1\",\"rankId\":11,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\"],\"title\":\"Agent Kim Reactivated\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Agent Kim Reactivated\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"151917\",\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251919,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260713/1783910737665_feac8a90a7fa0f46fa51ed15e81cd75d婚姻2.png\",\"introduction\":\"On the verge of divorce, Kang Tae Ju's life is shattered when his wife, Ko Se Yun, is kidnapped. As he desperately searches for her, he is implicated in a murder-for-hire case and becomes a wanted fugitive. Hunted by the police, he finds himself locked in a deadly battle with No Man Hui, a seemingly ordinary man whose calm exterior conceals a terrifying cruelty.\\n\\nAs Se Yun struggles to escape her captors, she encounters the mysterious Kim Gyeong Ae, whose kindness hides an unsettling aura and whose role in the case remains uncertain. With hidden motives and dangerous secrets gradually coming to light, Tae Ju is pushed to increasingly perilous extremes and must uncover the truth behind the kidnapping before he loses the woman he is about to leave.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151917&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"Horror list Top 2\",\"rankId\":126,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":4,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Husband\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"The Husband\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"146948\",\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251918,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260713/1783910700732_5d08ae1390d0db36a7ffbec7bfe7a022气体人.png\",\"introduction\":\"Follows a man who gains the ability to transform into a gaseous state and uses his powers for bank robberies.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=146948&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":39,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 1\",\"rankId\":110,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Human Vapor\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Human Vapor\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"146943\",\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251821,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260626/1782443690387_cf1b34a943da2704f142285bf938c6c2140688.png\",\"introduction\":\"Follows the Minions in 1920s Hollywood as they search for frightening creatures for their monster movie, partner with a green creature, and must save the planet after unleashing monsters.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=146943&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"Animated Film list Top 2\",\"rankId\":200,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"140703\",\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251687,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260611/1781147248258_280fef35c1b1eefa0963e39a00a89046tiequan.png\",\"introduction\":\"The collapse of teachers' Authority, the establishment of the Teachers' Authority Protection Bureau under the Ministry of Education, and the dispatch of supervisors to problem schools to punish students and parents who cross the line.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=140703&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"Crime list Top 2\",\"rankId\":312,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"Teach You a Lesson\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Teach You a Lesson\",\"year\":2026},{\"category\":null,\"cid\":\"140688\",\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"country\":\"\",\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":251819,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260626/1782442797811_a43e48d70f0ee4add5ee662281b5539b降世.png\",\"introduction\":\"After preventing the Fire Nation from invading the Shanshui Kingdom in the Arctic and achieving a bittersweet victory, Avatar An (Gordon Cormier), Ketara (Chia Ventio), and Suka (Ian Owsley) regrouped and set out to find the elusive Earth King, asking him to work together to fight against the terrifying Fire King Osai (Kim Dae Hyun). \\n The destination of this trip is the impregnable city of Baxinsai, where the King of Earth Qiang lives. The journey is dangerous, but the harvest is rich: An meets Duff (played by Mia Cech), a young and bold earth transport master, and persuades her to teach her the magical power of earth transport to help him learn the third power besides air control and water interception.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=140688&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":25,\"rankDesc\":\"Fantasy list Top 1\",\"rankId\":55,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Avatar: The Last Airbender Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"Avatar: The Last Airbender Season 2\",\"year\":2026}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"最新上线\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":22225,\"homeSectionName\":\"New Releases\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260702/1782980863668_f6fd6052823b516168a70df9d34e564f2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":154110,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260702/1782980861561_bb7a9dad312f9eb20780af27e1b358b01.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After the Trojan War, Odysseus faces a dangerous voyage back to Ithaca, meeting creatures like the Cyclops Polyphemus, Sirens, and Calypso along the way.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=154110&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":8,\"rankDesc\":\"Crime list Top 2\",\"rankId\":138,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"History\"],\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260623/1782200635493_8a57824fc53d1a06b79c3685c965627d2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":151903,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260623/1782201351411_74bd14daac9f5f1f59bf0ae09c691d361.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A reformed criminal is forced to confront her past and return to illicit activities for one final job, hoping to secure her freedom and leave her former life behind for good.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151903&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 30000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Lucky\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\"