er who created an era of romance with Al that is 100% compatible with her, and 100% pure romantic. Han Seon Ho, a novel writer who sticks to analogue. And the unknown secrets that unfold before them.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=127565&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Love Phobia\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":18},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"即将上线\",\"coverType\":null,\"homeSectionId\":83026,\"homeSectionName\":\"Coming Soon\",\"homeSectionType\":\"MOVIE_RESERVE\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":151442,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260622/1782107155542_968abdcab3a805f9cd87b9ee4c7da731鬼谜东宫.webp\",\"introduction\":\"\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151442&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"Today\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"561.3K\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[],\"title\":\"The East Palace\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"\",\"dramaTypeVo\":null,\"id\":131352,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774493723169_cf779b5a60780ed5337fd8be90f4dd1b蜘蛛侠：崭新之日.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131352&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"31 Jul\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":null,\"reserveNum\":\"999K+\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":null,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[],\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand 