\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Remarkably Bright Creatures\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260422/1776839241332_cbf6b1a94902f2dc94140970e19e2777eCsrzMDYCwvI4lQlTB9QCtnPipU.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":135643,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260422/1776839237838_520d085b2219abb62bbec68bf115da92ul4dQcA68mtSx8J56N5gEcaCCtP.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Hunted for her rare blood type, a woman is raised by a family of contract killers but never trained as one herself, until a brutal attack claims the lived of many of her found family. She undergoes intensive trained and vows to fight alongside the assassin she loves to protect their future when an old enemy resurfaces.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=135643&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"My Dearest Assassin\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260429/1777445195522_d680b669574f7ef92dd90f4465be7955iYjlQzWbcFIjWe2WifbEPb4kErp.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":137426,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260429/1777445188585_2f4a1b375fdc1658d5cad0e780f3b74ecyI2Ugpq98WZN1GEYeWkn4ztXOc.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A group of international passengers en route from Los Angeles to Shanghai are forced to make an emergency landing in shark-infested waters. Now they must work together in hopes to overcome the frenzy of sharks drawn to the wreckage.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=137426&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Deep Water\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220830/1661842842871_61fe784f6682710c23b74c2953fee274月球 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":24525,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220830/1661842840046_4dbd7e46814d9415d20e4529966f3d14月球 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In Moonfall, a mysterious force knocks the Moon from its orbit around Earth and sends it hurtling on a collision course with life as we know it. With mere weeks before impact and the world on the brink of annihilation, NASA executive and former astronaut Jo Fowler is convinced she has the key to saving us all - but only one astronaut from her past, Brian Harper and a conspiracy theorist K.C. Houseman believe her. These unlikely heroes will mount an impossible last-ditch mission into space, leaving behind everyone they love, only to find that they just might have prepared for the wrong mission.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=24525&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Moonfall\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260429/1777444608058_d015e93769a3b21297ed