8950b894981.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in the Joseon Dynasty, and is said to tell the story of the 6th king of Joseon, Danjong, who was exiled to Yeongwol, Gangwon Province.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=137509&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"title\":\"The King’s Warden\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260211/1770789596269_102e491c27f28754e5c319878c8fda972.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":127329,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260211/1770789586735_dfc25b522e1d003636c922bcaf6c0b541.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A 19-year-old animal lover uses technology that places her consciousness into a robotic beaver to uncover mysteries within the animal world beyond her imagination.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=127329&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Hoppers\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":19},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"错爱\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":85212,\"homeSectionName\":\"A Love in Fault\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260612/1781242451211_8fa7750f76b5007e1d26b9cc651a15aep2932739857.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":149338,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260612/1781242439213_edccd7c15d76ef5427604cfac0bfe2e2p2932739857.webp\",\"introduction\":\"When a seemingly perfect marriage lacks the intimacy the heart longs for, Lalin begins searching for fulfillment elsewhere. Desperate to save their relationship, her devoted husband Thanat agrees to let her be with other men. But once their marriage is opened, not everything remains transparent. Secrets, insatiable desires, and changing emotions slowly pull them further than either of them ever imagined—past the point of no return.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=149338&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Club Friday The Series 18: OpenRelationship\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632809179081_a13e4114f56b87cdb7aa6f407a2cbe24画板 1 拷贝 58.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":895,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210918/1631955606100_00943f865a4b58aa6ed1d2a4ba408d05kfcJl5e8CRWDU7e4vX6uNABPRbS.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A suburban mother of two takes a fantasy-charged trip down memory lane that sets her very married present on a collision course with her wild-child past.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=895&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":25,\"rankDesc\":\"Romance list Top 3\",\"rankId\":53,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":5.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Sex/Life\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241228/1735387191662_49925f7fa9369e2eeb19c2e0d94bbbe1小心肝儿2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":65246,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241228/1735387185590_436a39f88c98e2d8489655b406ffe356小心肝儿1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A high-powered CEO puts her career and family on the line when she begins a torrid affair with her much-younger intern.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=65246&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Babygirl\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260525/1779697738949_9686016f2620401e2eee155c327315ffuWnBAqtQlSTTYUMehyvL9CoZrTq.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":144252,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260525/1779697728359_3a72a881d8f3bbffac2601858d1cbad071K5KFtqK514ALejimxXgf25j9p.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A forbidden love story between 18-year-old Noah and stepbrother Nick faces challenges as they pursue different paths - him in business, her at Oxford - while dealing with new relationships and secrets.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=144252&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Your Fault: London\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231025/1698220811433_fe7c99cb3dcd125f41c6d75a4846efceBurning Betrayal2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":38012,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231101/1698830967264_70552d181ac057ca19952269683d0ada叛我更幸福_.png\",\"introduction\":\"Babi discovers a betrayal by her long-term partner and decides to embark on a new adventure in life. On this journey, she meets judge Marco and they begin to live a story permeated by a lot of sexual tension.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=38012&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Burning Betrayal\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260430/1777538187284_a180864e96cdfccc08a1c1e3f853cdd41oJSeynxNfGJm83de6bi83LetZR.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":138045,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260430/1777538180216_f03e671f7ba8cdc55a93c1f049704d791oJSeynxNfGJm83de6bi83LetZR.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Shen is a woman from a wealthy family who enters into a seemingly perfect marriage with Phoem, a promising government officer. Their relationship begins with happiness, but things take a turn when Phoem leaves for an extended work assignment abroad.\\n\\nDuring his absence, Shen faces constant pressure and mistreatment from her mother-in-law. The difficult environment leaves her emotionally drained, holding on only to the hope of her husband’s return. However, when Phoem comes back, he is no longer the same person. His cold and distant behaviour deepens Shen’s loneliness.\\n\\nIn this vulnerable state, she finds comfort in Tone, a driver whose presence brings emotional support and complicates her situation.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=138045&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":37,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 4\",\"rankId\":108,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Whisper of Desire\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"18+\",\"sort\":1}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260415/1776232128945_551660f0bd29f707afb5e2cc195ed5233ANXZWhhcqPAh0q6nRZ979TIwxC.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":134108,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260415/1776232884490_8f538e1269ff6af2d325e6c6ea97d549tcPc5ZMBO4y2BtCJMe3o2nwZb2B.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A college-set romantic drama chronicling the unexpected love story between a music student and the university's star hockey player, exploring themes of love and the complexities of adulthood through deep friendships and enduring bonds.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=134108&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":25,\"rankDesc\":\"Romance list Top 1\",\"rankId\":53,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Sports\",\"Sex\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Off Campus Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260610/1781072913557_0dbe2d4b7d2352a7df48437f6221776apNenAgAq7rObNflDgifLxq62Vjx.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":148682,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260610/1781072909503_d7add06904fb64191ee305b5594a93e0nZGf0jnSJNXLf8o7iSzzX8qxHX9.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Two lifelong friends explore the enduring question - what if your first love was destined to be your soulmate? A sweeping romantic tale about love's timeless possibiliti\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=148682&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":25,\"rankDesc\":\"Romance list Top 4\",\"rankId\":53,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Every Year After\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250213/1739426530699_928069c08e26bfaad9d64aa09e1f85cdaf7HqyI1CSxV2febOcIxyMLLFbl.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":72138,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250213/1739429971999_b77c1fd1236e87d961d194a9c6ccbde2bioObjvmJdDRxnWM3TrQYaMUbAQ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"An 18-year-old girl moves from America to London with her mother and wealthy stepfather. She meets her stepbrother, and an attraction brews despite their efforts. Unaware, her estranged father tracks her down after release from prison\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=72138&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"My Fault: London\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251128/1764296663197_5f0e1a17f0e48a5f068cc887e1c506a8w0kz3oP6QJ1aqnX1QMgmv647MzN.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":115940,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251128/1764296654077_fe7f5fed2f3b9f77d8ae4c9cabb4f4d1iJ5xtuhWQ2L7MZC9d09iimkyWPc.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Kamila's life turns upside down when the Di Bianco brothers return after 7 years. Thiago gave her first kiss, Taylor was her protector. Now she's changed, but they still have a way of getting through to her like no one else can.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=115940&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Tell Me Softly\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250107/1736237476026_a0aa0008c0749c25ff0dd73aaaeb44fbHidden Face2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":66730,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250107/1736237474232_afc0230dd0391f600d882610a0010e9bHidden Face1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"About one entering lover's secret room to confirm their love and got unexpectedly trapped.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=66730&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":4,\"rankDesc\":\"Asia list Top 3\",\"rankId\":147,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Hidden Face\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240522/1716346594252_3c1088a43dff08039b23d67f5793c2d44JV19qiBKJuFv9ZvgtKD75nYME6.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":44255,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240611/1718087471419_cabd5288695a3a26479a0582bb3d62f5不再沉默 第一季.png\",\"introduction\":\"A 17-year-old student's life takes a huge turn when she hangs on the school's facade a billboard saying 'Careful: Rapist hiding here'.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=44255&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Raising Voices Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632804639223_a1d08e9077fdc90cdaae6227dde9f16clQq04q5TtgOb8yA4yhHAhNuTOLv.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2771,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220908/1662625741981_20d9b82a1a3c95f13d8cda6026bf9e241.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Based on Anna Todd's novel, AFTER follows Tessa (Langford), a dedicated student, dutiful daughter, and loyal girlfriend to her high-school sweetheart, as she enters her first semester in college armed with grand ambitions for her future. Her guarded world opens up when she meets the dark, mysterious Hardin Scott (Tiffin), a magnetic, brooding rebel who makes her question all she thought she knew about herself and what she wants from life.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2771&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"After\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220211/1644571686543_7759243757a65d52fedbb442a856d230解禁恋爱.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":11261,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220209/1644402191439_0efa198ff12100dda35c4c07acb82449解禁男女11261竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"Love never hurt so good for two co-workers who enter a contractual relationship as partners in consensual play, pleasure and pain.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=11261&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Love and Leashes\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250925/1758763941730_644e4cd90cf5d3452b0a9eea7c604b78pdcsJIXelp3vo7xsqK16KzYB8Sy.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":108754,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250925/1758763922961_57e265753ade6716c757ff26fcacff15yzqHt4m1SeY9FbPrfZ0C2Hi9x1s.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Jenna and Lion's wedding brings about the long-awaited reunion between Noah and Nick after their breakup. Nick's inability to forgive Noah stands as an insurmountable barrier. He, heir to his grandfather's businesses, and she, starting her professional life, resist fueling a flame that's still alive. But now that their paths have crossed again, will love be stronger than resentment?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=108754&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Our Fault\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250512/1747033467244_f988ea3973dac6870e6674667bbe63152.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":90099,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250512/1747033465512_17f54ae43df1dee6ecc6186dcb78fad01.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"An orphan boy and a pampered rich-kid girl are trying to uncover secrets of the past to save their romance and their skin.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=90099&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Mala influencia\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230614/1686709531057_24e5d052ce61bb87df7923cd64ae231epNOccytgkGuyofTLmh1sqEfTJuE.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":34618,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230612/1686538244070_2c10854a04a43d576f015593d76175de7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Noah has to leave her town, boyfriend and friends behind and move into the mansion of her mother's new rich husband. Their she meets Nick, her new stepbrother. They secretly fall in love madly.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=34618&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211008/1633682501303_c232f8415c36a8328c6688581c50044e新月 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2983,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211008/1633682497267_e133cf70fd2bd3e78784d7a3588b689f新月 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After Bella recovers from the vampire attack that almost claimed her life, she looks to celebrate her birthday with Edward and his family. However, a minor accident during the festivities results in Bella's blood being shed, a sight that proves too intense for the Cullens, who decide to leave the town of Forks, Washington for Bella and Edward's sake. Initially heartbroken, Bella finds a form of comfort in reckless living, as well as an even-closer friendship with Jacob Black. Danger in different forms awaits.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2983&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2009,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Twilight Saga: New Moon\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250324/1742800708946_e2a5e0819c477eea82cc1beee185c0c69qYD7pAOEdYBoQblv5VAMMSVAC8.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":81094,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250324/1742800706066_1f54699bc01fdaf6617d3a6afdcee4c2gZQU8BtCH2IbMZq6QETiU4HXQSR.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Shaw has loved Rule since she saw him, but Rule doesn't see her as a suitable match, but a night of drinking and secrets leads them to question if they can be together without ruining their relationship...or each other.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=81094&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Marked Men\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"18+\",\"sort\":1}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221017/1665988317490_733d79514ade7b003ff01888239aa460agi2rXACfZd8gK2jqNVOAHR6ZTS.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2776,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241105/1730793763507_cef4ccc6c5fce358dc2b86250784b115p2611609840.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Massimo Torricelli, a young and handsome boss of a Sicilian Mafia family, has no other option but to take over after his father has been assassinated. Laura is a sales director in a luxurious hotel in Warsaw. She has a successful career, but her private life lacks passion. She is taking one last shot to save her relationship. Together with her bone-headed boyfriend, Martin and some other friends, she takes a trip to Sicily. She does not expect that Massimo, the most dangerous man on the island, will get in her way, kidnap her, hold her captive and give her 365 days - to fall in love with him.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2776&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":3.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Sex\",\"adult\"],\"title\":\"365 Days\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230614/1686709786396_64af1cd3582b955bfc04233f838b481ezpY97OUNunOAPIxXYO4ZUGl7fnK.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":22264,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220719/1658200586663_dc3e5077d40a9cc09ba4f203f11dff70clAMlA3DcwKMJIYeAFGGN0vyJQp.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Cassie Salazar and Luke Morrow couldn't be more different. Sharp-witted Cassie works nights at a bar in Austin, Texas to make ends meet while pursuing her dream of becoming a singer/songwriter. Luke is an Army trainee, about to ship out for duty, who finds comfort in the unswerving discipline of service. But a chance encounter at Cassie's bar changes the course of both their lives. Cassie is drowning in medical bills after being diagnosed with diabetes.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=22264&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Musical\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Purple Hearts\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240407/1712457449238_09c389ba8349285a3ad2ac68a3ec054a竖.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":42763,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240407/1712457439413_1649213043374efc86a3a74cb6889bf5横.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Sometimes our greatest fear is accepting that someone can honestly love us for who we are. Nica and Rigel are ready to find it out together.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=42763&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Tearsmith\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240619/1718776389100_7f8652d16f6501015167d3eb54678e1ciulA80d5u4oDHzFUrGOzF1kqUhZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":45698,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240619/1718783182067_9e489dc19cb618abd7f7c3d1fd68148dp2909365194.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Oh Wan Soo reached the top of her sport as a golf player. Dreaming of having a perfect life within the upper class, she marries the successor of the Hwain Group. Now, Wan Soo works as the chairperson for a foundation and has gained worldwide fame through her charity work. She has Seo Do Yoon as her new bodyguard. Do Yoon, who graduated from the police university, excels in the martial arts. He joined the Hwang Group's security team for a specific reason. Through her bodyguard, Wan Soo faces a secret of the Hwain Family.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=45698&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Red Swan\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220216/1644978077383_888d6fa7aa6be013c683fe4f72fd01815OJOKbjjuX4Wt8oLanWqa56NCMv.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":12339,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220901/1662024459179_b33e5bc79c76eabb0886138f63860ab93.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"As assistants to the co-CEOs of a publishing company, Lucy Hutton and Joshua Templeman sit across from each other every day - and they hate each other. Not dislike. Not begrudgingly tolerate. H-A-T-E. Lucy can't understand Josh's joyless, uptight approach to his job and refusal to smile, which is in stark contrast to her bright clothes, quirkiness, and effusive people-pleasing. Trapped in a shared office 5 days a week, they've become entrenched in an addictive, ridiculous never-ending game of one-upmanship. Lucy can't let Josh beat her at anything - especially when a huge new promotion to be Managing Director is up for grabs. They strike a deal that whoever does not get the promotion must quit. It's game-on - But as tensions reach boiling point and an innocent elevator ride turns into a steamy kiss, Lucy begins to realize just how fine a line there is between love and hate.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12339&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Hating Game\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240311/1710126861724_21df287c866fc6ad7749bf118e8a8230pk5ibyxRfwhqJSjzjCwlP0hadHE.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":42031,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240311/1710126857799_0a964d798c1c9f76a4f7b6f8173b34dfY5P4Q3q8nrruZ9aD3wXeJS2Plg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Solène, a 40-year-old single mom, begins an unexpected romance with 24-year-old Hayes Campbell, the lead singer of August Moon, the hottest boy band on the planet.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=42031&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Idea of You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250704/1751618332596_015ea09233547629314ef6f9f066e632lfCcFJop7ORb10pvrBnTZsc0Bqo.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":97584,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250704/1751618322188_a91bd01dac2c2075eef538bfd83c7ed6hpPG14pFqGMS2FLvAWDtzGL7sUr.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Evelyn wakes up in Vegas married to rock star David after blacking out on her 21st birthday. Thrust into his fame, she questions if she can handle his lifestyle as they navigate if their marriage is real or a mistake.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=97584&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"lick\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230614/1686712187755_53db7cd4bcd20917f4426b1282f85852jYNapxT1L5pgqgdzCwatsN7op2q.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":33595,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230518/1684400478114_915f0a7d105dcf7a464be1c088c2d075c0Zk5EurIkqMo4n89WWjBl4UtIi.png\",\"introduction\":\"Teen matchmaker Kitty Song Covey thinks she knows everything there is to know about love. But when she moves halfway across the world to reunite with her long-distance boyfriend, she'll soon realize that relationships are a lot more complicated when it's your own heart on the line.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33595&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"XO, Kitty\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"疯狂世界\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":85336,\"homeSectionName\":\"Crazy World\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230628/1687919638646_6482b1901c4b7d983f7e5ced7b3a93e2疯狂元素城剧照.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":35098,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230815/1692078851869_02a4d0ae112fb78c7bcc6de89b6007efhIf8BUYEozn8Ox7iFm7AjUgfNgK.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Follows Ember and Wade, in a city where fire-, water-, land- and air-residents live together.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=35098&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Elemental\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241106/1730863230668_1dac74175e6b58378df941260c009a696cXqnUlCklzV52kqyn3EEqDonyM.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":54653,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241106/1730863227964_a41068c9a321bed5e48bc8e4749cc7b8yh64qw9mgXBvlaWDi7Q9tpUBAvH.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After receiving an unexpected call from her wayfinding ancestors, Moana journeys to the far seas of Oceania and into dangerous, long-lost waters for an adventure unlike anything she has ever faced.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=54653&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Musical\"],\"title\":\"Moana 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211202/1638429732748_767585ef8b479b5ee4bec3227a42e41cmCVQ2cZmGkAHG2Q3fDZTQA1YzeI.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":4137,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211022/1634872289767_1a377a0d444ace6f1b6a1269303699d5gLhHHZUzeseRXShoDyC4VqLgsNv.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The story revolves around sub-zero heroes: a woolly mammoth, a saber-toothed tiger, a sloth and a prehistoric combination of a squirrel and rat, known as Scrat.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=4137&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2002,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"title\":\"Ice Age\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211202/1638425379610_73a9b4085e4ebc05c1a4b454b29bf384mAkPFEWkwKz9nmKyCiuETfTdpgX.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3900,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211020/1634715293869_56d3201ed84407397d4832b26f4d16e7w9kR8qbmQ01HwnvK4alvnQ2ca0L.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Woody, Buzz Lightyear and the rest of the gang embark on a road trip with Bonnie and a new toy named Forky. The adventurous journey turns into an unexpected reunion as Woody's slight detour leads him to his long-lost friend Bo Peep. As Woody and Bo discuss the old days, they soon start to realize that they're two worlds apart when it comes to what they want from life as a toy\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3900&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"Animated Film list Top 4\",\"rankId\":200,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Toy Story 4\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638343349711_51887ed2f24818d9bf4ba5b725ac637fwFN8llYh215M8i2fqWAcPV8CSyL.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1765,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210916/1631775805550_53c734f25899d37a44385d1c78bb2c87o7Y2GeSpBCRKJMya8TEYuDeF80Z.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After their cave is destroyed, a caveman family must trek through an unfamiliar fantastical world with the help of an inventive boy.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1765&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The Croods\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250521/1747814652060_c9a5a0af50a8a6eee75e28562cf3972f7nfpkR9XsQ1lBNCXSSHxGV7Dkxe.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":91887,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250521/1747814645778_dc8b2b6a94af1b7a919bb7af614fd37cp5l2vKfXCXDY8U2vC5VO5QwICfK.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Brave rabbit cop Judy Hopps and her friend, the fox Nick Wilde, team up again to crack a new case, the most perilous and intricate of their careers.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=91887&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Zootopia 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221116/1668593191117_c1635e5f5fe741dab9b80c0eb1d5cea2疯狂动物城+ 剧集 27067横版.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":27067,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221109/1667982984627_6521050a0be1f2fdccf8cc2ae8e81b56zoopia.png\",\"introduction\":\"The adventures of the creatures of the most incredible metropolis: Zootopia.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=27067&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Family\",\"Musical\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Zootopia+\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211105/1636095830913_5794a37d508ea8d177f149a0f58f49e2mIpCxBWNz6SHCQBe2K2PFr5MB7f.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1744,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211105/1636095828330_fe05266ecc77bbd9a0804f0038b90009y7thwJ7z5Bplv6vwl6RI0yteaDD.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A look at the relationship between Mike Wazowski (Billy Crystal) and James P. \\\"Sully\\\" Sullivan (John Goodman) during their days at Monsters University, when they weren't necessarily the best of friends.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1744&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Monsters University\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211105/1636090704163_cbff2bdfa507a89a0ed5ba4633effe67wf9C6iqY9tXG7TrQDg3E4Flgap7.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":5629,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211105/1636090703360_f7bc569862719e858a35e520da7aab60lW0kUtXTOVlHTVhDO2VzNBACAHX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a world of anthropomorphic animals, koala Buster Moon owns a theater, having been interested in show business since his father took him to his first music show as a child. Following financial problems brought up by the bank representative Judith, he tells his wealthy friend Eddie that he will host a singing competition with a prize of $1,000. But Buster's assistant, Miss Crawly, accidentally appends two extra zeroes, and the promotional fliers showing $100,000 are blown out of Buster's office into the city streets.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5629&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Singing & Dancing\"],\"title\":\"Sing\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638354050039_fcee7793fa962a55bbb635318fe530ffpGK0oaeIVxpIroNHu1wDqXf4vv5.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3375,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638354046219_1f4ed6586ff17f762b5585a9266b2d95qjlbN6aK1qgeg3SspFVovT2D1Me.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A city of monsters with no humans called Monstropolis centers around the city's power company, Monsters, Inc. The lovable, confident, tough, furry blue behemoth-like giant monster named James P. Sullivan (better known as Sulley) and his wisecracking best friend, short, green cyclops monster Mike Wazowski, discover what happens when the real world interacts with theirs in the form of a 2-year-old baby girl dubbed \\\"Boo,\\\" who accidentally sneaks into the monster world with Sulley one night. And now it's up to Sulley and Mike to send Boo back in her door before anybody finds out, especially two evil villains such as Sulley's main rival as a scarer, chameleon-like Randall (a monster that Boo is very afraid of), who possesses the ability to change the color of his skin, and Mike and Sulley's boss Mr. Waternoose, the chairman and chief executive officer of Monsters, Inc\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3375&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2001,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Monsters, Inc.\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210915/1631699743808_7fb6d4b5f656553f6a8fd0d86b80d1ebp2fRZzxla6NoRbIH2KOZq0gHb5S.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2225,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221215/1671075218492_4206fbe4443fd38036d5b381e3ad0689tiCSE5oEGIaOtUQDe4ST48rc7cd.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"From the largest elephant to the smallest shrew, the city of Zootopia is a mammal metropolis where various animals live and thrive. When Judy Hopps becomes the first rabbit to join the police force, she quickly learns how tough it is to enforce the law. Determined to prove herself, Judy jumps at the opportunity to solve a mysterious case. Unfortunately, that means working with Nick Wilde, a wily fox who makes her job even harder.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2225&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Family\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Zootopia\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211214/1639454626769_846e0d52d8f735f2700fbd0ee1cdfd5a20pkC7yJdCV4J1IMKfsCT9QU7zV.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":8720,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240304/1709537725454_6ce981a5a14d88ec75952389c264b8f5ndTgVvcB2z0On48WOxMbD1KT1RX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Alice, an unpretentious and individual 19-year-old, is betrothed to a dunce of an English nobleman. At her engagement party, she escapes the crowd to consider whether to go through with the marriage and falls down a hole in the garden after spotting an unusual rabbit. Arriving in a strange and surreal place called \\\"Underland,\\\" she finds herself in a world that resembles the nightmares she had as a child, filled with talking animals, villainous queens and knights, and frumious bandersnatches. Alice realizes that she is there for a reason--to conquer the horrific Jabberwocky and restore the rightful queen to her throne.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=8720&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2010,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Alice in Wonderland\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632624760204_352d1ec35ce8b280b121036c06d7f280Big Hero 6.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1754,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220630/1656561772740_b7dff486a4310ac35b83c781ddc5d7af超能.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A special bond develops between plus-sized inflatable robot Baymax and prodigy Hiro Hamada, who together team up with a group of friends to form a band of high-tech heroes.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1754&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Big Hero 6\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251029/1761703553891_6e7aa5229ffafd88f6f7680814790de6l8pwO23MCvqYumzozpxynCNfck1.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":112309,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251029/1761703547224_7431fa8984a70aa855094ae65ebb9c4fsi9tolnefLSUKaqQEGz1bWArOaL.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After challenging the Wizard's totalitarian regime in Oz, Elphaba must grapple with her identity as the \\\"Wicked Witch of the West\\\". Meanwhile, the Wizard has given Glinda the title \\\"Glinda the Good\\\" and a public status as the nation's defender against Elphaba. The two witches must make decisions that seal their fates in this second musical installment.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=112309&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Singing & Dancing\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"捕风追影\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84490,\"homeSectionName\":\"The Shadow's Edge\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231117/1700211844340_97e53dab7759db1a12a8aa7b2099d1ad7.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":14225,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220318/1647573910871_5432fedd10e367120a264209049c3905hPl71oz4f3vkGCXSO3O3X84J78v.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A high-tech police surveillance team attempts to take down a gang of ruthless bank robbers.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=14225&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Cold Eyes\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220512/1652336710578_111d654ac25f7db67ba73a4e852b4161gT3LWL4TXCDZMD0bdV475LKeEAS.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":17870,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220512/1652336693142_8f6634f1b7e7417b792e6e15760681739QJ3cPpYgoPfhRnRPxpQUfx790r.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"An ex-special agent CHA Tae-shik's only connection to the rest of the world is a little girl, So-mi, who lives nearby. Her mother, Hyo-jeong smuggles drugs from a drug trafficking organization and entrusts Tae-shik with the product, without letting him know. The traffickers find out about her smuggling and kidnap both Hyo-jeong and So-mi. The gang promises to release them if Tae-shik makes a delivery for them, however it actually is a larger plot to eliminate a rival drug ring leader. When Hyo-jeon's disemboweled body is discovered, Tae-shik realizes that So-mi's life may also be in danger. Tae-shik becomes enraged at the prospect that So-mi may already be dead and prepares for a battle, putting his own life at risk.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=17870&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2010,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Man from Nowhere\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220325/1648191010317_b8d40a5a9b807745849b9aa4cc132c73iRLdQu0Tvd7KaoL8t4e4i8XtesD.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":14743,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221229/1672298235976_c7593ad7ebeaba9da384176a517aea4c8.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Ex intelligence agent Ki Heon is tasked with safely transporting Seo Bok, the first ever human clone, who holds the secret of eternal life. Several forces try to take control of Seo Bok to serve their own agendas.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=14743&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Seobok\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220218/1645148932126_5d46667307bcfbca6ee052b89b0caccednpSUzbvUy1sULcLddMMpUXsCAo.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":12456,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220218/1645148928611_0eb5d80b8d0101e228f655ca7162d2b7n5ESZzOGxnmugkLvyd45wOsn0mg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A group of spies, the 5446 Corps were trained by North Korean special forces since their youth, with a goal of unifying Korea. They are ambitiously dispatched to South Korea, where each disguises himself as a fool, an aspiring singer, and a high school student. Passing boring time without receiving any orders from the North, they gradually get used to life as ordinary neighbors in a small town. Due to the events of the Second Battle of Yeonpyeong, South Korea demands the names, location, and rank of 30 North Korean spies active in South Korea, promising financial aid to the North on the condition that Pyongyang turns in their spies. To prevent the elites from falling into enemy hands, the North Korean government orders dozens of active duty spies to take their own lives. Meanwhile, their North Korean army instructor Kim Tae-won crosses the border to eliminate those who refuse to comply.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12456&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Secretly Greatly\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250221/1740123640067_13fd586a5fc5c1c0744d7c2a15f67b4b哈尔滨2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":74535,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250221/1740123618282_02a22338813fd4cb8990a55b4242cb3c哈尔滨1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Follows Korean independence activists who launched a daring attack in Harbin against the Japanese to gain their country's independence.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=74535&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Harbin\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220524/1653379717604_8326ddc76b50e1d14bf01abb63988871g3hni0i9iAQ13jDGOFWavJFlojc.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":18831,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230104/1672827188261_02d03f31fdc5028122acafd0a076676a7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"An undercover MI6 agent is sent to Berlin during the Cold War to investigate the murder of a fellow agent and recover a missing list of double agents.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=18831&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2017,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Atomic Blonde\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241115/1731639303658_adaba14367da249f5d9b4fae58c78e1bpx0YfXxWKclI0PVM79fOV6Kh2As.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":55403,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241115/1731639299850_6df77c6d16ecb771c6d024a9208db8f55ktud4Nq5kCoBfajghqVHxYSDLg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Former CIA spies Emily and Matt are pulled back into espionage after their secret identities are exposed.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=55403&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"Back in Action\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240821/1724210928733_b6f2ccf16274c2d1f1ea678e797c59c2横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":49649,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240821/1724210924887_aecac5bd32d996781e109d4a7f3d086f竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Loid Forger, an elite spy, is warned by his handler that he may potentially be reassigned from his ongoing mission, Operation Strix. To maintain his position, he must make significant progress toward the operation's objectives, which involves having his adoptive daughter Anya earn sufficient Stella Stars to become an Imperial Scholar at Eden Academy.\\n\\nAfter learning of a cooking contest that awards the winning student with a Stella Star, Loid researches the judge's preferred dessert to help increase Anya's odds. However, perfectly recreating the judge's favorite meremere requires more than just following a recipe. Thus, the Forgers embark on a vacation to the Frigis region to try an authentic meremere. Not all goes smoothly on the trip, as the Forger family ends up entwined in a sinister plot to reignite war between the countries of Ostania and Westalis.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=49649&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"SPY×FAMILY CODE: White\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"热门动漫\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":22241,\"homeSectionName\":\"Popular Anime \",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211208/1638935650610_761ad4afdf14d955a528348b0bb306echYC6uetTLSqbLZ3dFY0IfXWhl93.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":8220,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211208/1638935645297_5e085567f2757d578a4bdb7a91a1bc38fcXdJlbSdUEeMSJFsXKsznGwwok.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"There once lived a pirate named Gol D. Roger. He obtained wealth, fame, and power to earn the title of Pirate King. When he was captured and about to be executed, he revealed that his treasure called One Piece was hidden somewhere at the Grand Line. This made all people set out to search and uncover the One Piece treasure, but no one ever found the location of Gol D. Roger's treasure, and the Grand Line was too dangerous a place to overcome. Twenty-two years after Gol D. Roger's death, a boy named Monkey D. Luffy decided to become a pirate and search for Gol D. Roger's treasure to become the next Pirate King.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=8220&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":1999,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":1177,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":8.8,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"One Piece\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260624/1782279971218_090fe5571591d13ffb3f87443d80c34a无职转生Ⅲ 到了异世界就拿出真本事M.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":152256,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260624/1782279964598_44ea07edbf93a9ef5e6ae47b6a6e560b无职转生Ⅲ 到了异世界就拿出真本事.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Third season of Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=152256&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":3,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774516873487_1460a274f0ec310238f336b9dd629a28eJOy7YWAHgOS3V477sdTsq4v9jp.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131485,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774516866561_9ecbe981d2ba94333fe22cfa9f7d38d5155735l.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Demon Lord Rimuru's dream of creating an alliance between humans and monsters takes a step closer to being realized. As Tempest continues to prosper, Granville Rozzo and his granddaughter, Maribel Rozzo, clash with Demon Lord Rimuru over their plan to protect mankind by ruling over them. Meanwhile, in El Dorado, Demon Lord Leon works toward goals of his own. The awakening of a new Hero draws near!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131485&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"Hot-blooded list Top 2\",\"rankId\":133,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime Season 4\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260319/1773906510413_b4066984e9efe79048cf601dd72e71c3aSnG7CDiVUkxhngsq6cL6baLuHH.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":130720,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260405/1775321326832_aff3fe07854417ba25551234e27322eb黄泉的使者.webp\",\"introduction\":\"In an isolated village, two twins were born, separated by day and night. It is years later, and while the older brother Yuru has become a hunter of animals, his sister Asa has been locked away in a cage, ordered to perform a special duty that prohibits her from meeting more than a few select individuals.\\n\\nOn an otherwise inconspicuous day, a group of armed men riding in helicopters, referred to as \\\"dragons\\\" by the citizens, assaults the village in search of Yuru, killing every adult on sight. When Yuru attempts to meet up with Asa and flee, he finds a dead body instead—on top of that, the person who killed her claims to be Yuru's true twin sister.\\n\\nBefore the woman can capture him, Yuru is rescued by a man named Dera, an outsider who frequently visits the village. However, it is not long before the two are cornered. In a last-ditch effort, Dera makes Yuru give a gift to the deity of the village, summoning a pair of daemons whose existence is bound to reveal the truth behind these chaotic events.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130720&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"Hot-blooded list Top 3\",\"rankId\":133,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Daemons of the Shadow Realm\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260325/1774425204352_43fab0890711a07386ee5d0623d91948p2925027418.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131298,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260325/1774425197292_5c06e30b91447979ed7d3897083903achM00JrQlrfI0wTSweYDMLUMcv8u.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Will Serfort dreams of keeping his promise to a childhood friend by becoming a Magia Vander, one of the mighty magicians who sit atop the Wizard's Tower. However, he is unable to cast even the simplest of spells, leaving him to fight dungeon monsters to earn credits at Regarden Magical Academy. As if that weren't enough, he finds himself putting his sword skills to the test against a bullying professor!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131298&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Wistoria: Wand and Sword Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782371456848_e87576f3b3110b92ee5ac11b5c7b15c52.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":152767,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782371452775_5f23052c0eb7f03f775f418ce56957311.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Monsters overtook 80% of the world, and people in Hexaldoria received Classes at birth. Kouji Kagami, a Villager—the weakest Class—reached the unprecedented Level 999. When he met the Demon King's daughter, everything changed.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=152767&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 4\",\"rankId\":18,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":4,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"The Villager of Level 999\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782375999451_6cfabbc7bf2fc141d6528e00bd1fd4f0ceirDIa8QgeeiFKFnLcQpfAH5V7.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":152839,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782375995583_a0784c5fd5c4f8031aa6d08d6270975cwwVm2Mnpm210b5cDpGgwOO96KLg.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Seventeen-year-old Jirou Azuma lives a quiet life with his grandfather, utilizing his supernatural ability to speak with animals to befriend and protect them. Both Jirou and his grandfather are descendants of a long-standing shinobi clan, training in combat to keep the art of battle alive within their family. Jirou's life is thrown into upheaval after rescuing a seemingly normal black cat, Ragou, only to discover that the cat is actually a mononoke—a demonic spirit that has long been at war with mankind. When a hostile mononoke comes looking for Ragou, Jirou uses his shinobi training to jump to the cat's defense, but immediately suffers a mortal wound.\\n\\nFaced with the decision of whether or not to devour Jirou's fading energy and restore himself to full power, Ragou instead chooses to give his remaining energy to Jirou. Reviving the boy, the transfer also grants him great supernatural powers that complement his own shinobi fighting style. This act is witnessed by Ryousuke Shiba, an officer in the Bureau of Espionage whose job revolves around dispatching aggressive mononoke. Shiba extends Jirou and his grandfather an offer: to join the Bureau's new squad, Black Torch, and help them battle powerful mononoke who seek to devour innocent people.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=152839&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"Black Torch\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782373998009_3d3e01e4acc49df52e23daf53abbb893filters_quality(95)format(webp) (1).webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":152804,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782373992724_2e622fb7f72f6790161a4b51def76c4ffilters_quality(95)format(webp) (1).webp\",\"introduction\":\"\\\"You're the bride I've been searching for all this time.\\\"\\n\\nA Japanese-style ayakashi Cinderella story! The ayakashi and humans coexist in harmony. The ayakashi, having superior abilities and beautiful appearances, sometimes find their partner among human women, making them their \\\"bride.\\\" The bride, in exchange for bringing prosperity, receives absolute love from the ayakashi.\\n\\nYuzu is constantly compared to her sister, a bride of a demon fox, and is resented by her family every day. One day, when Yuzu just couldn't take things anymore, a man appeared before her on a bridge. This man is the most beautiful man Yuzu has ever seen... and he's calling her his wife?!\\n\\n\\\"Just be quiet and let me hold you.\\\" The most powerful, \\\"cold-hearted\\\" ayakashi is pouring his heart out for Yuzu?!\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=152804&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Ogre's Bride\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260629/1782717970833_8aee85a46f6a3cabf1e628d79bd5698bxuq0kl6BOlEtjJOG6FCjoGJuqqK.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":153493,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260629/1782717966423_9619dcc544a004aef78938c0ca3991edxuq0kl6BOlEtjJOG6FCjoGJuqqK.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Undercover behind enemy lines, Jooheon's newest plan to torment TKBM will involve taking them down from the inside! Stealing their relics and causing infighting is just the tip of the iceberg on what he'll do to make the group pay for their sins. But with the appearance of the Tower of Pride, Jooheon's skills in rage-baiting will truly be tested as he must pit the most fearsome warlords against each other! Will Jooheon Suh come out on top in the battle of the greatest conquerors of history?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=153493&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 1\",\"rankId\":18,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"title\":\"Tomb Raider King\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260319/1773905449491_0b9eddce75b658d074a97851c4091038MV5BZTM3MThlM2MtNGQwZi00ZTE0LWI0YTgtZjA2MjZiZDMyOWJiXkEyXkFqcGdeQXNvbG5vbXM@._V1_.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":130714,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260319/1773905444901_2eea001fdc22de3551364f81d3e97e13FE7g7DyOHD2oRxRXV2WXI7UtNl.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Coco, a humble dressmaker's daughter, has always been fascinated by magic and the witches who cast it, despite the strict precautions they take to hide their methods from the public. However, when Coco takes advantage of a golden chance to spy on the skilled witch Qifrey, she realizes that her favorite picture book was a disguised magic book all along! In her excitement, she immediately starts testing out the various spells.\\n\\nWhen a spell causes a disaster in her home, Qifrey rescues her just in time and decides to train her, realizing that she is the first lead he has found that could help him track down the Brimmed Caps—a dangerous group of heretics who experiment with forbidden body-altering magic and spread magical artifacts among the commoners. But before Coco and Qifrey can confront the Brimmed Caps, she is going to have to improve her magical skills and learn to get along with Qifrey's other apprentices.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130714&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Atelier of Witch Hat\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774514781708_8b21450de2aae9d6ca9555042ca2857fg1p4w1DNYjWhnmwUiKrW80gVCMZ.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131458,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774514777603_89df76b9f23d8d0fdff59ed04cb41ffdrke9UC2QrogvxiQD9TGpbvqDosi.webp\",\"introduction\":\"nept at dealing with people, Koyuki Hikawa maintains a wall between herself and others. She spends her time in high school away from others, all alone. At least until she encounters Minato Amamiya who keeps closing the distance between them for some reason. The aloof Koyuki, the popular Miki, the boundary-less Minato, and the easygoing and kind basketball team member Youta. This is the story of these somewhat complicated four and their tantalizing, bumbling youth.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131458&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Ramparts of Ice\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774855945049_aec7ce3bb5c963ebf7562effa3e67acc2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131705,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774855941870_c00affd6589ba5b194019b34387689a01.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Gray, the god of war with unique power. One day, he fell asleep as usual. When he woke up, he came to a new world full of magic and monsters, and was reincarnated into a child named \\\"Arthur\\\". He is unable to trace the truth behind his death in his previous life, but rather than living in the past, he continues to work hard to adapt to this new life. As he grows older, Arthur's abilities gradually awaken, and he begins an adventure with new partners...!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131705&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The Beginning After the End Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774835143864_5fc06fd5f6a5966fce10c76849908bd82.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131647,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774835141107_8e423aff106b25bf27868813c36998971.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"As Ayanokouji and his classmates begin their second year at the Advanced Nurturing High School, they're greeted by a fresh gauntlet of exams and a fresh batch of rather unique first-year students. They'll have to get to know each other quickly, because the first special exam pairs the first-years with the second-years on a written test—with only the second-years facing expulsion if their team performs poorly! Worse yet? It seems one of the new first-years is also from the White Room. Can Ayanokouji avoid expulsion while sussing out the identity of this hidden foe?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131647&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"Classroom of the Elite IV\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260325/1774423321790_4ac04109b5d9f1218b700c7b2c921613wvqUN75YWAqFMq6pNzrwaPK76Nq.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131285,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260325/1774423317355_be4da2bd0628c01476ba1868b85c1ac5i1RaaFQUSGfx48CavoBRqeloLYb.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Juuzou Oogami is a legendary hitman who has never failed an assignment, no matter how impossible. One day, after wiping out a powerful organization, he is stung by a mysterious wasp and collapses. When he wakes up, the fearsome 39-year-old assassin has been transformed into a 13-year-old boy!\\n\\nBefore he can even process what happened, his boss delivers a new order: \\\"In that body, infiltrate a middle school.\\\" What awaits him is an unexpected school life filled with colorful classmates, youthful chaos, and looming danger. Can Juuzou ever return to his original form? Or will the assassins closing in on him end his second life before it even begins!?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131285&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Anime\",\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"Kill Blue\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260327/1774589667087_4c48ae56bf3f61f835c84098c3512de49xpmB050xiiG1OD51Qf7SyUz6MC.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131541,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260327/1774589608188_dc57ee74b89f511e94bf938401ff6e269xpmB050xiiG1OD51Qf7SyUz6MC.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Second season of Isekai Nonbiri Nouka.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131541&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Farming Life in Another World Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774857373089_238374e4ea4aca1e39dea788e1142dfb2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131709,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774857369776_78b194c0c5f1c61b956358cf842793e21.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Hibiki, a high school student who was suddenly transferred to another world, wanders alone in a vast grassland of a fantasy world where monsters inhabit. All he has are non-combat skills such as \\\"Appraisal\\\"! From a hopeless situation, he is saved by encounters, and his all-powerful abilities blossom! An another world adventure tale of miraculous reversal cheats burst forth!\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131709&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"The Strongest Job is Apparently Not a Hero or a Sage, but an Appraiser (Provisional)!\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774516058374_12232071007614c17887e0e71c7b0a34p2927686271.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131471,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260326/1774516051741_56c10d379dac077e3cf014103b47a008p2930437893.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Third part of Dr. Stone: Science Future.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131471&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Dr. Stone: Science Future Part 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240410/1712732204218_2af536d3054e6475f5eab354c082e556pVxHzLWKUOqR3RrSj2Sxwm2QNgB.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":42963,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241230/1735531382786_4e0747abb8a69bf17cc925a56b6c4b32我独自升级第二季.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a world of gifted hunters and monsters, a weak hunter Sung Jinwoo gains extraordinary powers through a mysterious program, leading him to become one of the strongest hunters and conquering even the strongest dungeons.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=42963&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":20,\"rankDesc\":\"Romance list Top 4\",\"rankId\":132,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Solo Leveling Season 2 Arise from the Shadow\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251219/1766122600570_2d97f1d6c6e14f4d6ac92ccd8f7f3d9f2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":119016,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251219/1766122588730_e7ac45608812138407040c9611f71b192.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The protagonist of \\\"Magic Return 0\\\", the super magician Yuta Otoko will join the battle in \\\"Death Return\\\". He will appear as an executioner, facing each other with the sword of knotweed. Polygonum cuspidatum and Yigu, they were taught by the same person, and they were both \\\"burdened with a curse\\\".\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=119016&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Jujutsu Kaisen: The Culling Game Part 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251230/1767088915368_fe321158316110114d56b822e5e6b24bvjiIuR3XGpoGSumQ7DziPAmxIYR.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":121277,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260116/1768529064899_0181bc0abc818e3f59ba2a8a674873dd1FX1Jzz9L8LPaAIYfBk2HU4m6ej.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Second season of Jigokuraku.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=121277&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"Hell's Paradise Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260328/1774689683404_884d924247487e981e1da61f6fab85dbzAUTsmMLC7JrQCaS7vj3SBFoQvw.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":131635,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260328/1774689678699_571ba7ea5d483c8692867fcaaf6a6ec2zAUTsmMLC7JrQCaS7vj3SBFoQvw.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Second season of Otonari no Tenshi-sama ni Itsunomanika Dame Ningen ni Sareteita Ken.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131635&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Angel Next Door Spoils Me Rotten Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260119/1768787370948_9c4db6a2df464005339b5a8ae44aca47khbFm3O9JwA8MuoH1svdOo4OWAB.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":119031,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260119/1768787366836_3a5e269a330cc5c7a950d3b50d14cf08cHhJzdUGcEBq6av4wr9jsIvUITH.webp\",\"introduction\":\"In a world where the Demon King was defeated by the hero Himmel and his companions, Frieren, an elf mage who has lived for over a thousand years and helped bring peace alongside Himmel and his group, sheds tears upon Himmel's death and, driven by her emotions, embarks on a journey to \\\"understand the human heart.\\\" Along the way, she meets Fern, a mage raised by her former comrade Heiter, and Stark, a warrior who is the disciple of another former comrade, Eisen. Together, they journey towards the land where souls rest, \\\"Aureole.\\\" Their journey is filled with encounters with various people, battles against cunning demons and monsters, moments of tranquility, silliness, intensity, and profound emotion. Every moment, every experience, becomes an irreplaceable part of their journey. What awaits them at the end of this journey...?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=119031&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.3,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Frieren: Beyond Journey's End Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1767001664192_dce8d8165550b1025e265693245e2d59地狱模式 ～喜欢速通游戏的玩家在废设定异世界无双～W.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":121006,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1767001656329_2014c58af6bd9585a3fe4565a14e9c9e地狱模式 ～喜欢速通游戏的玩家在废设定异世界无双～.webp\",\"introduction\":\"\\\"Level up even while offline?! That's not a game on 'easy mode'—that's just an AFK game!\\\" The online game Kenichi Yamada had been playing religiously is shutting down its servers, leaving him with a void in his heart. He looks for a new game to fill it, but everything he finds is way too easy. The kind of game he likes—the kind punishing enough to make players want to spend thousands of hours on it—just isn't around anymore.\\n\\n\\\"What's this? 'You are invited to a game that will never end.'\\\" Kenichi stumbles upon an untitled game, one promising incomparable challenge with unprecedented potential. Without hesitation, he selects the \\\"Hell Mode\\\" difficulty. Lo and behold, he finds himself reincarnated in another world as a serf! Now called Allen, he sets out to unlock the secrets of his mystery-laden Summoner class; without the convenience of walkthroughs, game guides, or online forums, he must grope his way to the top of his new world!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=121006&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Hell Mode: The Hardcore Gamer Dominates in Another World with Garbage Balancing\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1767003139303_4aa13f0ddcb1fe4ea78f9bb5cdfa0b5b转生之后的我变成了龙蛋U.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":121017,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260115/1768472967068_4cf4aa0021e42aa5d022efd763302077iPMmOoyHEMUW4l5FAnox8lQmBjh.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Our hero wakes up one day in a brand new world…but his new life doesn’t come with fighting skills or magic powers, or even arms and legs! He’s reborn as a helpless egg, stuck in an unfamiliar forest surrounded by terrifying, hungry beasts. But eggs hatch, hatchlings grow up, and humble beginnings can lead to something great. He’ll do his best to become the strongest dragon ever, and no measly shell will get in his way!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=121017&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Reincarnated as a Dragon Hatchling\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766986426355_430b939a40156c104c4afebb2340a5af横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":120826,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766986421238_be6e2819cbf13b38e87f23de2d0343a8竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"\\\"Orn Doula, today will be your last day in the party.\\\"\\n\\nOrn, once a skilled Swordsman, had adapted to the role of Enchanter to fill a crucial gap in the Hero Party. However, one day, the party leader abruptly dismisses him, claiming his skills are lacking. Brander a \\\"weakling\\\" and a \\\"jack of all trades, master of none,\\\" by his former comrades, Orn is cast out without a second thought.\\n\\nDetermined to start anew, he returns to adventuring—this time as a Swordsman, the role he originally excelled in. But his time as an Enchanter was far from wasted. The experience, knowledge, and countless original spells he developed in the Hero Party have forged him into a warrior unlike any other. Now, armed with an unconventional set of skills, Orn is ready to carve his own path—one that will prove his true strength to the world.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=120826&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Jack-of-All-Trades, Party of None\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251230/1767084353261_8a10884d5ba6dd38256132ca843fb4bfnKm1VW9tqghLfX5NZeQ7Gm2gSs0.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":121223,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251230/1767084349546_e97e4f36edd7a2a998efa6e4e455511dnKm1VW9tqghLfX5NZeQ7Gm2gSs0.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Noah, the world's strongest six-year-old, holds the fortunate position of being the Thirteenth Prince of the emperor. Born with an infinite level cap and a cheat skill that allows him to add the abilities of those he commands to his own, he is unmatched. Reincarnated into a noble family, Noah thrives in an environment enriched with exceptional education and abundant resources, allowing his talents to blossom. However, behind the glamorous facade of aristocratic society lurks a world of conspiracies and power struggles.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=121223&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Noble Reincarnation: Born Blessed, So I'll Obtain Ultimate Power\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766987077900_09d94f16936dd06eeb821a461638f9f0竖.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":120836,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766987071713_eee0f9c1737c701cd152413eb5aeb712竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Born blind, Kunon aims to be the first person to use water magic to create new eyes for himself. After five months of study, he has already surpassed his teacher, and continues to grow his talents. Not only can his magic help him sense color, but he can also use it to make handy items and even conjure a whole cat! Word of his skills and ingenuity soon reach the court and earn him a spot as disciple to the most powerful magician in the land. But is his ultimate goal even attainable?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=120836&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"Kunon the Sorcerer Can See\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766985978711_bdcb8a7a23f9629a422448b1a9b78905横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":120820,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766985973715_2a2496844fcf239810a2fd9cc9b425b3竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"\\\"Hero\\\" is the worst punishment in the world. Those convicted of heinous crimes are sentenced to become \\\"Heroes\\\" and forced to enter the mandatory military service in the war against the Demon Lords. These convicts are not even allowed to die—if killed, they will be resurrected to fight another day.\\n\\nHero Xylo Forbartz, former head of the Order of the Holy Knights, leads a penal unit of deplorables fighting on the front lines. It is in these direst of circumstances that he meets Teoritta, one of the world's strongest weapons. \\\"When every last enemy has been defeated, you are to shower me with praise and pat my head.\\\" In order to survive and to take revenge on those who wronged him, he makes a pact with the goddess and launches headfirst into a maelstrom of war and intrigue.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=120820&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"Sentenced to Be a Hero\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250924/1758691877311_119ce1f2df51b1758b793064f60acfc9p2917308961.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":108599,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250924/1758691870607_547ab522ff45dfb654eb6e7c9d989ffdp2919113540.webp\",\"introduction\":\"The story of Saitama, a hero that does it just for fun & can defeat his enemies with a single punch.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=108599&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Anime\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"One-Punch Man Season 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250926/1758877574031_be4a628933bd71b2bcfe0f109f078e9a横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Anime\",\"dramaType\":\"COMIC\"},\"id\":109060,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251013/1760343562751_026831686925284384885303e4532fa5pGNBYEae87H8iLRF3AoztonnZkp.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Betrayed and banished to a deadly dungeon, a man uses his summoning power to call forth powerful female warriors. After building his strength for three years, he prepares to return topside and exact vengeance on those who wronged him.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=109060&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.6,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\"],\"title\":\"My Gift Lvl 9999 Unlimited Gacha: Backstabbed in a Backwater Dungeon, I'm Out for Revenge!\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":31},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"暴力青年\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84461,\"homeSectionName\":\"High School of Passion\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221118/1668754373335_a662fc08e3652ed0d7513f4ce7d77482hj2YSkoqHB2FPHeoALfdd4eufue.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":28043,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221118/1668762712530_fe57892abebeb6057834e863b244a90fp2881967225.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Yeon Shi Eun is a model student, who ranks at the top at his high school. Physically, Yeon Shi Eun appears like a weak boy, but by using his smarts, tools, and psychology, he fights against violence that takes place inside and outside of his school.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=28043&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 10000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Weak Hero Class 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220321/1647829110423_15f2ebf08c009ad561612954be1ad1cb4n6LRU9BfueuhrB9wbtSrItT7hZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":14295,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220325/1648191238058_bb82574572b652c334dd41dad08f921f热血青春14295竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"A comedy romance movie about the last generation of youths and their passionate romance based in Hongseong, Chungcheong Namdo in the 1980's.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=14295&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Hot Young Bloods\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250108/1736325700426_60b13d242f4fd18e88c4a4482368ac2a学习小组.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":66936,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250108/1736325677343_b3ea05e8e6f95a39d973efd5298f94e7学习小组.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"It follows the life of student Yun Ga Min, who wants to be good at studying but is only good at fighting, as he forms a study group at the worst school on earth and tells a fierce story about college entrance exams.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=66936&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"Crime list Top 5\",\"rankId\":312,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Study Group\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231108/1699413592432_5b9281f58f3a18730d3ee44379158d0c1j9OuIQe4brFqowLHRsqGsuHUjB.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":38285,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231127/1701052536934_11eb694caa4e733c443fb386f8722b081S6nsQvYErXx8wH9TnSa0breFhJ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in the backdrop of the mid-to-late 1980s, the drama tells the story of students at an agricultural high school in Chungcheong Province. Jang Byung Tae is a small and weak boy living in Onyang in South Chungcheong Province. He is at the bottom of the school’s social ladder so he transfers to the neighboring Buyeo Agricultural High School. There, he faces an unexpected incident that becomes a turning point in his life.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=38285&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Once Upon a Boyhood\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250107/1736229238365_50ace3547f62ae4d55c414883541e529微信截图_20250107134821.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":66646,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250123/1737616402983_f5e99972e4968787243b03621fb1b59cAng mutya ng Section E.png\",\"introduction\":\"Jay-jay, the only girl in the mischievous Section E, hopes for a fresh start in high school but quickly becomes the target of her rowdy male classmates' pranks and schemes to make her leave. Dubbed their \\\"Mutya\\\", she fights back with wit and charm, turning the tables on her tormentors. Amidst the chaos, unexpected friendships blossom, and hilarious misunderstandings lead to heart-fluttering moments. Can Jay-jay survive the madness of Section E, or will she win over their hearts instead?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=66646&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Ang mutya ng Section E\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220519/1652934893959_3822f01ba94315cd84d8fcf22222e38df5xCw22fOR6DgDRCpDFGkPbKbmY.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":18378,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220818/1660806026359_4990e8c5cf6f9f80781fd206185f05581.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Jang Pan Su is a gang leader, and in a position of very high power. Kim Dong Hyeon is a high school student who gets bullied. When Kim Dong Hyeon gets into an accident with Jang Pan Su, they wake up in hospital to find out that their bodies have swapped.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=18378&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The Dude in Me\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240529/1716953266217_3044420613be30479ab8845fab7e747d120889102.1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":44762,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240612/1718178914986_9d57d2fa1c5e82c0ef94dc69f972ef76黑社会的我成为了高中生.png\",\"introduction\":\"Kim Deuk Pal is a 47-year-old gangster who is the #2 guy in his gang. He doesn't have an educational background due to his poor parents, but he dreams of attending a university. Deuk Pal has been studying to achieve his dream, but it's not easy. One day, he sees a young man, Song Yi Heon, about to kill himself. At that time, Deuk Pal's spirit possesses the body of the suicidal 19-year-old high school student. Deuk Pal soon learns that Yi Heon is a victim of bullying, which has caused him to want to take his own life.\\n\\nNow, in Yi Heon's body, Deuk Pal takes on the bullies to punish them and becomes friends with classmate Choi Se Kyung. Se Kyung is a model student who appears to be in a perfect situation but suffers from domestic violence at home by his father.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=44762&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"High School Return of a Gangster\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211123/1637632904626_33e1dbbefb74040131d77204154ffbb743FpZytJjlReDAPrByR77i81mnr.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":6971,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211122/1637582309540_d76dc9a054714e347e8b8feb4778d255vPzWMCAQJwte0nK1cX1GTtKHsCX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Suzuran Senior High School for Boys, nicknamed \\\"The School of Crows\\\", is the poorest achieving, most violent school in the country. The students are called \\\"crows\\\" and they band together in factions, battling each other for influence and power. But they all share a common goal, one that has never been reached in the school's history: unification. No one faction has ever reigned supreme. Genji Takiya, a transfer student who attempts to take over Suzuran Boys High School and is mentored by old boy yakuza Katagiri as he faces off against rival Serizawa.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6971&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2007,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Crows Zero\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211122/1637578854903_9a383bdaab2ed71fc2a9bd22dc258527kEQee6JM5EtDGMcofa75enQ2B45.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":6967,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211122/1637578851136_ecc29a71ff5fd7b270cc72384509c3f8m53V2l1A5imyTvXDlxltc49hZfU.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Sayaka Kudo is a gyaru who wears miniskirts and dyes her hair blonde. Although she is a 2nd year senior high school student, she is on par academically with 4th grade elementary school students. She frequently transfers between school because she is unable to make friends, and was once suspended for being caught with cigarettes. To prepare her for her university entrance examination, her mother decides to send her to Seiho Cram School. However, when the school director, Yoshitaka Tsubota, hears about Sayaka's academic problem, he makes it his personal achievement to help her enter the university of her choice, Keio University, a prestigious university that is considered one of the most difficult to enter in Japan. After her father labels her an \\\"air-head\\\", Sayaka became determined to study hard to prove her father wrong. Over the course of the summer holidays of her second year through to the exams at the end of her third year in senior high school, Sayaka studies extremely hard. She even removes her blond hair dye and cuts her hair to show her resolve. Her results progressively improves and her academic deviation value increases tremendously from 30 to 70 in this short span of time.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6967&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"title\":\"Flying Colors\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210915/1631677829667_90c3349637f72d203b99f7d7cca7967f31N42LhrxltHtS1bHYfZghjPDNB.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":1805,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210915/1631677826668_f1d92a47252f21f6836da28dc2f31d43sld43SJArZqlnANJabq8R5wdOZk.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After being bullied and discriminated because of her ugly looks, a high school girl transforms herself into a gorgeous \\\"goddess\\\" and quickly rises to fame after mastering the art of makeup via online tutorial videos.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1805&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 10000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"True Beauty\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220321/1647829275206_5d7b5187e50e8236fe0cd5e2c787c0b4kgKQi27zoaBbgpAFn4GLv6WQbZV.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":14296,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220321/1647829271842_995324a2881dab887bc9a0fe6bd91edcwy6kUVovsT2fUTHU96iVOF9P8MZ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A gifted swimmer rediscovers his talent by entering a competition against his long-time rival.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=14296&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Sports\"],\"title\":\"No Breathing\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231120/1700450372792_c4e3a86676752da9d7c8b912e36f12ca2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":38546,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231120/1700450330901_4380d9c3f457198b34beb4bc1414565b2.jpeg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The story of hero So Si Min, who once ruled the nation with her top-tier hapkido skills as a high school athlete. Seven years later, after becoming a part-time teacher, So Si Min finds herself the target of the evil student Han Soo Kang.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=38546&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Brave Citizen\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211129/1638173707221_31ab6183a7021145945b0a46b0d7bb0ds6k1teuMVH01038PhjpvgX4dmht.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":3313,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220808/1659939910972_b377f82f2e4d78f297dc147bed673a00企业微信截图_16599398168028.png\",\"introduction\":\"A unforgettable story about youth, friendship and love. Throught this drama the students at a sports college fight for their dreams and strive for success whilst juggling friendship and love at the same time. The two main characters go on a rollecoaster of emotions together along with many other of their friends. The drama follows all these students through their hardships and good times and reminds viewers to always care and support those who surround and care for you - Treat others the way in which you would like to be treated.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3313&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-Joo\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211119/1637303986247_8e2c5383467330407f001fe0b26500d4snrF3YkSzsmUacDUtURKzZYZOfh.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":6841,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211119/1637303976072_23411b7381c002f70e8aa70f7204ae16snrF3YkSzsmUacDUtURKzZYZOfh.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A School girl called Go Eun-Byul goes off on a schooltrip to Teongyeong. While in Teongyeong she meets her twin sister Lee Eun-Bi for the first time. Lee Eun-Bi is having a hard time in life and is considering suicide. Lee Eun-Bi replaces Go Eun-Byul's live after her dissapear and have to live like her and lie to everyone.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6841&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Who Are You: School 2015\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220722/1658476892836_1e8c2a2e9454826fab126860bb8e73507.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":22550,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220722/1658476888133_77620e080bed5ee9794d0b5aedd47db57.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Genji and his victorious G.P.S. alliance find themselves facing down a new challenge by the students of Hosen Academy, feared by everyone as 'The Army of Killers.' The two schools, in fact, have a history of bad blood between them. And the simmering embers of hatred are about to flare up again, burning away any last remnants of the truce they had so rigorously observed until now.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=22550&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2009,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"title\":\"Crows Zero 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240117/1705474808798_2fca1ccfc08a7e96c04fd923b24bb0fduksx1U7UKACy5feOHs6lgg2CUj8.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":40281,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240123/1705993435351_340546ac4a2e45ea687d9b60af512874真假学园.png\",\"introduction\":\"A teenage transfer student enrolls at an all-girls high school. Upon defending a fellow student during a schoolyard fight, her martial arts skills are revealed, and soon she must fight a series of fearsome opponents, each one tougher than the one before.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=40281&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2010,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"Majisuka Gakuen\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220930/1664528673212_ce1dece314233d1ef33ef92f738f4969复仇笔记 剧集 24222横版.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":24222,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221020/1666252394435_3695fad371c636f0c8c6625235ef99e0复仇笔记.png\",\"introduction\":\"Ho Goo Hee has spent her teen years getting picked on. When you say her full name, it sounds like the word for \\\"loser,\\\" HoGu. Her family is poor, so she also has to help out at their chicken shop. Plus, her boyfriend just broke up with her, and the famed \\\"Zombie Club\\\" bullies are not giving her space to breathe. The few kind faces Ho Goo Hee meets in school include Ji Hoon, the local nice guy who tries to help Goo Hee but isn't much for words, and Jung Duk Hee, a dorky fangirl who becomes Ho Goo Hee's only friend. Ho Goo Hee also gets full support from her brother, Ho Goo Jun, and his best buddy, singer Cha Eun Woo. One day, Ho Goo Hee discovers the seemingly magical \\\"Revenge Note\\\" app, which boasts the promise of delivering revenge to anyone whose name is entered into it. Sick of the bullying, she decides it's time for a little payback. But it doesn't take long for her sweet revenge to turn sour.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=24222&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2017,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Revenge Note\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211018/1634541298847_74d5da9ccdf5b193cfcfbe849829954dzv8uqdLsJzuVkZZYF7pr1DtSQei.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":3564,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211018/1634541296006_56bc558dca5f82edc1e974ba7ef2281dn4RX9QVXjHbMB31TDWqqRLjshgu.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Cha Eun Sang and her disabled mother both have to work hard, humiliating jobs, in order to support her older sister who's at university in America. Cha Eun Sang can't wait for her sister, who's her idol, to come back to Korea, and start earning money, so she can stop washing dishes and get a degree herself. However one day, Cha Eun Sang learns that her sister is about to get married, and realizes she'll never return to Korea, so she'll forever have to wash dishes. She resolves to go to America as well, and get better life. However, what she finds in America is far worse than she could ever imagine. Her sister is not only not getting married, but is also not at university, and is earning money working as a waitress, and maybe some shadier side jobs as well. After her sister notices her, they have a fight, she takes all of Cha Eun Sang's money and runs off, leaving her to cry and gather her broken dreams of the pavement. This entire exchange is observed by mysterious Kim Tan, who has completely different set of problems, but decides to take Cha Eun Sang's problems on, as well. At first reluctant to go with a guy who seems all to well acquainted with LAPD, she agrees to go with him simply so to not spend the night on the street. Kim Tan who is same age as her, leaves with no parents around, in a big, luxurious house, which makes her immediately assume he's a drug dealer. Instead of calming her down, he suggest he might also be dealing in human organs to support this life style. Meanwhile in Korea, we see group of privileged, spoiled high schoolers, the future 1% of Korean society, who all seem to be familiar with Kim Tan, and not many of them are fond of him. One of these is Choi Young Do, tall, handsome genius, with rancid personality, who learns that before getting his own stately resorts, he'll first be getting same aged, equally beautiful and \\\"pleasant\\\", step sister, Rachel Yoo, who's also engaged to be married to none other but his arch enemy, Kim Tan.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3564&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Heirs\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220315/1647315386676_f963aec4dfb546a22a6a9593fe3520cdqph3c3QKAMsljHM7S0tI25MlQkD.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":14003,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220824/1661310196505_c6ec895fef6cf8aa6f4030d9afe45fc6Bf54AWoDRZcraOhu8PjDWhHVyU.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"It tells the story of 6 former high school friends from a school in Busan who meet again in 2012 and brings back memories to 1997 when they were still high school students. Moving back and forth between the '90s and today, the story centers on the life of Sung Shi Won (Jung Eun Ji), who idolizes boy-band H.O.T., and her 5 high school friends.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=14003&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2012,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Reply 1997\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"丧尸肆虐\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84374,\"homeSectionName\":\"Zombie & Horror\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251024/1761272980008_eb55d3d88bf99bd572ef237bdc47b043cNmGq1bfUDhrZEHvJ77zwiWfoNA.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":111844,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251024/1761272970585_7c7126fcee7d67b732aebc9c583ae531hQYEkXiAcgzQkr4aqLxWpNUFvN5.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A dysfunctional family running a renowned herbal medicine business. The owner of the company attempts to innovate by creating a new potion, which ends up triggering a zombie outbreak.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=111844&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Elixir\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220208/1644288502923_18c62b3f466dbed6cffb34e0b85e2e59请叫我英雄10550横版.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":10550,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220208/1644288488295_5f19f15e0ccdb8ffed569aae81fb2d77请叫我英雄10550竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"A manga artist assistant is surprised by a zombie apocalypse.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=10550&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"I Am a Hero\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632623716487_a91227378fff9aa8105c35dbb909a9ea画板 1 拷贝 430.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1707,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211108/1636365139414_83f53a574cd031ef0966ee2bf885be9apiGZDwFW4urLYDWGiYJMrt6hdCS.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Tragedy, betrayal and a mysterious discovery fuel a woman's vengeance for the loss of her tribe and family in this special episode of \\\"Kingdom.\\\"\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1707&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Kingdom: Ashin of the North\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220217/1645091912347_14d7de157958e8e055de28f231cf1e66王国 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":12444,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230808/1691465189025_3396fb5438b0a809c8e98d6cc3b49e1elGyGVjon5slG7cIoBCQMm1gCRGq.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in the Joseon period. The king falls ill to smallpox and rumors start to spread that he has actually died. Meanwhile, Crown Prince Lee Chang is labeled a traitor by the Haewon Cho Clan, the clan of the current pregnant Queen and her father, Cheif State Councilor Cho Hak Joo. While trying to uncover the mystery of what happened to his father, the Crown Prince goes with his guard, thMoo Young, to Dongnae to look for Physician Lee Seung Hui who treated his father, only to be stuck with Assistant Physician Seo Bi and the mysterious man, Young Shin, in a village plagued with a mysterious disease. The second season centers on the advancement of the plague across several provinces. In the lead-up to halting the outbreak, a devastating revelation ensues at Sangju. Upon the arrival of the winter season, the undead hordes now roam freely due to a change in ambient temperature. Fearing the ramifications of an imminent invasion, Prince Lee Chang attempts to garner support from his allies to stop the undead and reclaim his right to the throne. Unbeknownst to the Prince, another conspiracy for political gain is brewing within the corrupt Haewon Cho Clan. As Queen Consort Cho schemes to steal a male newborn to cement as heir to the royal throne, she further orchestrates a last ditch strategy to use the plague against the citizens of Hanyang, if her former plan fails to succeed. As calamity looms among the living, only one question remains. Can the Prince save his people in time and end the political turmoil at the capital or will the plague mark the end of the Joseon dynasty?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12444&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Kingdom Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211109/1636427655290_68ede3a4b0309b28eac945283485e858hWpVSEMWDvG49ezvpksnS5BSnvB.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3441,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211109/1636427601001_cd410117122ba49a5aecc44868e8f084zqf711LsnQ5CcW3rISFw2t7OYzb.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The rapid spread of an unknown infection has left an entire city in ungovernable chaos, but one survivor remains alive in isolation. It is his story.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3441&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"#Alive\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211108/1636353300460_f59ef6386ebb3238d98df486ffb899d0p2701028754.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":5705,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220831/1661926669420_84e7c8b23aa1b57aed8b0d1f8dfab8d91.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in the near future, a high-rise apartment building has been newly constructed in the big city. The apartment building has residents from diverse backgrounds, but a new infectious disease breaks out. Because of the outbreak, the high-rise apartment is sealed off. The residents struggle to survive, while stricken with fear and distrust of others.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5705&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Happiness\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260423/1776923554839_ae265448a8f67ae484cd5334a5aafd08jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":135949,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260522/1779419481598_a3758cd5473005da9794b4a067de51fe群体.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Professor Se Jeong, attends a biotech conference-only to witness it spiral into catastrophe when a rapidly mutating virus is unleashed. As the outbreak spreads and the infected begin to transform, authorities seal off the entire facility.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=135949&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":4,\"rankDesc\":\"Asia list Top 2\",\"rankId\":147,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Colony\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220926/1664189764628_fb46bbbb433d1d322383c1797b42ed3e野兽.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3426,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220926/1664189712438_9057ac1767a7833bb7dac0d030c582e6野兽.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"While a zombie virus breaks out in South Korea, passengers struggle to survive on the train from Seoul to Busan.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3426&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Train to Busan\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220926/1664189867633_5255ab3ab61ffa044b0f9a11b375a7d7野兽.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":6571,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220926/1664189833828_7705b67da7734cc24436f548779ef2e7野兽.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Peninsula takes place four years after the zombie outbreak in Train to Busan. The Korean peninsula is devastated and Jung Seok, a former soldier who has managed to escape overseas, is given a mission to go back and unexpectedly meets survivors.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6571&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Peninsula\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211217/1639723755130_31ab0e86fb8b940faa8965e6c1106662q2HdL4CE0yZ44NkcUkSIakyrkd0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":9149,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211217/1639723753291_443b781e16cdb4c8d7afcc1a1764bef4z9Q1ldFc1OpCq3G5LulYmnvnFYd.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The series follows the story of King Taejong and his two sons, Prince Chungnyung and Prince Yangnyeong, how they fight the evil spirits who came alive and must be exorcised to save Joseon.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=9149&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"History\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Joseon Exorcist\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230726/1690362318372_a0b10863de138cf25ef1b59314125fabsweet home.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":1062,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231128/1701139521085_7ad7c407ba4943b2027536929c8fc2be1h4OqxXYRRM2FA3Nu6GBgD3puJj.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Hyun, a loner high school student who lost his entire family in a terrible accident, is forced to leave his home and has to face a new reality where monsters are trying to wipe out all of humanity. Now he must fight against all odds to try and race against the clock to save what is left of the human race before it's too late.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1062&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Sweet Home\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220830/1661842972632_a6f782084180fda106b76015c3b114a03.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":10403,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220830/1661842910805_a3a518b332bdce956d7e2d5d6585d687美食.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A high school becomes ground zero for a zombie virus outbreak. Trapped students must fight their way out or turn into one of the rabid infected.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=10403&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 10000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"All of Us Are Dead\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241125/1732517325132_158573a48bf5a05d25e43987a8daaa79横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":56731,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241125/1732517320984_8d7e88e1364cdaf24f498b3ab313e4bf竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"1941. Chumphon Province, Thailand. Mok and his ragtag unit of young soldiers are thrown against the invading Japanese forces. The invaders bring with them a terrifying biological weapon, unaware that it has plans of its own.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=56731&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Operation Undead\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250421/1745224033010_ec1d7447e9106b511f491e0f7f66d805856p3cUgvhU7zs0PO8Mi2Kw0WZY.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":86944,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251009/1759993366743_28378c2207895dd950f2eb5fed344422UEMweWe3pyGdgmKalt1DEOMvbV.webp\",\"introduction\":\"An unknown virus spreads throughout the city, transforming the population into zombies, a group of students take refuge in a school to protect themselves.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=86944&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Catastrophe\"],\"title\":\"Zomvivor\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260313/1773391653044_502b911ab1ff8ce5a73b4615ebe18f10ar6PIx6HoEz5WMVmLFMw47ePAw6.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":130049,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260313/1773391645027_9bdbf8d4e214789b72e189869c6d5406pLYiyfCYmuLDYf36AbQApadFUhN.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Follows Sloane and four other students who take shelter in their high school during a zombie outbreak.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130049&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"This Is Not a Test\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250710/1752118521725_c6843ffc4f7a1673f0c1935075e87436tdMbbFhqyEqOK1QzNTvJjHWKbZX.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":98210,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250710/1752118515762_fb9fe809296b0ef13fbbeb2b40963938yHYj2t3NzsjkHVYa0bPri4sMBsg.webp\",\"introduction\":\"In a world succumbing to hunger, a Muay Thai fighter fights off zombies to save his beloved.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=98210&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Ziam\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220508/1651976375935_6e0b934a137db36e79861930b1cc4b12i2697sDjW0k6fA9em7DmWK0nTq4.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":17562,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220517/1652786972347_ccb0225e10ca0b4e43a134a0a60c0d8e活尸电梯 17562竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"Claudio is a businessman at the top of his game. On his way to an important meeting, his elevator gets stuck. What starts out as a mere technical difficulty turns out to be a catastrophe of much larger proportions. Bit by bit and with his cell phone being the only source of information as he is trapped between floors, Claudio realizes that the world as he knew it has completely gone down the drain. Once familiar faces have turned savage and blood-smeared. A lethal virus is transforming people into highly contagious, homicidal zombies. Trapped inside a metal cage, with the ravenous ghouls out to get him, Claudio must rely entirely on his wits and survival instincts to break out of this hell on earth.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=17562&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2017,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The End?\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250520/1747727838759_707732eed8696acadf0da1f51b28e854p2919768135.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":91614,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250520/1747727844054_7a1014580dd4ea6cad651c4e9f9d151fp2919768135.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Thirty-five years after the Battle of Sekigahara, Japan, which had been gradually returning to a peaceful era, was suddenly plagued by monsters that attacked and devoured humans. These creatures, known as \\\"Gun-kyou,\\\" began to appear, prompting the shogunate to secretly send out extermination squads to burn the affected regions and cover up their existence.\\n\\nIn a remote post town called Tako-juku, Orin (played by Fumino Kimura), who had hidden her past as a ninja, lived peacefully with her adopted sister, Toki, while working as an assistant to a doctor. One day, Orin decided to travel to a distant village to obtain medicine that would cure Toki's illness. Upon reaching the village, she found blood and human flesh scattered everywhere. Soon, terrifyingly transformed Gun-kyou attacked Orin. At that moment, Orin's painful memories from her past resurfaced vividly. This marks the beginning of her intense journey to protect her beloved sister, Toki.\\n\\nMeanwhile, a man named Shirou (played by Juri Tanaka), a \\\"half-Gun-kyou\\\" who still retains his human consciousness but suffers from having no past, is on a quest to uncover the truth about his origins. Having been despised and confined because of his condition, he is searching for a certain person to understand who he truly is.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=91614&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Costume\"],\"title\":\"I, Kill\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251104/1762245054857_2ca75222752ac243d8caba6663583e91KHXQeegxWos9fD9nBKlVijpObL.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":112908,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251104/1762245041094_bbf7e08c004ce0cc37cdacfd01250a76bT7sMDsvWNeIGgZ6ZsisNdBcHdq.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A story of redemption in a world gone dark.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=112908&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Forgive Us All\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250908/1757310102204_ce1d6245c4d3fd370f5f3d72ce890ce3DdsdqgPJaiTJ8dJ39aJtQTUksE.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":105756,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250908/1757310096187_4187f2f8cabb9bec039ffc61f0a1033dx3rqVVrLVQGJZAfgaEDgjAkFR2F.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After Lunthom's death, her husband and mistress moved into their villa, but upon arrival, they discovered a glass coffin containing her body, leading to a terrifying revenge path.\\n\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=105756&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Tomb Watcher\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220114/1642149006452_a6e06ad81e97ec289a0f68d2a64f4d5fxKGOj6GE5uGAbX57fkELsBjdgsG.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":10812,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220114/1642149003209_671b1d006bfa30680335131603c35eccn0aekvXq6aQ7SduuArSlLlxRZko.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Lee Chung is a Prince of Joseon, but he has been taken hostage to the Qing Dynasty.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=10812&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Rampant\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250925/1758800340497_957f3f51849bb30cda6b033aa5171299gT7MXlPs7ohpdefR5cdgdPx1zsf.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":108893,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250925/1758800336867_0969ab68fc0a218a9ad2cae89c5a6b62iqtTHHYsEb0Tvr6zi8ErABmaPKn.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Lee Jeong Hwan, a fierce animal trainer, lives a chaotic daily life with his rebellious teenage daughter, Lee Su A, who is full of passion for dancing. One day, Su A becomes infected by a zombie virus that has swept across the globe.\\n\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=108893&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"My Daughter Is a Zombie\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250806/1754468843295_931b8e1c5230d6046ffaa9a478ba2bbbp2922160124.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":101887,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250806/1754468805682_7dce0cb0e53e3d5479b5ab9f0f361f65p2923107913.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Daryl's journey across a broken but resilient France as he hopes to find a way back home.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=101887&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Walking Dead: Daryl Dixon Season 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250424/1745460077637_409aa470e92bbb314d0622a23c728d3119pr5CzgsBYs67FAJvke8GQxN4g.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":87320,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250424/1745460073119_d487b2fcf38333045d1796a3ad5df954s6kFtdxfTC4xR8yDGbIjTgGEcFI.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A group of young delinquents, transferred to a remote military base for rehabilitation, find themselves caught in a web of secrets and battling sinister forces lurking in the shadows.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=87320&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Z-Zone\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250103/1735884452256_ce1f4f1b1cab75ef632e2f477d452528新乌托邦1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":66115,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250124/1737686727692_75c983d593a6a789a505b2365e9fd5c8p2917696639.png\",\"introduction\":\"A soldier faces a zombie outbreak during military service. His girlfriend, an engineer, navigates zombie-ridden Seoul. Both fight through the undead-infested city, striving to reunite amid the chaos.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=66115&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Catastrophe\"],\"title\":\"Newtopia\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211213/1639377608475_f2d734aca9225fe8bc58b19c4a2001d261O5T8LT32NMRomUusjFmABMVIn.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":8619,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211213/1639377607688_0c117e17913491886e6e15cda763e9b2hStPBeJFt0nHH2UbZPdfI5TSRpw.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Jae-hyuk is an ordinary man in his 40s. He works as a medical supplies salesman and is hassled by doctors all day. His brother Jae-pil is a detective that is not all that interested in public safety and spends most of his time moaning about the stock market. The discovery of a series of floating, gruesomely skeletal bodies around the country sparks hysteria. The police commissioner is disturbed to see CCTV footage of people jumping into water as if they were possessed, and drowning themselves. Time passes and hundreds of similar cases are reported, leaving officials stumped as to the cause of the deaths. The government declares a national emergency. Jae-pil joins the massive investigation and meets the mayor of a small town who claims he witnessed several men in work uniforms dumping infected dogs into the streams and realizes that there is a conspiracy behind the outbreak. Meanwhile, Jae-hyuk's wife and children are showing the same symptoms as the victims, leading to a frantic search for medicine. Through Jae-pil he learns of a warehouse containing a potential cure in thousands and thousands of doses and heads there with no idea of what he's heading into\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=8619&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2012,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Deranged\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221111/1668160607143_5f2a9dc0f508f411566348c92342cef628天 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":27732,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221111/1668160603496_3e6b117c031aa33ce7f26c8936f5e2ec28天 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Animal activists invade a laboratory with the intention of releasing chimpanzees that are undergoing experimentation, infected by a virus -a virus that causes rage. The naive activists ignore the pleas of a scientist to keep the cages locked, with disastrous results. Twenty-eight days later, our protagonist, Jim, wakes up from a coma, alone, in an abandoned hospital. He begins to seek out anyone else to find London is deserted, apparently without a living soul. After finding a church, which had become inhabited by zombie like humans intent on his demise, he runs for his life. Selena and Mark rescue him from the horde and bring him up to date on the mass carnage and horror as all of London tore itself apart. This is a tale of survival and ultimately, heroics, with nice subtext about mankind's savage nature.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=27732&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2002,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"28 Days Later\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250527/1748338324571_d8fb7f304bce03a1fc1a5eec91eeaa225z314zU4iraY1ZhbIvgfpbMRVA7.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":92770,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250527/1748338320708_47d6086832f1621bfcf91092b6d2ae6fhVKHzr4GwSw0FepqhqQ0DDiYHNY (1).webp\",\"introduction\":\"A group of survivors of the rage virus lives on a small island. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=92770&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"28 Years Later\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230120/1674181190308_5de69eb9db142ac13049047835a19529丧尸 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":30457,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230128/1674895601483_a4995b8c46fbeae9eb1a8e5d74bc196c5.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Hyun Suk, becomes trapped inside his office building when zombies take over the Gangnam district of Seoul. Meanwhile, Min Jung, is always the first to step forward and fight back when she sees injustice. Together, the two characters must fight for their lives as they attempt to break out of the building.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=30457&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":3.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Gangnam Zombie\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211130/1638241151472_cc4510f7c39b54f1a4d8552c88fea657A7iCxAatOrHLy7orsEOqhRmI2QQ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":4257,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211130/1638241291170_836bf324f3132a6f2a8cbcde33f71b39sqAsXLxlrohHTikjeYQRG4iJKMh.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A mysterious viral outbreak with hallmarks of an ancient and evil strain of vampirism ravages the city of New York.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=4257&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Strain Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"热门欧美剧\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":83061,\"homeSectionName\":\"Western TV Dramas\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260709/1783580104111_89e77eee75da48e962f0b1e019faaba3草原上的小木屋e.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":155030,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260709/1783580098145_634e29cc3731a65cb86228cfceae6493草原上的小木屋.webp\",\"introduction\":\"The Ingalls family lives and works on a farm in Midwestern America during the late 19th century.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=155030&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Family\",\"History\",\"Romantic\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Little House on the Prairie Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260703/1783046232048_4b2ba96b6e3981cbe7f9bcc1fc874feduTWhbLc7Bj4qNSdW3ZvZKL8cOHv.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":154182,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260703/1783046229329_96d27ff68b4ad46d9f811c2e5931e1a261cSwVmu0urv7H5eqRFwYlnd3oS.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Season three reveals an origin story set centuries earlier, while continuing the saga of a dystopian society of 10,000 people living underground under mysterious circumstances. In the present, Juliette Nichols survives her forced \\\"cleaning\\\" but returns with memory loss as the silo recovers from rebellion and faces a dangerous new threat. Meanwhile, in the \\\"Before Times,\\\" journalist Helen Drew and Congressman Daniel Keene uncover a conspiracy that pulls them into a chain of events with catastrophic, irreversible consequences.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=154182&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":3,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Silo Season 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260701/1782886144209_16eb825c62442f6e59c83b7b16cc75c72JjyMzJxWcfO5boofm8esEVFqvZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":153821,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260701/1782886140912_99a185176a7cdedf095177e682b7ad44u0Vj7zhVK0HYxsS3VMzkU37Pebp.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Follows Elle Woods' journey through high school, exploring the formative experiences that mold her into the iconic, confident \\\"Legally Blonde\\\" character.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=153821&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Elle Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netp