rue,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Crime\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Daredevil: Born Again Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260318/1773801788336_a3813ca34c040f51b213a8ee9f65b3a0aC8mfnb9ucC7W99TLaiZkLqXxSi.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":130438,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260318/1773801780097_7372303ff6d2ac3354eae1b41aac9a53wW7rimhnokiQ8V6ha6VKIwHg8IV.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Follows an investigation that dives deep into the murder of a wealthy woman and all the dark secrets uncovered about her life.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130438&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Imperfect Women\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766985703368_c04868f35b302e02d78d30c90c171c0aBRIDGERTON_401_Unit_05419R.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":120819,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251229/1766985654676_aa3d6a143f19abef8585afb8a2b01a395dGN6F99kMSRzWVTQRAvTlK48Zu.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Behind the cover of a mask, anything can happen. \",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=120819&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":true,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Youth\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Bridgerton Season 4\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"限时大逃杀\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84189,\"homeSectionName\":\"Time Is Running Out!\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250305/1741176447713_89e3a0383c746d7579a41158f87f50de微信截图_20250305200709.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":77543,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250922/1758522128544_757abd8946d7975a1a0feadcc872ded0aAGEhH0pQ5DNbYljGHvY1JtnW0N.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Arisu - a listless, jobless and video-game-obsessed young man - suddenly finds himself in a strange, emptied-out version of Tokyo in which he and his friends must compete in dangerous games in order to survive.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=77543&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Alice in Borderland Season 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250701/1751369426353_55be9fea343d7d1668a9a868a1a0213d横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":97217,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250701/1751369421450_0111e1de2a48af2d78e6b153175a2d82竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A group of students travel to a mysterious carnival for fun, but the carnival turns out to be a brutal survival game that cruelly plays with their minds. Will they be able to find the exit?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=97217&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Exit\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632885115358_766443798224ffa7a7274b633743c70caIokpcLZ1CRJDqFCjb0KHlUY1UQ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2814,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638351532318_871b3926fa7c2f837e1a495aa289eb6e3Obn9IR47fjhbtYtNrO7CBSrZ2w.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A 2nd-year high school student named Shun Takahata lives an ordinary teenage life until one day he's suddenly forced to participate in a series of children's games such as \\\"Daruma-san ga Koronda\\\" with death as the penalty for losing. With no knowledge of who's behind the games, he's left with no other choice but to keep winning as his only means of protecting himself and his childhood friend, Ichika. Meanwhile, a troubled classmate named Takeru seems to actually be relishing the opportunity to get other students killed\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2814&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"As the Gods Will\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240706/1720258739186_0a03962e1b3759de0729de76baeeaf24dg59eyY8uAxICPSUalktdZSrTou.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":46505,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240706/1720258735135_a34f872f5ba3ca3b9df33bc5cc88585fiLrKRd4z9AwFNhnfpB6LpRctW7L.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Hyakaou Academy is an institute where the academic ranking is based on the pupils' gambling winnings. Yumeko is new to the academy. Her pretty enchantress looks are only surpassed by her voracious appetite to gamble it all and win it all.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=46505&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Kakegurui Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220624/1656061429397_9dad785bebdc05eff2a67300a4147149纸钞屋（韩版）.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":17331,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220719/1658226879764_95899c8fedd35fbb429b737e7ec7346e企业微信截图_16582268453451.png\",\"introduction\":\"A genius strategist and his talented crew composed of top-class thieves attempting to pull off an unprecedented heist in the Korean Peninsula. The story portrays unexpected twists and turns as the crew stage a hostage while facing inexplicable challenges. All eyes are focused on the background and definition behind the title Joint Economic Area.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=17331&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":5.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Money Heist: Korea - Joint Economic Area\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240415/1713166754292_040831bc6079ef8ea8fb3e711f3ab129jGwv3lDH9yPjtY4wHud0rEYBYW0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":43092,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240415/1713166749579_100fc81f43b3b215bfc8a03fe078d316wFHY8S1PuOTw69ijV6xyY1c8QEe.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"8 people in need of money are invited to appear on the reality-variety show Money Game. The 8 people are to stay at the studio that consists of nothing but concrete walls. If they are able to hang in there for 100 days, they can divide the winning prize of 44.8 billion won equally. But, everything they spend on, including necessities like food, water, and electricity, costs 1,000 times more than normal prices and is deducted from the winning prize.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=43092&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"The 8 Show\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250108/1736329226710_3fbcf9a5b89c0bc860e16fc03b7cf23d鱿鱼游戏3.1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":66959,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250627/1750992005258_6c62c7298f49d607e3543ea5fd7aa290MV5BYTU3ZDVhNmMtMDVlNC00MDc0LTgwNDMtYWE5MTI2ZGI4YWIwXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_FMjpg_UX1000_.png\",\"introduction\":\"A failed rebellion, the death of a friend, and a secret betrayal. Picking up in the aftermath, the final season finds Gi Hun, Player 456, at his lowest point yet. But the Squid Game stops for no one, so Gi Hun will be forced to make some important choices in the face of overwhelming despair as he and the surviving players are thrust into deadlier games that test everyone’s resolve.\\n\\nWith each round, their choices lead to increasingly grave consequences. Meanwhile, In Ho resumes his role as Frontman to welcome the mysterious VIPs, and his brother Jun Ho continues his search for the elusive island, unaware there’s a traitor in their midst. Will Gi Hun make the right decisions, or will Frontman finally break his spirit?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=66959&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Squid Game Season 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211102/1635849304926_b86015c7cab6729cc933a0e4a927b8e9赌博默示录.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2761,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211102/1635849253677_63e647eabca9999038a8c5a54ba13fe0赌博默示录.png\",\"introduction\":\"Kaiji Ito moves to Japan after graduating from high school. Unable to find a job and frustrated with society at large, Kaiji spends his days gambling, vandalizing cars, and drinking booze. Two years later and his life no better, a debt collector named Endo arrives to collect money. The debt collector then offers two choices to Kaiji: spend 10 year paying off your loan or board a gambling boat for one night to repay your debt and possibly make a whole lot more. Meanwhile, the unscrupulous Endo is actually conning Kaiji, believing he won't come back from voyage. Kaiji is then up for the night of his life.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2761&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2009,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Kaiji: The Ultimate Gambler\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632652870327_0db1a07ef5fc48604a835638cbcb01e6画板 1 拷贝 221.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":1060,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210927/1632740456082_4f0ee0b610ea02794be3be5156a8728120mOwAAPwZ1vLQkw0fvuQHiG7bO.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A group of bored delinquents are transported to a parallel wasteland as part of a survival game.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1060&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Alice in Borderland\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220211/1644543639482_6238ae7bb68a794f6334d1d5e82a371220.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":12192,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220211/1644543632181_601b798ab0778291ee06a462f421067419.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Six different people, each from a very different walk of life, awaken to find themselves inside a giant cube with thousands of possible rooms. Each has a skill that becomes clear when they must band together to get out: a cop, a math whiz, a building designer, a doctor, an escape master, and a disabled man. Each plays a part in their thrilling quest to find answers as to why they've been imprisoned\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12192&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":1997,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Cube\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250424/1745476200076_b597b9c84e95b26d25bc4e185c676d32yeS6BBdYcePmipl8r4e3saOBkfj.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":87354,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250424/1745476195998_99b0de7943ca6068c7d24fd0ee45926ce3ENTAEDEO949khpVkJWgcWnwGG.webp\",\"introduction\":\"At a private school where gambling determines social status, a skillful new student with a mysterious past is shaking things up — and betting on revenge.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=87354&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Bet\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211129/1638164875509_da53949a8995f153ca05b3894a2a5a3avmT5VZb6AACzIt3s6FcIfARbqfP.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":2768,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632801131926_a10ad4bf5991e64f5d391ecbdeb7be03欺诈 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Trusting, gullible Nao suddenly finds herself participating in the mysterious Liar Game, a game where the players are issued large sums of money which they then have to cheat each other out of. A few get rich, while the rest find themselves in debt for life. Nao's opponent is her former teacher. Relieved, she goes to him for advice, but is tricked into giving him all her money. With no idea of how to retrieve the money to avoid debt, Nao is desperate. When she gets a tip that a genius swindler, Shinichi Akiyama, is about to be released from prison, she turns to him for help. With some initial reluctance, Akiyama agrees to be her right-hand man in the game. As the two get pulled deeper into increasingly difficult levels of the game, it gradually becomes clear that their participation was far from coincidental.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2768&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2007,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":11,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Liar Game Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240205/1707100742212_f6dd1de2abc90c5d1250756394afa4cb3SwzpfS0C7Ta6Uesnz5uFxfCKiF.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":41035,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240205/1707100739594_540ffb0341a8c2345a17d98aca87a8243uTnw1XahydeVkwFzY5xq5aFUh7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"About six people who find themselves trapped in a maze-like cube and have to figure a way out, while evading fatal traps.\\n\\nSix people are locked in a mysterious cube shaped room. These 6 people are: 29-year-old engineer Yuichi Goto, 37-year-old association employee Asako Kai, 31-year-old Freeter Shinji Ochi, 13-year-old middle school student Chiharu Uno, 39-year-old mechanic Hiroshi Ide and 61-year-old company executive Kazumasa Ando. These 6 people are complete strangers to each other. They don't know why they are locked in the room, but they try to escape out of the mysterious cube. If they can't decipher the code, they won't get out of the cube.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=41035&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Cube\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632888949518_05f559f83cd3a6c63c4c1eae9d37aee18Ls1tZ6qjGzfGHjBB7ihOnf7f0b.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2812,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632888941087_b80328608ce7e0813cf5651bc79607cc8Ls1tZ6qjGzfGHjBB7ihOnf7f0b.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Six strangers are given mysterious black boxes with tickets to an immersive escape room for a chance to win tons of money. Being locked in several rooms with extreme conditions, they discover the secrets behind the escape room and must fight to survive and to find a way out.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2812&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Escape Room\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638350982656_7f27e539e81e6b763cd8a3accfc7b5a7n4rNQUV9S9DMgCkQVt7R7VLYxNr.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2745,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638350956229_7b5077c89dc3566dcb5399889dc1179faLGKAQKgzWpJ6egyWzzC11jXBRJ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Forty-two students, three days, one deserted Island: welcome to Battle Royale. A group of ninth-grade students from a Japanese high school have been forced by legislation to compete in a Battle Royale. The students are sent off to kill each other in a no-holds-barred game to the death, until one survives -- or they all die. Some decide to play the game like the psychotic Kiriyama or the sexual Mitsuko, while others are trying to find a way to get off the Island without violence. However, as the numbers dwindle is there any way for Shuya and his classmates to survive?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2745&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2000,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Battle Royale\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240715/1721031214037_c1344b923a808751e3d1709e722a1673aSvAKp2wCObifgR0tj9qYRNN1Fi.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":46946,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240715/1721031208282_6a76d4d107ad35677c5f34798f6573aetvIpBg12IIA5Dr9Sjn38ygS1vQp.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A thrilling physical journey that allows an approach to the darkness, where it is scary to look. It appeals to the viewer's civil responsibility and forces them to face the limits of their own solidarity.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=46946&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Platform 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221010/1665393187335_ef56459b6dc1b710b6210769f6ab599e8edzqU74USlnfkCzHtLxILUfQW3.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":25991,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221010/1665393185207_2aa761b846b698ea209e738578a494d67Y2LdQzsysZiEaklEVhNJWAZRuE.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Arisu is a man without much money or luck. He is unemployed currently as well. Out of the blue a blinding light engulfs him one day in whose aftermath the city of Tokyo has lost all its inhabitants save Arisu and two friends. This is a dangerous and potentially fatal game of survival now in which they are forced to take part.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=25991&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Alice in Borderland Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220610/1654848790367_6c0522eaad627d9c86640e0dfb614e5a3tkDMNfM2YuIAJlvGO6rfIzAnfG.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":20441,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240520/1716187746867_4b6ba8df1f137943bac0aff9b3fd915fqjMy3qF0gIQAf75Xa824sa2YY5D.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A vertical prison with one cell per level. Two people per cell. Only one food platform and two minutes per day to feed. An endless nightmare trapped in The Hole.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=20441&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Platform\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211126/1637921436034_a5ddd671e269982000c0894b607942264mcOCiR06dqQ5eoEJcG3zvonjOa.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":7357,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211126/1637921434015_394edea82c760614e1b524a813d26146eq9Yox8i2ZJHYW62GplzxtWtIIg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The second chapter of the epic \\\"Maze Runner\\\" saga. Thomas (Dylan O'Brien) and his fellow Gladers face their greatest challenge yet: searching for clues about the mysterious and powerful organization known as WCKD. Their journey takes them to the Scorch, a desolate landscape filled with unimaginable obstacles. Teaming up with resistance fighters, the Gladers take on WCKD's vastly superior forces and uncover its shocking plans for them all.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=7357&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210914/1631612323762_5cffa9562013a655e44570fdf6a08ec69R2FuGT0BeZl8usfsfqIcO7KK7v.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2525,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240205/1707122848415_ec5f7785ea7d3fa42cdfa96ed836db6f6.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Twelve strangers wake up in a clearing. They don't know where they are, or how they got there. They don't know they've been chosen - for a very specific purpose - The Hunt.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2525&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Hunt\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211202/1638424084878_88eebd277e2db758ff36fc88e82be0cc9DET8yv7MYMwOWe1eR2CigFkev4.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3836,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220706/1657088045120_da79c8e03c3906f3127f84ee26165043雪国.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in 2031, the entire world is frozen except for those aboard the Snowpiercer. For seventeen years, the world's survivors are on a train hurtling around the globe creating their own economy and class system. Led by Curtis (Chris Evans), a group of lower-class citizens living in squalor at the back of the train are determined to get to the front of the train and spread the wealth around. Each section of the train holds new surprises for the group who have to battle their way through. A revolution is underway.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3836&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Snowpiercer\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"不畏霸凌！\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":83328,\"homeSectionName\":\"Stand Up To Bullying\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260513/1778661127116_a0ab0c395b95e7ff33fbf6731224726e8jUfpHfzJXfrnDJ6yztj8jRWfYB.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":140703,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260513/1778661121445_9ab2548dc2b9d11f46aaeb2a0cf3145dcDLlx3tQbDvYJmMzjS1LJldxvlr.webp\",\"introduction\":\"The collapse of teachers' Authority, the establishment of the Teachers' Authority Protection Bureau under the Ministry of Education, and the dispatch of supervisors to problem schools to punish students and parents who cross the line.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=140703&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"Crime list Top 2\",\"rankId\":312,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"Teach You a Lesson\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250120/1737356522909_55b8bb4056cdff62a946884d147e0a4a善意的竞争2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":68938,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250210/1739151785749_d5ee91417decf4e910e9549f41d31591善意的竞争.png\",\"introduction\":\"Woo Seul Ki grew up in an orphanage out in a province. She moves to Seoul and enrolls in Chaehwa High School, which is a school for the top 1% students in South Korea. Woo Seul Ki doesn't get along with the other students. A student named Yoo Je Yi approaches her and they become friends.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=68938&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Friendly Rivalry\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230518/1684377602145_6fa6c159cb4088a206c83155767ed071高中 竖.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":33914,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240314/1710384960562_946b66b756c6498d4ec84fac108d7c225.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Baek Je Na is a third-generation conglomerate and a gold spoon of the highest class at Cheongdam International High School. Kim Hye In grew up in poverty and is offered a chance to study at the Cheongdam International High School in exchange for her silence on a murder she witnessed. Cheongdam International High School is a homicide mystery that follows Je Na’s rivalry with Kim Hye In as they are pitted against each other in mental warfare.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33914&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Bitch X Rich\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221118/1668754373335_a662fc08e3652ed0d7513f4ce7d77482hj2YSkoqHB2FPHeoALfdd4eufue.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":28043,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221118/1668762712530_fe57892abebeb6057834e863b244a90fp2881967225.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Yeon Shi Eun is a model student, who ranks at the top at his high school. Physically, Yeon Shi Eun appears like a weak boy, but by using his smarts, tools, and psychology, he fights against violence that takes place inside and outside of his school.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=28043&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 10000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Campus\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Weak Hero Class 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220317/1647501223917_40fabebbd940e3ea24f73775bac0db8a8AEX5oZB62UD6U7CDJ1xLbbgjMv.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":14167,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220317/1647501220312_356fd0d3e3951002b63d5157d7f10cc1j57pZCKyaXRParhXE18hDGJRfbA.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The drama is about a highly successful lawyer who falls from grace because of one case. He becomes a fixed term teacher at a high school that is tied to that case in order to regain his honor. Though he goes into the classroom for selfish reasons, he begins to see the crimes that take place and he takes matters into his own hands to help protect victims from their peers. The drama will shine a spotlight on the reality of teenagers facing little to no repercussions after committing a crime because they are teenagers, providing no protection for those who become a victim to these crimes.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=14167&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Class of Lies\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220225/1645779446440_b3852d3816f27bb5bf095ad462e6c519少年法庭.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":12117,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220211/1644547498288_ee28772a7920f191dac0d54d0056b985少年法庭 12117竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"A judge who is infamously known for their dislike towards juveniles becomes the newly appointed judge of a juvenile court in the Yeonhwa District. A victim of juvenile crime in her youth, she faces various cases involving juvenile delinquents and other youths, which helps her discover what it truly means to be an adult.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12117&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Juvenile Justice\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240529/1716953266217_3044420613be30479ab8845fab7e747d120889102.1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":44762,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240612/1718178914986_9d57d2fa1c5e82c0ef94dc69f972ef76黑社会的我成为了高中生.png\",\"introduction\":\"Kim Deuk Pal is a 47-year-old gangster who is the #2 guy in his gang. He doesn't have an educational background due to his poor parents, but he dreams of attending a university. Deuk Pal has been studying to achieve his dream, but it's not easy. One day, he sees a young man, Song Yi Heon, about to kill himself. At that time, Deuk Pal's spirit possesses the body of the suicidal 19-year-old high school student. Deuk Pal soon learns that Yi Heon is a victim of bullying, which has caused him to want to take his own life.\\n\\nNow, in Yi Heon's body, Deuk Pal takes on the bullies to punish them and becomes friends with classmate Choi Se Kyung. Se Kyung is a model student who appears to be in a perfect situation but suffers from domestic violence at home by his father.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=44762&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"High School Return of a Gangster\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230627/1687845438059_ececbd3fc90d05e22f07e0cceb5a3158逃兵 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":35068,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230726/1690359224219_5b32838cc61d2128c0ac150da26c49bf丁.png\",\"introduction\":\"A young private’s assignment to capture army deserters reveals the painful reality endured by each enlistee during his compulsory call of duty.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=35068&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"D.P. Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240220/1708400153403_236032d6cc90cf286ba89e7952b092a2hLHtMWn0o01ZrCnEyWnelDvHMMX.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":41420,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240220/1708400148351_8b7b2f2846d9d2c2cf738221f8454ff3pBUERwWNCuO36CPxiVFsoQCPu7W.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Every Thursday afternoon, once a month, students at Sarang High School cast their votes in a popularity poll. The result? A brutal ranking system that determines the entire social hierarchy of the school. After starting at the bottom, can new transfer student Su Ji make her way to the top of the pyramid? Or will she topple the game altogether?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=41420&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Pyramid Game\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240103/1704269831071_dcdf6c63933ca28f6c767c8736028e59p2889065824.jpg.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":29253,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230821/1692585074768_3c500324f937c5777cf069cb3b50a5cduUM4LVlPgIrww07OoEKrGWlS1Ej.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"It's a sad revenge story that begins with a high school student who dreamed of becoming an architect. However, she had to drop out of school after suffering from brutal school violence. Years later, the perpetrator gets married and has a kid. Once the kid is in elementary school, the former victim becomes their homeroom teacher and starts her thorough revenge towards the perpetrators and bystanders of her bullying days.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=29253&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Glory\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230203/1675405567292_641fceda29db44a1650e3658f7a6ccfa屏幕截图 2023-02-03 142530.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":30756,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230203/1675414973205_d3e3d46dd2fd435ca4291951c3673382p2887397422.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Rainbow Deluxe Taxi is back in business. Although the crew disbands after Do Gi’s successful revenge, Seong Cheol, Go Eun, Gyeong Gu, and Jin Eon can’t help but reunite with him once again. Each of them tries to live an ordinary life with an ordinary job, but it is in their nature to fight against injustice. The company also welcomes a new employee.\\n\\nOn Ha Jun is a clumsy but kind-hearted boy who accidentally finds the secret basement of Rainbow Taxi. Fighting on behalf of everyone who has been wronged in this unequal society, the crew works for more clients than before. However, a mysterious organization is after Rainbow Taxi this time. They first show their existence by killing one of the villains Do Gi is after but goes back into hiding without giving him a chance to find out.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=30756&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 10000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Taxi Driver Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211206/1638768796871_8a89a39e51b6f82d4f2fc0a17f8ff7ffgDPoUx97YV2JZ41ljaqoCFPUxxE.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":7998,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211206/1638768792840_5ee2cbc01233d87c327269a1694c9e7bxaUyUOf3CPV5MxaALRxUQMxsDvE.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A group of criminals are brought together by the law to assist in stopping crime.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=7998&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":11,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Bad Guys\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211115/1636966032719_89e867d222926116ccd27207f41309eblyTvNYixDDHyB5ddfD8CJHW4dnQ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":1582,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220719/1658227216237_20e262dbca9130b0b65acec540ba475d企业微信截图_16582271836885.png\",\"introduction\":\"It is a story of high school students who become tangled in a series of conflicts and events that challenge human values and morality. Jisoo (Kim Dong-Hee) is a model high school student. To pay for his university tuition fee, he makes a bad choice. This leads to a serious crime that takes place. Minhee (Jung Da-Bin) and Gyuri (Park Joo-Hyun) attend the same high school as Jisoo and they get involved in Jisoo's crime.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1582&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Extracurricular\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250612/1749715671852_f7642072be5601dbfbe5a97453dedf38DkLvRo_3f.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":94546,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250703/1751532628586_28a8367d9208bd2797d8aca683a78b9bGsp9z4EawAA4nfy.png\",\"introduction\":\"After the fall of villain Oh Shi Eun in Season 1... The once unshakable hierarchy at Cheongdam International High School is now fractured!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=94546&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Bitch X Rich Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220321/1647836137999_a0b4280c09b5aef8aad4a4a730d5f3ca猪猡之王.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":13214,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220826/1661507226099_6ada30d310315bc86593085d612e732b1651047055520_6ada30d310315bc86593085d612e732b7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"two friends meet up and recall their experiences as victims of school bullying when they receive a message from a friend from 20 years ago and mysterious serial killings begin to occur. \\n\\nKyung Min lives with the trauma of the school violence he experienced twenty years ago and an unexpected case causes his suppressed emotions to reappear. Meanwhile, Detective Jong Suk receives a mysterious message sent from a friend from 20 years ago which reminds him of the school violence that took place back then. Chasing the mysterious message, he tries to put a stop to the murders.\\n\\nThrough these characters with tragic fates, the drama touches on the origin of school violence and the bullying that pervades modern society. \",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=13214&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The King of Pigs\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240520/1716197451067_3aa7de1e438db2072452e7708f36089ff6rZahL26DPooofKRcO1P6680U2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":44170,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240529/1716964029725_671d5144f4c53c6c35cc19dbd4e3ad5aszr7QFNnuspcyhW0rsoDMDN73pP.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Jooshin High School is the most prestigious school in South Korea. The school was established by the conglomerate Jooshin Group. Normally, only students who are chosen at birth to attend Jooshin High School are allowed. Those students include Jeong Jae Yi, who is the first daughter of the family that runs the Jaeyool Group; Kim Ri An, who is the successor of the Jooshin Group; Yoon He Ra, who is the youngest daughter of the trading company International Yoon, and Lee Woo Jin who is the second son of a powerful politician family.\\n\\nMeanwhile, Kang Ha is transferred to Jooshin High School. He possesses a pure and innocent smile, but he holds a secret. Due to him, the concrete world of Jooshin High School begins to crack.\\n \",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=44170&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Hierarchy\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220701/1656661173563_6369f75c808234903d134d2490cbc8d7p29YKyHeyo4bgQaXoMuEs8mVJgk.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":21452,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220701/1656661171369_56e2c6ce6a1bea278c50db762d705df2yIQgdVGDjryehtnhPnQ12yZa6gk.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A bullied girl becomes friends with a new kid during a break, but when classes start up again, their new friendship is nearly ruined when the bullying continues.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=21452&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"title\":\"The World of Us\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211119/1637303986247_8e2c5383467330407f001fe0b26500d4snrF3YkSzsmUacDUtURKzZYZOfh.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":6841,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211119/1637303976072_23411b7381c002f70e8aa70f7204ae16snrF3YkSzsmUacDUtURKzZYZOfh.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A School girl called Go Eun-Byul goes off on a schooltrip to Teongyeong. While in Teongyeong she meets her twin sister Lee Eun-Bi for the first time. Lee Eun-Bi is having a hard time in life and is considering suicide. Lee Eun-Bi replaces Go Eun-Byul's live after her dissapear and have to live like her and lie to everyone.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6841&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Who Are You: School 2015\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632652812557_b70b80e98f6041cb6c475b7947d78a1a画板 1 拷贝 223.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":1061,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210924/1632471174625_a2d7a9fdf10a54020444148a410aef6auemn2sQ4FsnplGxRGebMmwbgeex.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Wielding a light-up sword through the dark corners of a high school, a nurse with an unusual gift protects students from monsters only she can see.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1061&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The School Nurse Files\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"无法抗拒的“BL”\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":81011,\"homeSectionName\":\"Boys' Love: Sweet & Tender \",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260626/1782458717943_10db793b68617f5b9f7d83bb06c87c8d入戏u.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":153125,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260626/1782458706431_807b1d602922c2b0f3e258245d83cbeb入戏.webp\",\"introduction\":\"It tells the story of actor Zhang Zhun, who auditions for the film \\\"Into the Role\\\" in an effort to overcome a career slump. During the process, he becomes involved with Zhen Xin, a director who achieved fame at a young age.\\nIn the film, the two portray a doctor and a patient engaged in a struggle of desire and emotional manipulation. Outside the film, however, Zhen Xin’s increasingly intrusive behavior causes their relationship to spiral out of control. As performance and reality become intertwined, they find it increasingly difficult to distinguish genuine feelings from fiction.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=153125&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 30000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Deep In\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260703/1783072155180_fa268e557fdd20443eefe6f4078a930aq9q5Y2aljVXUthe2PjTFZ2gstE6.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":154373,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260703/1783072152877_17adf137a8dc0651f26bfcf652377a40AicPNTCRUVbQ9njUAO7rdDHsifS.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Lu Xiao Fan’s life takes an unexpected turn when he leaves his rural roots to marry into a prominent, wealthy Beijing family.\\n\\nExpecting a life of luxury and prestige, he soon discovers his marriage is a sham. His fortunes shift, however, when he crosses paths with his new brother-in-law: the sophisticated Bei Lu Qing. Drawn into Lu Qing’s world, Xiao Fan desperately tries to find his place in the man's life. He aspires to be a trusted confidant or a loyal friend, but destiny has other plans.\\n\\nThrough a series of awkward trials and mounting pressures, Xiao Fan finds himself forced into the singular, unconventional position of Lu Qing’s lover.\\n\\nHas Xiao Fan gone too far in his desire to be close to Lu Qing?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=154373&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":4,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Bittersweet Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782378493185_1e35448cfd7969eb8618d2bc9e64d8befeISh3qoREwIPWbSaLqqumbmh7m.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":152882,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782378487742_c425011c73138b48acd3d95f03a5c6b5lK6DrnFecG0AsA8O5UqEYOrOArd.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Fifteen years ago, the murder of a major casino mogul dragged the lives of two young boys straight into hell. One became the \\\"son of the victim,\\\" left with the hollow ache of a stolen father; the other became the \\\"son of the killer,\\\" branded by his father's blood-stained hands. Years later, fate brings them back together as a prosecutor and an investigator. Trapped within a vicious cycle of destiny, they dig into a massive web of corruption weaving through a mega-corporation and the prosecution itself. This intense, passionate mystery-thriller follows two men who, amidst the chaos, become each other's fatal weakness and only salvation.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=152882&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":7,\"rankDesc\":\"Horror list Top 1\",\"rankId\":126,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"The Prosecutors Proposal\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260615/1781502229157_01a359f9a4a55a8d2ec9d78bf2cc7bbcnP7hng2CDtqjEOG7yr1m4ssQlZ0.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":149807,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260615/1781502226600_78eb63fcc969762c3742c76edcce13fex3P6dPwBLOH6qGoaPyKE7lHGWrm.webp\",\"introduction\":\"At the peak of his career, top celebrity Feng Qing Lang escapes to a remote tea mountain, seeking a brief respite from the spotlight. Instead, he meets Xu Chang Yang, a free-spirited young tea farmer with an untamed soul. One belongs to the dazzling world of fame, the other to the forests and the land.\\n\\nAs they grow closer among the mountains and wilderness, love quietly takes root. But the relentless scrutiny of the entertainment industry and the harsh realities of society soon close in, pushing them toward separation time and again. In the end, will they follow the call of their hearts and risk everything for love?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=149807&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"A Winter Sun Wakes the Wind in Spring Hills' Dream\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260622/1782096515808_c6a6a7b49c8eeb76a99c63399fac0d0f地平线边缘Y.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":151352,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260622/1782096507934_415d53efaeda6bbf0f384e8bb12d67b2地平线边缘.webp\",\"introduction\":\"As a kingdom faces change, a prince risks everything for the commoner he once loved in a world that forbids their bond.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151352&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":37,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 3\",\"rankId\":108,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":4,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"The Edge of Horizon\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260529/1780044743925_f0a113260a5d042ee82d71e41b2d1d484sNasT3NFzcol4YztlWPpJb3Zye.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":145866,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260529/1780044740411_6198518a418e1c4b20aa129a6ec583bfd7VEPr11cZc5mUTHyYJXfbblbeJ.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After flight attendant Kanit clashes with three EMTs and his bag is accidentally exchanged with EMT Toto's, the chaotic trio borrow his expensive belongings for a night out and they get stolen. When the truth comes out and Toto can't afford to pay Kanit back, he agrees to a trade of labour. Kanit tasks Toto with uncovering his boyfriend's cheating. When he does, however, Toto is bribed by Kanit's pilot boyfriend to keep it quiet. As the two spend more time together and their closeness grows, Toto may begin to regret his lie.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=145866&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":28,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"A Dog and a Plane\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260520/1779244196111_e619f5b54c940330146e72a30d9ff5e8sbenI8G0SYE6zH8jFlRsVeLubFK.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":142677,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260520/1779244192720_8aa7cd16cb4b8eb20c2751ae4be18922gd2nyCPgKpttZNhKlEiLvhlojgA.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Akkhara, who has been hurt repeatedly in love, finds it hard to believe that he will ever meet true love in this lifetime. One day, he makes a wish at a temple, telling himself to \\\"try one last time.\\\" At that very moment, he meets Intha, a rugged and confident bar owner. Intha trusts his instincts and begins pursuing Akkhara openly, but Akkhara, scarred by past pain, cannot bring himself to accept his feelings.\\n\\nAs the two work and live together at ChermChey bar, with alcohol loosening their hearts and everyday care drawing them closer, they gradually go from strangers to becoming the person each wants to protect most.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=142677&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":37,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 5\",\"rankId\":108,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"ChermChey\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260517/1779009526107_74899687f8ce1ccc5aaf27dbcdb815b8去除图片文字.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":141736,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260517/1779008971976_0045bf9674f47f66b46e04ccc321a355p2932235966.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"To save the orphanage founded by his grandfather and to pay off his debt, Somsak, who has been thus far financially supporting this institution with profits from his now-unmarketable adventure novels, decides to venture into writing a genre that the current generation is more interested in—\\\"boys love\\\"\\n\\nSeeing his grandfather's plight, Save—Somsak's Gen Z grandson—decides to land him a helping hand in this mission, although they often clash heads because of the generational gap.\\n\\nTo give his grandpa real insight for his novel, Save chooses to date his friend who has confessed his feelings for him. On the other hand, Somsak experiences challenges as he attempts to broaden his horizons.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=141736&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"My Grandpa Is a BL Writer\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260514/1778726275457_99439724e057160791cf655160647a78aKsVftGoopv1HbkIQG1qfJ1qqa5.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":140882,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260514/1778726269117_b44c860cfb4da69cf14bd1d869babcfbkoWJdCFLPLI2VSWQhssoF91k5al.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After inadvertently destroying the life of his best friend, Narutaki Ryu abandons everything and leaves Japan. He nearly dies at a church in a foreign country before he is saved by a Korean boxer named Hwang Jo Han. Both men carry deep, unhealed wounds, and as their lonely souls gravitate toward one another, it soon becomes clear that they are soul mates. Drawn by fate, they decide to live together. Their journey takes them through Berlin, Seoul and Tokyo, where they experience a breadth of emotions: unforgettable pain, suffering and, ultimately, joy.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=140882&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Soul Mate\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260505/1777965318867_dc571396d66b141fa5f8f3e26ff08dbf3tdPMz367L4p9MEWkxa9MeEmjAE.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":138115,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260505/1777965284696_ae0dc6206c6d0d210815a6f57ad68407gIC5zrpfSCvOTUozOMyWxEcg6rm.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Pete, an unlucky young man carrying a fragment of a demon's soul, has the ability to sense Yao—strange energies that devour life force and control the mind. When he crosses paths with Niran, a man gifted with the rare ability to alter fate itself and the one who leads him into the world of Wu, the two become unlikely partners, forced to rely on each other through every obstacle—until their souls are bound together.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=138115&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":9,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Wu\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260424/1777019455514_5df9d52490bf12227a681308f534ff365yUF8mQlT8JT82dDfSkmLAGUiJh.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":136456,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260424/1777019448828_0e95c46c623426058c6f3ff736a3adc05oc5QFYrlPmGlJZWBo9DwyynlUw.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A strict police officer with a painful past forms an unexpected bond with a young man struggling to raise a child alone.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=136456&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Love of Silom\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260425/1777125185251_027db35b364ba9808588fbc76ff87aa2scGPHhUGqXSTwuaqqHC1CcaRfx6 (1).webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":136529,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260425/1777125145615_1a149ba58897a00e1fa8c2d90d70500e123SH5RVqynQ7BwzKcq1O8mJKA0.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A cold CEO abducts a magical being to steal his irresistible scent, only to find the fragrance, and his survival, depends on winning his victim's heart.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=136529&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Flower Boy\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260702/1782986752098_8613fa57d1b4da3c644faf6e1a75f7e0胡2.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":132402,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260407/1775493520670_b19b95885a6c00dc4b39a091ae30ad22胡乱的深见君.webp\",\"introduction\":\"When secretly judgmental sales ace Kaji discovers the unexpected charm of his seemingly dull colleague Fukami during an overnight trip, their shared views on love ignite a passionate casual arrangement that slowly blossoms into a genuine romance.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=132402&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Unexpectedly Naughty Fukami\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260324/1774338906366_385322d56cb074d1a9ac9eb5b533a417微信图片_20260324155419_19_7.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":131128,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260324/1774338397070_d3021256618bbb03f57765f53380f6fap2930636942.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Finally, Spring\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131128&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Finally, Spring\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260317/1773716208784_d40f7917716d406378c025bb9072ed67sorV5TksqTAFDztNFjth5Tris1C.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":130275,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260317/1773716202168_67d54efdfe36a2b7acb5d7c4f9f125a6tD5NXyURSqBxjh09Ew2lWSHkpNr.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Arch-enemies Ha Neul and Sae Byeok are now lovers. After a 10-year memory gap, Ha Neul wakes to find his sworn foe by his side. Caught between feelings and lost time, a startling truth resurfaces. \\\"Wait, weren't we supposed to break up?\\\"\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130275&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Never Forget Your Enemy\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260313/1773406404387_fc56c389301e85b0f70efb6fc8663805ky8k5v71odYQjaIAuQmzpWYFWmz.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":130089,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260313/1773406418429_041fb1b47d02fc0083b13fca459eb4c787poJu88dlaReAe67HD6TUec1Cr.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Set in 1980s Kowloon Walled City, where triads run rampant, and corruption infects the police force, He Chu San dreams of studying hard and escaping the chaos. His plans collapse when Xia Liu Yi, a triad deputy leader, forcibly pulls him into a criminal scheme. As conspiracies unfold and power struggles intensify, the two men move from reluctant allies to partners in revenge. He Chu San, a calculating yet deeply devoted financial strategist, and Xia Liu Yi, a fierce but unexpectedly tender enforcer, find themselves fighting side by side. In a lawless city balanced between black and white, love becomes their most dangerous gamble. Can they carve out a path to survival for each other?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130089&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":9,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Sammy’s Children’s Day\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260314/1773489076369_c8aa3dc8a697aa15f6dcfd624235819a47alTFbslr8EW78EG6HeVjsLl2s.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":130095,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260314/1773489073165_ff145c4e005cc1a3bf0d75225588f85c7NEZmleIbrL7krMmZtWpl6ReuOn.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Elementary school teacher Pobmek doesn't like kids, but his boyfriend Teacher Solar does, and he likes Solar more than enough to make up for it. When he suffers an accident, however, Solar is left with brain damage, reverting mentally at times to the age of seven. After he takes \\\"Nong Sun\\\" back home, there are days when Pobmek doesn't get any respite from children.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=130095&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Love You Teacher\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260305/1772690222823_0b640acee9d28937737c6b9af3480afdmeJhZt0zDjC4IjGO12ThnTxxJZL.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":129090,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260305/1772690214275_7dd9ca003338b5f69b1ec93cb7dfe7afn3vbWmYzkDCYXQkSBpWa63GTK77.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After waking up as his 17-year-old self, a famous painter reunites with his first love and faces a rare chance to rewrite their story.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=129090&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Always Meet Again\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260304/1772617932074_542e5f8ecf3470da446d0ba04dbd2e90mJwZyF34XDygzbEqo5P0Om4Ig8A.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":129026,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260304/1772617925349_d9d0997cad82b7856c6d9fd0b0055e5btjP9D8j2r2VOd3tNhUk5Gmy1yXN.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A story of three young men of three different nationalities and three different styles who were adopted and raised as siblings and love each other as unwaveringly as if they were blood relatives.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=129026&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Love Like a Bike\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260227/1772206383264_7db0c51ecc1682091d49aaf51927ef462.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":128405,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260227/1772206379847_a0345edd90445ea25f034f7140d2186b1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Drama, directing, art, music, and dance majors are caught in a tangled web of competition, casual sex and vulnerability. Jack is directing his ex Dean on stage in a role that Raffy wants. Dean tries to get Jack's younger brother Rome to block Raffy out of his life. Part of the stage production of Romeo & Romeo is Tua who harbours feelings for starring actor and dancer Arnold.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=128405&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Only Friends: Dream On\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260206/1770347870856_9059d9939938da85aca8b5f97e8d2d3bvktbPNuzX7RnMCY4sqXfrthkb52.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":126887,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260206/1770347868177_f0fe6656ab556df83b937176bbb01a1dhNwqY2IqbcGEPTQ9nsWbUmR5pLs.webp\",\"introduction\":\"As Hae Jun and Jae Hun prepare to celebrate their first Christmas and New Year together, Jae Hun takes Hae Jun to another secret villa of his.\\n\\nWhat was meant to be a sweet memory soon turns tense with the return of their close friend, Kang Su Hyeok. Under the guise of a “best friend,” he methodically uncovers Jae Hun’s hidden past, turning long-buried secrets into sharp weapons, and seeks to leave the mark of a “third party” in their relationship—everything seemingly part of a cruel, twisted game. Amid the waves stirred by Su Hyeok, can their love survive the test and grow even stronger?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=126887&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Tide of Love Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260201/1769961048827_28259d29fa55954884d4ed780ff93758cSBAVqS2o88NkD5K3v5HSbWYEp8.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":126216,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260201/1769961046107_aef4f6e5941d1d066b158bdca115ebadsOXqyyyNaGnnCkucCnP5RHcjwho.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Pai and North, the nephews of a billionaire tycoon and heirs to the Jiramongkolthanan empire, fall victim to two scammers, Yu and Tim, who marry them for their fortunes! North secretly ties the knot with Yu, only to discover he's been conned. Worse, he can't get a divorce because he's already signed over part of his assets!! Meanwhile, Tim is busy planning his upcoming wedding with Pai.\\n\\nWill Tim be exposed as a scammer who has been playing Pai all along!? When love begins with lies, where does it lead?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=126216&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"My Romance Scammer\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251219/1766108907687_7e64342a785da738ee07442443f94223横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":118952,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251219/1766108902499_a1629b8a737de3d4308286f217d0e438竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"When Puifai dies after a night of partying with friends, new police inspector Kamin and Captain Jade, adversaries, compete to find out the truth behind her passing, even as their attraction grows. The case, however, proves not to be as simple as it first appears.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=118952&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Suspense\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Dare You to Death\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251222/1766370444921_23d9436203d8d29814fb380f0ebd39c9四方极爱IIf.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":119283,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251222/1766370428981_7f605e547cd4d16afec022bc2e645972四方极爱II.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The tangled relationships within Easter and North’s friend group begin to stir once again.\\n\\nTyphoon reunites with his former next-door older brother, Tonfah, only to find that the secret they left behind still hurts. Even so, he’s willing to return to Tonfah’s life in any way he can.\\n\\nDaotok, the artistic boy who can speak to spirits, is reluctantly pulled by his neighbor Arthit into searching for the soul of his late mother. Yet the more they chase after the dead, the more their living hearts fill with something new.\\n\\nTiger, the lonely youngest son of a powerful family, meets classmate Dueannao during football tryouts. Their first clash turns into warmth—one that makes Tiger want to cross the line from friendship into something more.\\n\\nThree pairs. Tears, goodbyes, and the fragile line between friends and something deeper—begin once more.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=119283&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":25,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Fourever You Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260126/1769393979930_4b5cecae9d428fb3a5a662364f1a8c68横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Variety Show\",\"dramaType\":\"VARIETY\"},\"id\":125541,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260126/1769393972574_817dd0ec2f47977decd5890eeff01ac6竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"The world of the series keeps expanding — and their love begins to move again. The fourth installment of a romance reality series that follows relationships between men.\\n\\nThis season is set in Korea during winter, with snow-covered landscapes. First meetings filled with tension and anticipation, along with unexpected reunions never seen in previous seasons, deeply shake the men’s emotions. As complicated feelings intertwine, the distance between them slowly narrows, and a one-week cohabitation under the same roof begins.\\n\\nWho will share a room with whom? Which choices will bring love closer, and which will push feelings further away? Every decision becomes a turning point in their romance. This time, harsher rules are added, and as emotions deepen through living together, hearts waver over casual words and small gestures, dramatically changing their relationships. In the limited time they are given, will they be able to find true love?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=125541&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Reality show\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"His Man Season 4\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260113/1768293500411_62b64b412b68b17775bf03f6c66bc656d1o28ieGegcKe3c0H0mreUDucAW.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":123442,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260113/1768293490695_8696972ff0d9d67bf75afa0bfd325b9duUoafeNRGfdVuJarhBuGOJH2PAc.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Despite the close bonds among fellow defectors, Cheol Jeon—a young North Korean defector—felt isolated while hiding his gay identity. Finally, he takes his first step into South Korea’s vibrant gay community and forms close ties after meeting Yeong Jeon at a casual gathering. Yet, a trivial misunderstanding shatters these fragile bonds.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=123442&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"3670\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260113/1768292366097_8f1487f444f77ba2ee9a17eed1e20919竖.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"Variety Show\",\"dramaType\":\"VARIETY\"},\"id\":123430,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260113/1768292356308_a42b6c514bc58a83b59a7892b1cd426f竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Every snowflake is unique — and so are the love stories that will unfold among a group of men at a snowy retreat.\\n\\nThis season shifts its setting to wintertime Hokkaido, where ten men stay together in a cozy lodge dubbed the Green Room. Surrounded by a blanket of white snow, they begin to discover both what they want in a relationship and who they hope to become as partners. From hitting the slopes together to sharing intimate conversations in a makeshift igloo, the winter wonderland becomes the perfect place for love to grow.\\n\\nOf course, it’s not all hot springs and leisurely sauna trips. The group is also tasked with operating a peppermint-colored coffee truck, taking turns working in pairs. Over 15 episodes, the housemates hope to develop slow-burn connections that are worth the wait — much like the drip coffee they serve.\\n\\nRanging in age from 20 to 40, the men live together for two months in the hopes of forming lasting bonds — and maybe even finding the boyfriend of their dreams.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=123430&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":15,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"The Boyfriend Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"18+\",\"sort\":1},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251128/1764318833257_8a72c77eb9aed9ed719c04ab5fffeedb1LQE7WzkgqSJFaKY1zWM6ExPdGm.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":116046,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251128/1764318828045_43521943797feb37cf6e3dae251bb40fepgr7n61vVIniyAghz2GYj22DkC.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Two rival hockey stars at the top of their game face an unexpected challenge when they develop feelings for each other, complicating their careers and the sport's expectations.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=116046&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Sports\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Sex\"],\"title\":\"Heated Rivalry\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251128/1764294944929_2796e0d25934a3536f2b6fff6348a2d08EGGAeaL5l7namXGdDFIYs2dx6d.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":115931,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251128/1764294941736_f3c228e8c1c82905217ae1d8cd24b40cfskuKS2wG3IlynvxPHTudpgcUam.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Bound by a debt, an illegitimate son moves in with his aloof cousin, unaware that their uneasy deal will spiral into a deep and dangerous obsession\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=115931&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"adult\"],\"title\":\"Thundercloud Rainstorm\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251117/1763344158705_c49ade2d281d18214044297d9497b99brjrZbVMN0vn7z4Tha20D7gNw4d2.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":114388,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251117/1763344153689_fbca3bf8f620e24507428dc4918d9ae2dqB2ZMpXYXbh0pOkSPw894xRxlv.webp\",\"introduction\":\"You Shu Lang, a director at a pharmaceutical company, lives an ordinary, stable life. But that all comes crashing down after he gets into a car accident with Fan Xiao, the heir to a Thai conglomerate who's returned to China for business. Unlike Shu Lang, Fan Xiao's life has been marred by instability, leading to a twisted, manipulative worldview. When Fan Xiao finds out that Shu Lang is interested in men, he devises plans to entice Shu Lang into a relationship, but ends up falling for Shu Lang for real. Shu Lang, on the other hand, is blindsided when he learns about Fan Xiao's true colors. Will Fan Xiao destroy the only genuine love he's ever had, or can he find a way to truly win Shu Lang's heart?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=114388&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":15,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"To My Shore\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":35},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"怦然心动的“她”\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":81157,\"homeSectionName\":\"Girl's Love: True, Lust & Delicate \",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260618/1781775867438_e288c4d58d6fab6bd41203abb36c36562.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":151227,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260618/1781775864553_c5c9499bdc6c48c8e2c4e95c769b60f01.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Coley, 17, from rural Oregon, navigates intimacy after her mother's passing. Meeting Sonya sparks new feelings, but self-doubt hinders their connection. Sonya, unfamiliar with dating girls, is uncertain. They learn to embrace emotions\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151227&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Girls Like Girls\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782396218393_d18af0089b338501fc5df4076cbf2f8bobtydOJh4gLfJUkv8zhrrKZO2oW.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":152898,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260625/1782396209417_b7458b4238e603f6fe116cb52d49fd4bobtydOJh4gLfJUkv8zhrrKZO2oW.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Disguise might be able to hide the truth, but it can never hide the feelings born within the heart. When a female bodyguard must protect a mischievous young lady who is the light of her life... how will this love story end?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=152898&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"My Lady's Bodyguard\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260619/1781869582393_1a4d63c5d8a5e5f6394ef91e5ee5c1312.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":151270,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260619/1781869578962_cefadcb914b24ee892ffd8acf6862eb21.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A glamorous lawyer and a Gen-Z heiress divorce after family pressure tears their marriage apart. But when a major business deal forces them to reunite and fake a happy relationship, old feelings begin to resurface. As love rekindles and hidden wounds reopen, the couple must decide whether their broken marriage deserves a second chance—or if some scars can never heal.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=151270&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":4,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"In Love Forever\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260529/1780045185529_f7eb73a3d05696483faf374dcbdc059f1gai54mpPozYCFCv1PlY94KPIvI.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":145882,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260529/1780045179015_0e42be67f4b30dd6f37fa584484962b94o1n1RjOjs3vTKmRtTx3YmswLsD.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After what was meant to be a one-night stand, guarded scientist Song melts into a romance with her hookup — who turns out to be her boss's daughter.\\n\\nThree women running away from love cross paths with three others who refuse to give up chasing their hearts — proving that love is what keeps the human spirit alive. No matter how hard we try to escape, in the end, everyone still wants to love and be loved.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=145882&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Chasing Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260525/1779697172106_6fa8fd081670122adc8a4fb81c4d463610 Rules before I Fell for YouS.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":144244,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260525/1779697161810_68b7a41bdc8fe508cdcd1d5970c812d510 Rules before I Fell for You.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Time, the bestselling author of \\\"10 Rules Before I Fell for You,\\\" believes love can be explained through theory. When she travels to a quiet countryside homestay to write her new book, she discovers the owner, Lean, is someone who once criticised her work online.\\nThe clash between someone who believe in the logic of love and someone who believe in pure feelings leads Time to test her ten rules for falling for someone.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=144244&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"10 Rules before I Fell for You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260504/1777826435412_fd0faf9f451fe4f4f33c87a1091d89c6Enemies with Benefits1.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":138095,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260504/1777827535453_9a550bbaeb3ae9ea6a89838387c73337b00c87579aac4056b459dc64c56c744a1777455759611.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Head of Sales Lan is determined to triumph over Head of Accounting Wine. Wine is her polar opposite, known for her mercilessness. When a wild night leads to a friends with benefits relationship, they'll do anything to keep it a secret.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=138095&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Enemies with Benefits\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260418/1776514572122_d688a58e18eeef49374e77cc1d4fe66alfICQwnICnGojvlMmrkcnLNt5iF.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":134889,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260418/1776514566626_e416026e5957bf94a8c3524d361f8babvCtIUnr7bwKMfg4Ouu5lcly7FJb.webp\",\"introduction\":\"At Thailand’s most elite girls’ school, rules are made to be broken. Six students and one teacher ignite a firestorm of scandal, desire, and digital revolution. As hidden loves and explosive secrets collide, they’ll shatter the myth of the good girl and redefine what it means to grow up in the age of viral videos and cancel culture.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=134889&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Shades\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260424/1777035723852_473f28595320a10c70fe6c949de41f212.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":136521,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260424/1777035719838_ed1a951b9d09af0642d4e4231c17bbd71.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"From college sweethearts to lifelong partners, Pafun and Aioon build a loving, devoted life together—dreaming of a family that seems just out of reach. When Pafun’s longing for motherhood deepens, their hope grows around the promise of adopting a child someday. Everything changes when their best friend, Nubnueng, returns unexpectedly and brings a life-altering opportunity. As love, loss, and responsibility collide, the couple must navigate heartbreak, resilience, and the challenges of becoming new parents. Fulfill is a tender, emotional journey that celebrates chosen family and the power of love to complete what life leaves unfinished.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=136521&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Fulfill\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260403/1775210048581_110c0bbc2f8a973a57b3615a0b4f8ba8nEzMQzOFnJGvV4NVaYGQhGYVgME.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":132388,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260403/1775210040883_3c2fdaf94fc68767d11869767f1591898LVRD8PUsUb4CJ561hOEy0xCRKg.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Si, a high-society heiress, dreams of becoming the president of her family’s company. However, her parents give the position to her younger sister instead, believing Si is too spoiled and irresponsible, spending millions without a second thought. When the family business faces a crisis involving a crucial land lease renewal, negotiations fail—until Klaokawi, the landowner, makes an unusual proposal: she will renew the lease only if Si agrees to marry her. Despite their completely opposite lifestyles, this strange arrangement brings the two into an unexpected and complicated relationship.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=132388&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Hometown Romance\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260409/1775666670240_407485486c9ab4dcd2ee1103a5dacad8绯闻营业中n.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":132778,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260409/1775666652249_a34dec813724ff2b76d45f91ddcfa470绯闻营业中.webp\",\"introduction\":\"In the highly commercialized idol industry, emotions are often manufactured and sold as part of the brand. Scandal Love follows four women navigating different levels of power within a K-pop girl group system. As they struggle with strict contracts, overwhelming public scrutiny, and their own genuine feelings, each is forced to make impossible choices. The series explores one central question: can real love survive inside relationships that are carefully designed and controlled?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=132778&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Scandal Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774835466364_ba5fcec7d339e11ed5615cc9c40b08ff2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":131644,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260330/1774835462071_dbc70d3c172d5c427750e74ed32e88591.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Arisa is a woman who seeks revenge on a capitalist behind her mother’s murder; but while doing so, she falls in love with the enemy’s daughter.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=131644&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Broken of Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260309/1773070718925_f5ab2583a9aefb9f032870d306ca86f871HVcRRtTkMdcEKmSzGWsF16EPx.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":129462,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260309/1773070715863_652d403f5e945dd8105ee715ac1fcd89qvXFXd4TXj9Ou8MS3dsZqgApsnP.webp\",\"introduction\":\"A friend group descends into chaos as their bonds are tested in a variety of ways, beginning with the return of an ex-girlfriend.\\n\\nPrim and Min are running an advertising company together when a new client Bambi, Prim's ex, shows up wanting to get back together. Adding to their circle is Prim's young stylist Gorya who's after a deeper connection, promiscuous and charming model Shasha, and Praew, the lesbian photographer from the bar bi-curious Min frequents.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=129462&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Girl Rules\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260213/1770961467460_1c378ff1923740c776fe7dd7b8142dfdjQvrRQgHpGqUCc5oT3GxSfvDWqO.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":127606,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260213/1770961461312_664836cf30fad33470c9e007103bebbdjQvrRQgHpGqUCc5oT3GxSfvDWqO.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Vicky, the daughter of a powerful police officer, has dodged assassination attempts and is now secretly in an elite training program. There, she meets Thara, a disciplined officer with sharp instincts. They’re forced to share a room, and their chemistry starts to change. But political conspiracies, a hidden murder, and a complicated past threaten to tear them apart. When Thara finds out that Vicky's father might be connected to her own family’s tragedy, their feelings are tested by duty, danger, and the cost of truth. They have to choose between justice and the love they never knew they had.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=127606&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":7,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Heart Code\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250609/1749458666030_5f2791ac7a7cc88fd121e9a25fde1b9a20221128_tsukutabe_01.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":94066,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251121/1763707714446_f8a812a11910369785d09eea93ca1195She Loves To Cook, And She Loves To Eat.png\",\"introduction\":\"Nomoto, a passionate home cook, invites her solitary neighbor Kasuga over when she cooks too much. An unlikely friendship blossoms as they enjoy her delicious meals together.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=94066&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"She Loves To Cook, And She Loves To Eat\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260212/1770904615730_415ecdb697a80922a66b05ef852e3e963pLP1RB5ee0zXkMKEnBTSK3m81A.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":127569,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260212/1770904611976_bde71a6b5c7439009700d9b55e2333ecisk1ShHQJR0zp7963J5qhQznYDw.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Pingrak is a good-looking university student, popular among her peers. Few know that she used to be a shy, bespectacled nerd whose first love was a stunning but ice-cold school senior. Then fate steps in. Pingrak is thrown back together with her first love, P'Charm, “the cold one.” As for Charm, she has no idea this beautiful woman is the same bespectacled kid who used to trail after her. What would she think if she knew this girl once had a huge crush on her?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=127569&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Frozen Valentine\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260130/1769743632772_7b032eb919aaabdb84d6cab261dd024a1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":126084,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260130/1769743628114_76af90357bfef0a227a91cbe290d65061.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"There were many reasons to marry the same person twice. For Phraenarin, the first time she married was because of her father's request. But the second time, she wanted to marry out of the deepest desire to honor the one she loved.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=126084&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Denied Love Special Endless\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251205/1764915908174_1ed14c4e591afc04ca89fecb6a5917cdcuojG4fZiOzp0KpCFG75yeJCI7n.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":116883,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251205/1764915903607_793ac853192cacc7b0772551270cf4d53NaKzcgs1Q9eush1St76DQIHapL.webp\",\"introduction\":\"When a charming house guest (Galitzine) arrives at a remote castle, the delicate dynamic between a neglectful husband, his innocent bride Cherry (Monroe), and their devoted maid Hero (Corrin), is thrown into chaos.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=116883&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"100 Nights of Hero\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250421/1745244082744_beb5bc4e5ae69d8999e1732b7fec6bc9khJx1wdufa8bq4aXRH6wlkUfOAZ.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":86981,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251105/1762323894452_2ba5df3a6d9e65abf2ccac4776c9b889wNb7PxdshRHLkJiDgfOuDB0IamA.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Bell Lalita is arrested on charges of drug possession. Though they aren't hers, with the evidence against her, her lawyer tells her she stands no chance of winning the case if were they to fight it. Left with no choice, she steps into prison with a sentence of fifteen months.\\n\\nLife in prison isn't as peaceful as she's hoped. She becomes targeted by a powerful group within the place. Even the warden turns a blind eye to their actions. She has no other choice; her last hope of survival lies with Claire Nineteen Scars, an inmate locked up for a serious crime who no one dares get close to.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=86981&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"ClaireBell\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251024/1761284405237_44b9c8b190bc95aa488963a3c57dde6fmWLgee5VumCSzvkfpGOkBXCoh5r.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":111867,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251024/1761284382059_95de88cef42392022e579495f2dbd56d9vJMTObP0s8ijwwDu1TJaoK18nd.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Alin and Jane are childhood best friend. They grew up together, living next door to each other. Unbeknownst to Alin, Jane has been secretly harboring feelings for her for a long time. One day, Alin leaves Jane to study abroad. Years later, a broken engagement brings her home, where they face feelings long unspoken.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=111867&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"My Safe Zone\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251005/1759672421359_aa9da7b940f695a827d391d3b9c9e1454f04i0kqSNweyCtWIh321gbW6iR.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":109749,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251005/1759672415077_41cad0e7ea42c497b18216d92c0b38fbamtHcdictKMPxo045gaMuXvxmi2.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Pun thought her life was falling apart when Pethai, the man she hired for a fake marriage, took her money and ran-straight into the arms of a mafia. Now she's back in Thailand, determined to track him down and get some answers. But it's not going to be easy. Her only hope? Ploy-a stunning, sharp-witted actress who holds the key to Pethai's secrets. To get what she needs, Pun will have to charm her way into Ploy's heart. But the more she tries to manipulate, the more she ends up falling for Ploy. What started as a game of love quickly turns into a romantic rollercoaster, and Pun may have just found herself on the ride of her life. In this game of hearts, who's really the player?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=109749&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Player\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250920/1758370499563_6c6eeaf30cf9192b0255b1594826580foTzt4Fe1IIwbn0ocJWPqkKk4CDu.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":108082,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250920/1758370491920_25dc2ce30dc32254b181e6083df71b37oTzt4Fe1IIwbn0ocJWPqkKk4CDu.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Love is a poison, intoxicating the hearts. Yet, in the end, it's poisonous love that makes the hearts race.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=108082&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":44,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Poisonous Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250811/1754877960405_d3030714d30bd11adfe3566a18b779f26r33JZ6wM0S7dRvGsi942UVUnvV.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":102338,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250811/1754877953546_4d6bdbdbbb285a9096b2ec871b8f1484pY6cNh8CoAaSgSOvOykatcE76gG.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Kee, a cool tsundere, and Peem, a mischievous rich girl, become inseparable friends. No one knows the truth, though, that really, they've been secretly in love with one another since high school.\\n\\nFrom handmade pork floss, a gear necklace as a token of love, to an accidental first kiss, hearts will be racing. But love is never so easy, and fate plays its tricks. The two are separated and it will be seven years before they meet again... as boss and employee.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=102338&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Somewhere Somehow\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250815/1755191216383_11faaccfec2dbd7488fa0a856218b3451.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":102957,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250815/1755191211048_f8917a48f976b1198e5945356ab50f1d1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Enemies since school up to entering the entertainment industry, Rey and Print meet again when they land roles in a highly anticipated series. One week before filming's to begin, however, something strange happens: their souls switch bodies.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=102957&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Queendom\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250814/1755136806127_9ba8aff2160761997db5466f611addb8横.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":102765,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250814/1755136801556_70124814e22dfd7e534a9ee303108688竖.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Living a carefree life has begun to take its toll. Jumping into a rollercoaster of a relationship is giving these thrill seekers a taste of feelings beyond joy.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=102765&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":32,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Roller Coaster\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250625/1750848184158_e6e043b489de31285a48566397e70d18afpJz3pIyG5mpUiYa9ngeXVJnfZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":96611,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250625/1750848178423_9c271b1cc92225ecff2e62011337ba00mWVDzFvAryOS4l1yA2ROpMTwQas.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Wan inherits her father's struggling grocery store and meets Maewnam, a loyal customer. Maewnam helps Wan's efforts to revive the business but conceals that her own family's company threatens Wan's plans.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=96611&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Whale Store xoxo\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250530/1748573276378_49f03510d2778dc0191941f3b32973e72.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":93146,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250530/1748573259269_3b44586c0e21ef3ccbfb4de864f5812c1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Her father's condition for coming into her inheritance is, Phraenarin must marry Khemjira for two years. No matter how that kid tries to seduce her, though, there's absolutely no way she'll fall for her. \\\"Khem does her homework well, though, will you not fall even a little?\\\"\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=93146&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Denied Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250627/1750990377872_5c98779be89afc5b654cfe41c6c6072c7uEnzvSHe7PkgSLyDX9hvgOVsrB.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":96738,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251126/1764143583424_baa9aa13099c5cf655c07ff2d8a82121Ayaka Is in Love×Love×Love with Hiroko 2nd Stage.png\",\"introduction\":\"Ayaka is in love with her senior colleague Hiroko. They both thought the other was straight, but after Ayaka's reckless advances, the two finally started dating!\\n\\nA year has passed since then. Ayaka has come to live with Hiroko, and they have begun living together. Hiroko is so dear to Ayaka that she has vowed not to make a move on her lightly so as not to hurt her, and is in super-doting mode! Meanwhile, Ayaka is vaguely worried about Hiroko, who never makes a move on her.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=96738&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Ayaka Is in Love×Love×Love with Hiroko 2nd Stage\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250508/1746681304715_cf216da0c7098e7df566bb9c13c44689p2920088343.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":89310,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250627/1751010151778_ec0dfa759bdfc74e1e313469ad528d82Even if You Become an Adult.png\",\"introduction\":\"Ayano, an elementary school teacher in her thirties, stops by a bar one day and meets another woman named Akari. Sparks fly as the two chat, and before the night is over, Ayano even goes in for a kiss. Akari is intrigued but confused… especially when she discovers that Ayano has a husband! Both Ayano and Akari are about to find out that love doesn’t get any easier, even as you grow older.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=89310&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Even if You Become an Adult\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250118/1737191289630_eeed979d241c945bf0c01f43ff044ab7xG3b2YNEBxYEY67BvsvvJk3n8D7.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":68725,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250123/1737634602651_13ae67840c3fe2063a2b919e15e538bf我们的爱情.png\",\"introduction\":\"Nineteen-year-old Dokrak decides to take a gap year to find herself after finishing high school. She has a part-time job at a at a coffee shop in the gallery Art & Us. It's here that she crosses paths with twenty-two-year-old dentistry student Pam who 's a regular at the café to hit the books. As she gets to know Pam, Dokrak develops a crush. When her brother, however, meets Pam, he falls for her at first sight. Kawi turns to Dokrak, asking her to play matchmaker. Because she loves him and wants to see him happy, Dokrak begins coaching him. As time goes on, however, she finds herself unable to ignore her growing feelings for Pam. Before she knows it, she's fully in love and Pam is Kawi's girlfriend.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=68725&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":48,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Us\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250115/1736930220699_c12bc1017e309b2b294d5c7eb89c51638FgzQadEF68NYvmTVyuY4pCtred.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":68052,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250115/1736930218690_8128bd84d0c31fffae938d8031bcc109794PfYjTz3yxMRdTRmdFYt6w6ff.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"New Jersey police lieutenant Laurel Hester and her registered domestic partner Stacie Andree battle to secure Hester's pension benefits when she is diagnosed with terminal cancer.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=68052&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Biography\",\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Freeheld\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":27},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"热门泰剧\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":83985,\"homeSectionName\":\"Thai Dramas\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260708/1783475845610_5ca7d1eacee7fd1d04510c8f7279bd62sPdNRrZgWl3j3wsAbDNWmveAAyc.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":154766,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260708/1783475839503_c956de2f64c99122f53f3280f2b6d7a7fizdLbNRs3R4G04j7p2nL0E7uJU.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Kay, a famous manga artist, finds himself under the watchful eye of Phat, the inspector overseeing a serial murder case, after the victims' profiles, killing methods, and crime scenes are found to bear a suspicious resemblance to scenes from Kay's old work. Thrown together by circumstances, the two must join forces to uncover the truth, solve the case, and track down the killer. Along the way, two strangers slowly find themselves bound by something that feels a lot like trust.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=154766&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":37,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 2\",\"rankId\":108,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":2,\"resourceStatus\":1,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Mr. Kill\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260516/1778925567023_a0cbbd3be60c7f8950325a25d37ccb78dKrWpfYiqVXVK3FfdMAFcYnF2Wa.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":141726,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260516/1778925559482_8e26f87e3bcb93c689990a1879341c2e7ISgZENoJ9j8bsEND9QOURjIQko.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After his adoptive father is killed by the secret organization Fire Phoenix, Taiga travels to Thailand to uncover the truth. Infiltrating a powerful corporation linked to the criminal underworld, he searches for the mysterious “Demon” while clashing with Rin, a guarded bodyguard who shares a tragic connection to the same conspiracy.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=141726&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":24,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Suspense\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Wicked Temptation\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260430/1777538187284_a180864e96cdfccc08a1c1e3f853cdd41oJSeynxNfGJm83de6bi83LetZR.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":138045,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260430/1777538180216_f03e671f7ba8cdc55a93c1f049704d791oJSeynxNfGJm83de6bi83LetZR.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Shen is a woman from a wealthy family who enters into a seemingly perfect marriage with Phoem, a promising government officer. Their relationship begins with happiness, but things take a turn when Phoem leaves for an extended work assignment abroad.\\n\\nDuring his absence, Shen faces constant pressure and mistreatment from her mother-in-law. The difficult environment leaves her emotionally drained, holding on only to the hope of her husband’s return. However, when Phoem comes back, he is no longer the same person. His cold and distant behaviour deepens Shen’s loneliness.\\n\\nIn this vulnerable state, she finds comfort in Tone, a driver whose presence brings emotional support and complicates her situation.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=138045&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":37,\"rankDesc\":\"HOT list Top 4\",\"rankId\":108,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Whisper of Desire\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260120/1768878623770_dfc9a1eea062be9b435c9561dc50d140横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":124525,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260120/1768878618875_bd4ed8f45cb0120fd279e785951fbd2e竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"\\\"If everything stayed the same, it wouldn't be called karma, right?\\\" When the world as it is still seems to need Nanno to shake things up.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=124525&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Girl from Nowhere: The Reset\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251204/1764816440590_3bf034a0a391a4be955bc376d50cf0f7p2927539735.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":116692,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251204/1764816432975_d7ef36dd199fe51838607deefdd581ccp2927539718.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Win, Game and Dear find themselves drawn back into the world they tried to leave behind. Under the command of Ae, a powerful local politician whose ambitions straddle the spiritual and the corrupt, they are forced to take part in a new “Mega Merit Project.”\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=116692&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Believers Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251105/1762336267501_d10c11b119cc5f108f1e21b841818d7a2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":113053,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251105/1762336338668_514e971f1de5f9c31c11cfeeed7c64891.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"These are the words Baikhaw said to Tulip when they first met—before their worlds would forever change. What begins as a beautiful friendship between two young women unravels into a dangerous web of envy and deceit. Baikhaw hides her jealousy behind a perfect smile, aided by Tao, her devoted high-school friend who’s long been in love with her and would do anything for her. On the other side, Tulip finds an ally in Namo, her caring university friend who always stays by her side and protects her. But revenge rarely ends where it begins, and this game of betrayal might just destroy them all. Because sometimes, the most dangerous enemy… is your best friend.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=113053&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Friendshit Forever\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250903/1756898153816_7374021bd9c67c1b842a92c5138ff97b2ns20NPWM2IGCp8qBtqwkjvhx1y.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":105241,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260209/1770624884795_274a690c30f1b3ba435efa411fbabff4The Thirsty Thirty.png\",\"introduction\":\"Welcome to your thirties. Are you ready to step into the dreams you've envisioned?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=105241&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Thirsty Thirty\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250812/1754979433620_cec34f0bc601ecae54c2ad01b3cc457fAAAABeUVvXTM59QvTm0Nfwfos27LBisxE17Ic5tBL0gop_BH5gjG01efHD8JPAakX8QD3Os2j3jqwGTeeo5g2d3ITDce2fcBLBMDiIL9.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":100171,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260206/1770372436927_986403f5d287df068cfe3a9f4ecf7bbeGemini_Generated_Image_v9j13sv9j13sv9j1.png\",\"introduction\":\"When the play “The Bloom and a Thousand Bees” is in being remade, it calls for a serious casting for the lead female role. Now, everyone in showbiz scrambles for and it seems they will do whatever it takes. Thus, the watchful eye of a certain group looms over this audition. What no one knows is that there’s a dangerous secret lurking behind the curtain, and whatever black magic is called upon.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=100171&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":5,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Enigma 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250912/1757642311048_7d4456099fe322cf54ed85a9897786beeJ9y4NjkS2t9VagGTEtTzOlkQcz.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":106749,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250912/1757642307270_bdebc00180b17b7896f560e6f1656342sXFgAo1X0HzjkpaTLBmgdtkP2gt.webp\",\"introduction\":\"High school senior Samut is an academic overachiever. He is a representative of his school competing in academic contests. His bright future, however, vanishes after he's involved in an altercation and expelled from school. He's transferred to a new school and, because of the trauma, loses his passion for school.\\n\\nOne day, Samut finds an ancient dice which brings him and seven other students into a mysterious board game. The eight students are competing, outsmarting, and backstabbing each other to stay alive in this mysterious game. Their lives are at stake and the only way to get out of the game is by defeating other contestants.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=106749&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Dark Dice\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250725/1753435152324_ca37626adcc721a93e58a597879148cbd2QvyfaT4ykIH6sNwNhhbV3A1xH.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":100163,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250725/1753435148755_9aa367128a9477297a45bb8de0bc2448d2QvyfaT4ykIH6sNwNhhbV3A1xH.webp\",\"introduction\":\"The story follows Phing, a famous spirit medium who unexpectedly gets involved in a wild party called Paradise Seven, a hotspot for hot young people, including four notorious playboys: Pi, Ter, Jock and Dung. Also present is Bam, a stunning and alluring woman who sets the party ablaze. With everyone drinking excessively and letting loose, the night spirals into chaos.\\n\\nThe next morning, everyone wakes up to a shocking sight, Bam's lifeless body. Phing, who happens to witness the scene, attempts to use her abilities to communicate with Bam's spirit and uncover her killer. Unfortunately, although she manages to contact her, Bam was so drunk on the night of the murder that even her ghost can't remember what happened.\\n\\nThe chaos escalates further when Lieutenant Dan, a passionate cop, steps in to investigate the case personally. With everything growing even more complicated, the big question remains, can Phing help Bam's spirit find the truth?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=100163&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":32,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Tipsy Mystery\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250701/1751339781597_569b451b68332b7b6d36d38ed43a7b462.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":97111,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250701/1751339773786_74707bdb66474a91cd0bae680b4b7dd52.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Chatfah, the youngest sister of the Bupphachinda family, has just received the largest share of her father's inheritance and is about to be married. However, Chatfah falls from the highest floor of a vacation home to her three older sisters' shocked eyes. When her body disappears, her three sisters—Baibua, Chomphu, and Picha—become suspects in her disappearance.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=97111&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Suspense\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Hide & Sis\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250920/1758354212689_fc94a43ba0558825ceefc948da82d5c32.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":108072,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250920/1758354207857_bef49b80dd7aa801bc940c91a0253def1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A serial killer known as “Head Hunter” terrorized Makhwan until he attacked a family, and one child survived. This led to his capture—a married surgeon with a child on the way.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=108072&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Mouse\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250604/1749026820489_bbae96e98e639572ab2f040bb59738df2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":93513,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250604/1749026817432_6089f14e72a95ac38a115e249c45cc2b1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Heaven Condominium might seem like a great place to live, but it soon becomes the site of a horrible tragedy. After someone living in the complex contracts a strange disease that causes a violent, zombie-like affliction, authorities lock it down to prevent the spread—with its inhabitants still inside. To try and stop the epidemic, police officers Run and Prat move in, but they soon find that their mission is more difficult than it seems. As the infection continues to spread, the condo residents grow aggressive toward each other, prioritizing their own survival above all else. Can Run and Prat find a way to deescalate the situation before it's too late?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=93513&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Happiness\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250527/1748329741383_7742de68866d1218096271a6afc389612.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":92727,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250527/1748329737734_293575fb4312642eae45c526c50612521.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Sun is tasked by the father of Sairung, a woman with dissociative identity disorder, to make all five of her personalities fall for him in an effort to fix her. One of her personalities, Manmok, becomes determined to throw him out of their lives.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=92727&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"I Love ‘A Lot Of’ You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250427/1745733541515_b5a35550c7181cad39e32f081f124f96cC7PnhSZNtaWsZhfjKkYYLXbrt0.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":87828,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250618/1750210289140_3579d60faa1aaf472c99af1dbad6d069Rabbit on the Moon.png\",\"introduction\":\"Jira is a twenty-nine-year-old bar host not a career he'd have envisioned for himself. Twenty-eight-year-old Phugh is a real estate agent from a wealthy family.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=87828&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Rabbit on the Moon\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231108/1699422704035_865d1677a883e99f337db3326e3e1f6efaceless-love-LL-1024x536.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":38283,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231122/1700623785489_50d9422cc4a2a40da74329e716c04071泰版富贵男贫穷女.png\",\"introduction\":\"Veekij is a stoic young CEO with prosopagnosia or \\\"face blindness,\\\" meaning he cannot distinguish people's faces. For this reason, he decides to hire an assistant to help connect him with the rest of the world. Mirin becomes the girl responsible for that. Will his condition be cured?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=38283&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Faceless Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250402/1743582848313_4511acc821f22033420352c51a7ae6e6微信截图_20250402163121.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":83481,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250610/1749542516032_142d94de75568dd46c7acb4d8833bf25Until the Sun Meets the Star.png\",\"introduction\":\"After a tragic car accident claims the life of Weha, his daughters Napdao and Namfah are left to navigate a world filled with hardships. Living with their gambling addict uncle in a slum, Napdao sacrifices her education to support her sister's schooling while Khimhan and Phromtawan struggle with their father's new mistress and half-brother. As they face challenges and pursue their dreams, they remain unaware that Ratri, who assumes another identity after spending years in prison, is actually Napdao's biological mother seeking revenge against Techit for tearing apart their family.\\n\\nWith unexpected connections forming between characters and hidden agendas at play, this story explores the complexities of relationships while unraveling the truth behind past actions. As lies are exposed and tensions escalate, everyone involved must confront their desires and face the consequences that await them on this tumultuous journey.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=83481&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":19,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Until the Sun Meets the Star\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250123/1737632516611_3357724589a061f55e1ada1a6661f076mqqOLB76zkJ72vqhWLchWskXxIF.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":69694,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250210/1739175412127_68e6d2a53e56d8f05c78f38176506378泰版金秘书为何那样.png\",\"introduction\":\"A capable secretary and a narcissistic boss fell into the love river, and at the same time revealed an unbearable past, which made them doubt that their feelings were real or the result of common trauma.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=69694&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Dear My Secretary\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250401/1743498195657_1fde731d71710992755bdbc3584953aey68HVMhys4PLZ4xy7sp0VhFN2a8.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":81405,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250401/1743498224544_ea1b64745abd33dbb6b45c81ee3c426f9NP7S7NlmAx52NZ31WRkIey8Tan.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Born on the day and night of February 29, Day and Night are each plagued by a terrible curse that, every four years, will take from them the person they cherish most.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=81405&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Leap Day\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250227/1740645313639_4eb342f3a786c11530f60a83e3195481横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":76207,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250227/1740645305933_2108a7e6b7f56530100e82b74b3bbc32竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"As the police race to track down suspects in a high-profile murder case, the mysterious death proves to be just the beginning in a series of dark revelations waiting to be uncovered. The series follows Dalah, a stylish floral designer hired to handle flower arrangements for the highly anticipated wedding of Ohm, the leading candidate for Prime Minister, and his bride-to-be Risa. Their upcoming nuptials had captured national attention as it was to have united two of the country's most prominent dynasties. When the groom is found dead on his wedding day, everyone becomes prime suspects in the murder investigation. Entangled in a web of secret affairs and high-society scandals, Dalah decides to sleuth her way to the truth, unraveling dark secrets and a conspiracy that reaches into her past.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=76207&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Dalah: Death and the Flowers\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220207/1644215482595_d90004573f3b6fc97f9fe89fcd333b88泰版流星花园10146横版.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":10146,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220207/1644215478998_567797b31dadee19a70897eac67c5318泰版流星花园10146竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"Gorya is a low-class girl will accepted into a prestigious high school attended by the wealthy. The school is was ruled by an elite clique known as the F4, consisting of 4 rich, handsome, and spoiled boys. Gorya is was the only one that stands up to their bullying ways, leaving all the boys in awe, especially Thyme, the group's leader. Almost instantly smitten by Gorya, Thyme was romantically pursues her, but she has no interest in him because of first impressions. She then falls for his best friend Ren, but Ren is in love with his childhood love. In all the chaos of school, Gorya will can't help but find herself falling for Thyme because of his generosity to her and her family, and his change of character.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=10146&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"F4 Thailand: Boys Over Flowers\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241125/1732531575658_d52fc9c4e37381b02deffbadf36a3624x4gJWy_3f.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":56794,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241220/1734660721674_69a2b384c20b438e1ea04ce950d1cba7蒂莎的抗争与重生.png\",\"introduction\":\"A young girl flees from her homeland to start over with her mother. But when a crime ring ruins her life, she adopts a new identity to take revenge.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=56794&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Thiicha\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241018/1729228006262_d24fdcfd824c528fac58280786b2cf15mWGMr5tXigNhWsGIt6tY1KoXHbg.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":53696,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241018/1729228002435_a86f8de5336c424644b53b930a8256bf8WJ9AqvqEjiVfMAvWjlhfgw4JRc.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Despite initial misunderstandings and reservations from their families, Wichai and Anong find comfort in each other's company.\\n\\nAnong is a high-society lady whom many men compete for, given her status, it's important that her family finds her a good match. Passionate lawyer Wichai finds himself randomly tasked with screening potential husbands for her. His duty is to eliminate unsuitable candidates and pave the way for his younger brother. However, Wichai redefines what it means to be worthy, leading Anong to realize that no one is more suitable than Wichai himself. He only sees her, however, as a sister-in-law. Anong attempts to win his heart, even if there's only a \\\"one in a hundred\\\" chance that a confident woman such as she could land a saint like him.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=53696&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":19,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"History\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"My Cherie Amour\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240611/1718087736315_65c1aca6a90353e38b4aa25db4b223ce致我们单纯的小美好(泰版) 剧照.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":44655,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240611/1718087725726_a6b98ed3bd06e88de49d45582d572dc7致我们单纯的小美好(泰版).png\",\"introduction\":\"Punn is the owner of a vintage shop. He's intrigued by his regular customer Jet, a museum owner with an air of secrecy.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=44655&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":18,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Because You're My First Love\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241029/1730187257708_de86bdbddb5ec4262e3fcc4bfe2cd76e横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":54212,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241106/1730894302407_fff45f770337fb57f73df539341184b31780_The Empress of Ayodhaya.png\",\"introduction\":\"From the perspective of a female emperor full of ambitious and ideal ambitions in history, the play tells the concubine (MAI) of the Eastern royal clan and the concubine of the Western royal family, the southern royal family, and the northern royal clan. The king's power staged a thrilling game of usurping power.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=54212&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":4.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"History\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Empress of Ayodhaya\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241104/1730724566477_7077d926e6323ee78172c1394124baff横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":54546,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241104/1730724560716_d5cae0ae9edacb0925624aa479970da1竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A mother and her young daughter flee to their family's abandoned mansion but soon find themselves haunted by paranormal incidents that lead to the little girl's mysterious disappearance.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=54546&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Don't Come Home\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231019/1697692206484_7a3cea8f5a72a62bb267e2d7c4230051横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":37912,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231019/1697692201313_4aedd27cb02b032efd30a1d02a526fb9竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When a junior woos Vee's friend, Bar, swearing to love only one in life, Bar has to cut ties with Mark. But God plays a joke on them and something happened between Vee and Mark. Mark chooses to tuck away and draws an end to it. However, Vee doesn't want an end with Mark. Mark himself loves Vee although he knows Vee has a beloved girlfriend. Will the love between them make it? When will the awkwardness break out? What will Vee do?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37912&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Love Mechanics\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240618/1718714857452_5566fdc7a2145f22a0377cfa13912806hxipSVUVrnbsgQjAIsmicGD4Ps1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":45666,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240622/1719046359077_60144eff62da6d9d3e95061c927e5b26曼谷名妓.png\",\"introduction\":\"Three women, a sex worker with big dreams, a girl seeking love, and another sold into the trade, fight to liberate themselves and reclaim their dignity.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=45666&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":14,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Costume\"],\"title\":\"Bangkok Blossom\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632624021161_69bcbd678f9b7c283c6a51b357f4e0f4画板 1 拷贝 425.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":1259,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211013/1634123917098_9e53c096e61bc9b6fbbea3d52caf79d19hDXqzN5l4lBmEtb8IstXr91k8z.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A mysterious, clever girl named Nanno transfers to different schools, exposing the lies and misdeeds of the students and faculty at every turn.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1259&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Girl from Nowhere Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240918/1726638922829_31a057398f245d80f167c95b9101ede4我的“坏”老板.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":51463,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240918/1726638893416_7701a66a0cc1a1022b0a622edb03978d我的“坏”老板1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Pat falls in love with his strict mixed-raced boss named Elyes. However, given their status, Pat can only keep his feelings secret, trying to maintain their relationship as boss and assistant.\\n\\nEven though Pat has set a boundary, Elyes doesn't make it easy for him. following him around and holding on to Pat so that he is by his side in the midst of billion-dollar business wars, where the rivals have eyes for the young assistant as well.\\n\\nElyes has to drop his arrogant attitude and shed the image of 'the bad boss,' who isn't lovable by others, even though shedding the old self isn't as easy as shedding the assistant's clothes!\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=51463&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Bad Guy My Boss\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"爱情神话\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84166,\"homeSectionName\":\"Myth of Love\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250513/1747115715700_fea001df179680c9a0499de3ae6dbd4c2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":90349,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250513/1747115720996_6ddfde00e8ef584542ce5f932bd6c21d1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Jin U and his friends, who are each experiencing the peak of their puberty, have their own unique interests and causes of trouble. The one common interest among them is Seon A, the model student who embodies both grace and beauty. To them, Seon A looks like an unattainable dream, even though she’s in the same class.\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=90349&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"You Are the Apple of My Eye\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250219/1739931496345_647386bf1c63aaca27b447385da0a562tt7dTwvfi4Ay0sHX2aJ5OPZh5HR.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":73768,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250219/1739931510082_3d2e19e0de80486c3ebc33b0bcfd3d73uX8Z3qWJ5OjV1uP7yT6yRlw9UL9.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A postapocalyptic romance in which a buoy and a satellite meet online and fall in love after the end of human civilization.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=73768&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Love Me\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250213/1739426530699_928069c08e26bfaad9d64aa09e1f85cdaf7HqyI1CSxV2febOcIxyMLLFbl.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":72138,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250213/1739429971999_b77c1fd1236e87d961d194a9c6ccbde2bioObjvmJdDRxnWM3TrQYaMUbAQ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"An 18-year-old girl moves from America to London with her mother and wealthy stepfather. She meets her stepbrother, and an attraction brews despite their efforts. Unaware, her estranged father tracks her down after release from prison\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=72138&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"My Fault: London\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250217/1739779963640_83e66628cfaac88cf4b679fdc06e828dlBcXozUeABairkTavz3X3ZAtOL0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":73366,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250217/1739779960250_3d027b199a1c5bd9c22eee38fe928574yu9dRyKcUHTfKcqsomUtpord4t3.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Local rebellious teenager Clotaire falls for his schoolmate Jackie, but gang violence leads him to a darker destructive path. After years apart, the star-crossed lovers discover that every path they've taken leads them back together.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=73366&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Singing & Dancing\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Beating Hearts\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250211/1739207161452_6e9f072edb7ca1561b13c1ef029bbceaqk9r1KRLE0IapvO7YO9seRsLPRT.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":71575,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250211/1739207158385_f67e73a81955561fab263211044743e5dcOi8eEsd3TkFo0CC8fpA2G8SAX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"This romantic comedy tells the story of a young girl who flees a top university in Bangkok to her hometown to ponder her future, telling her mom that she has a school break. Should she fight to graduate and take a path in life that will enable her to support her family, or should she pursue her own goals and dreams?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=71575&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"I Love You Two Thousand\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241228/1735387191662_49925f7fa9369e2eeb19c2e0d94bbbe1小心肝儿2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":65246,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241228/1735387185590_436a39f88c98e2d8489655b406ffe356小心肝儿1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A high-powered CEO puts her career and family on the line when she begins a torrid affair with her much-younger intern.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=65246&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Babygirl\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241119/1731993399715_76c8cb659dbdf85c1f52e291375e7998微信截图_20241119130918.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":55790,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241119/1731993395066_ac56c8f6c65e9bf3d8c0a94685824bba6kYDG8Imfhph2duBYZeYksHgx7L.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Despite their parents' efforts to separate them, Noah and Nick's love seems unbreakable. However, work and college open their lives to new relationships.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=55790&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Your Fault\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241211/1733901022976_09b89f9ae08592022addb415c6cb8989阿诺拉横版.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":60357,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241211/1733901014870_411fbded9cb89aac4863f8fd417e81e5阿诺拉.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Anora, a young sex worker from Brooklyn, meets and impulsively marries the son of an oligarch. Once the news reaches Russia, her fairytale is threatened as his parents set out for New York to get the marriage annulled.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=60357&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Anora\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241116/1731724512752_176188d4af89e7773f8101ad732e4d44lqnQ5O4l8NcF2IKjNknx5JRG7af.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":55538,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241211/1733908283881_ceaa749a2109b2f26a4271e234b3df51听说.png\",\"introduction\":\"Yong Joon works part-time at his parents' lunch box house. Yeo Reum lives only to support a hearing-impaired swimmer sister.\\n\\nOne day, Yong Joon meets Yeo Reum while delivering lunch boxes and falls in love at first sight. Yeo Reum slowly opens her heart to warm-hearted Yong Joon.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=55538&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Hear Me: Our Summer\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240311/1710126861724_21df287c866fc6ad7749bf118e8a8230pk5ibyxRfwhqJSjzjCwlP0hadHE.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":42031,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240311/1710126857799_0a964d798c1c9f76a4f7b6f8173b34dfY5P4Q3q8nrruZ9aD3wXeJS2Plg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Solène, a 40-year-old single mom, begins an unexpected romance with 24-year-old Hayes Campbell, the lead singer of August Moon, the hottest boy band on the planet.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=42031&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The Idea of You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230614/1686709786396_64af1cd3582b955bfc04233f838b481ezpY97OUNunOAPIxXYO4ZUGl7fnK.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":22264,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220719/1658200586663_dc3e5077d40a9cc09ba4f203f11dff70clAMlA3DcwKMJIYeAFGGN0vyJQp.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Cassie Salazar and Luke Morrow couldn't be more different. Sharp-witted Cassie works nights at a bar in Austin, Texas to make ends meet while pursuing her dream of becoming a singer/songwriter. Luke is an Army trainee, about to ship out for duty, who finds comfort in the unswerving discipline of service. But a chance encounter at Cassie's bar changes the course of both their lives. Cassie is drowning in medical bills after being diagnosed with diabetes.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=22264&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Musical\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Purple Hearts\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211020/1634710683986_21c2cd5c8bd047fa1e9756b4f36fa12aAfter We Fell.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3881,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241105/1730793814691_7923a6ad7ff39db4a5cbfe376a72530adU4HfnTEJDf9KvxGS9hgO7BVeju.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Just as Tessa makes the biggest decision of her life, everything changes. Revelations about her family, and then Hardin's, throw everything they knew before in doubt and makes their hard-won future together more difficult to claim.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3881&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"After We Fell\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240407/1712457449238_09c389ba8349285a3ad2ac68a3ec054a竖.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":42763,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240407/1712457439413_1649213043374efc86a3a74cb6889bf5横.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Sometimes our greatest fear is accepting that someone can honestly love us for who we are. Nica and Rigel are ready to find it out together.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=42763&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Tearsmith\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240208/1707381943835_afae107324460fdaf57ba314e78d4ff31PkBhxXdEejw8c5BC7T3cN7jz9g.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":41188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240218/1708221350522_617a75d56666fbe124bd3c3cc251b9588.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After an amazing first date, Bea and Ben's fiery attraction turns ice-cold--until they find themselves unexpectedly reunited at a destination wedding in Australia. So they do what any two mature adults would do: pretend to be a couple.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=41188&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Anyone But You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241112/1731398969716_1339c109e1672d2cb2b1e05183c507c3横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":55147,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241112/1731398962931_a8bb5dd5e5676900aa78d4b6f00af6c4竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A young boy befriends the spirit of a 1920s girl lingering in his new home, forming an unlikely yet profound bond across decades.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=55147&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Girl Haunts Boy\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230810/1691647272534_07955f0bd8dac3d1dcd15b8f93fc1a5d6.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":34846,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230810/1691647223091_35566a08cdbd50c1b50db18831747bd01.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"On the brink of losing her home, Maddie finds an intriguing job listing: helicopter parents looking for someone to bring their introverted 19-year-old son out of his shell before college. She has one summer to make him a man or die trying.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=34846&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\"],\"title\":\"No Hard Feelings\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220111/1641887153051_9a73575a538f1c436a3ec34f67bee386mcSQa6hyBY3kLj0Eaey2K1Ev852.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":10574,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220112/1641955620510_a60422b49adf4816d3667095dedb16a81nXN4e3IoTJD42ci7WHZeI1Cgpm.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Maggie (Hathaway) is an alluring free spirit who won't let anyone - or anything - tie her down. But she meets her match in Jamie (Gyllenhaal), whose relentless and nearly infallible charm serve him well with the ladies and in the cutthroat world of pharmaceutical sales. Maggie and Jamie's evolving relationship takes them both by surprise, as they find themselves under the influence of the ultimate drug: love.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=10574&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2010,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Love & Other Drugs\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230614/1686709531057_24e5d052ce61bb87df7923cd64ae231epNOccytgkGuyofTLmh1sqEfTJuE.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":34618,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230612/1686538244070_2c10854a04a43d576f015593d76175de7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Noah has to leave her town, boyfriend and friends behind and move into the mansion of her mother's new rich husband. Their she meets Nick, her new stepbrother. They secretly fall in love madly.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=34618&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"My Fault\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220425/1650871835603_6a826202f7baa52200943dd706f8b5f4j9V2HVQKiyu2FzAckXK2q6b44wc.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":16781,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220425/1650871825706_a27ff5d62687cce6eb9746c28a3a5a11cBpef6K40Su2CcBb3c18WdwRFCL.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The life of a simple bookshop owner changes when he meets the most famous film star in the world.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=16781&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":1999,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Notting Hill\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632798900553_ac93d494ef605fb0b8bf539177666992meGzYSwHzBWNQk9lYVNxdUrFqiC.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2762,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632798893294_5b4267e4e5301c3d775a62d546a1856buDO8zWDhfWwoFdKS4fzkUJt0Rf0.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Aspiring actress serves lattes to movie stars in between auditions and jazz musician Sebastian scrapes by playing cocktail-party gigs in dingy bars. But as success mounts, they are faced with decisions that fray the fragile fabric of their love affair, and the dreams they worked so hard to maintain in each other threaten to rip them apart.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2762&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Musical\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"La La Land\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"另类超英\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84278,\"homeSectionName\":\"Alternative Superhero \",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250505/1746446147850_cfff2845af8ba63844bd89ba0852f1cb2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":88805,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250505/1746446137330_aab9195a3200e94c5b6050e010a334da1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After finding themselves ensnared in a death trap, an unconventional team of antiheroes must embark on a dangerous mission that will force them to confront the darkest corners of their pasts.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=88805&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Thunderbolts*\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210916/1631780524740_80f0697d5fb179461058de8e375b42c7uXsE8WOKB55GxLMfvMxmNVq6yMk.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1877,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240806/1722924170935_c247ee3d45154ed3d384fc3443abab9dwg3MLoL0wEtY2r2pbtdK5aF6e6F.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"This is the origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1877&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Deadpool\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220113/1642041982237_bdbb241e2b1a9085970aaa2937aadde5bEAQfLTykGg232kJogBlxRYaRqU.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":10698,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220113/1642041967797_26a1bff7967c227e656f2d947acae570sCmwhWMMNStxkKi078eEx1CpyB8.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Wolverine comes to Japan to meet an old friend whose life he saved years ago, and gets embroiled in a conspiracy involving yakuza and mutants.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=10698&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"The Wolverine\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638344944638_412dc2f11995866dfe042bc4b28aac1b3P52oz9HPQWxcwHOwxtyrVV1LKi.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1883,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638344884971_89c0ec06634e3c085919343371bec708to0spRl1CMDvyUbOnbb4fTk3VAd (1).jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After losing Vanessa (Morena Baccarin), the love of his life, 4th-wall breaking mercenary Wade Wilson aka Deadpool (Ryan Reynolds) must assemble a team and protect a young, fat mutant Russell Collins aka Firefist (Julian Dennison) from Cable (Josh Brolin), a no-nonsense, dangerous cyborg from the future, and must also learn the most important lesson of all: to be part of a family again.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1883&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Deadpool 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632624067041_7a25cfc27a5c9c9bfe95a01a3307972aAvengers_ Endgame.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1749,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211105/1636113345450_7ec3fbe341667496b620151f6f4b7cd636CTH2SPmt4DRcsAP2iZUw0SBtE.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War (2018), the universe is in ruins. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers assemble once more in order to reverse Thanos' actions and restore balance to the universe.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1749&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211221/1640055315284_6e614de84043d7a34bdcfe9377e5ab20p2771212640.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":8084,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220312/1647052303811_d94d9b24e1de4c6e1f9d36ba57d33d071639710975272_2b9fecba9ec05b00566e58006089e9ca1g0dhYtq4irTY1GPXvft6k4YLjm.jpeg\",\"introduction\":\"With Spider-Man's identity now revealed, Peter asks Doctor Strange for help. When a spell goes wrong, dangerous foes from other worlds start to appear, forcing Peter to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=8084&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Spider-Man: No Way Home\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210917/1631846374079_d2d9e3fafbeb2529f270876c76c23054VuukZLgaCrho2Ar8Scl9HtV3yD.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2548,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210917/1631846370937_52acc92b775e6407e078cb432f5bd5e02uNW4WbgBXL25BAbXGLnLqX71Sw.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A failed reporter is bonded to an alien entity, one of many symbiotes who have invaded Earth. But the being takes a liking to Earth and decides to protect it.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2548&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Venom\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230509/1683599487333_915519a2b4e1edec223f49fc67de8502银河 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":33727,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230509/1683599484535_9da770ed59343cc74668e4b93789cfdf银河 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Peter Quill, still reeling from the loss of Gamora, must rally his team around him to defend the universe along with protecting one of their own. A mission that, if not completed successfully, could quite possibly lead to the end of the Guardians as we know them.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33727&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210926/1632624604271_cae3ef2805a8c84bf10d6c0322a915c5Captain America_ The Winter Soldier.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":1752,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632911454887_af1678125eefc45285a67d2a65ebdda5wxwt0pLxFZwKzy7pAu8WixadwqO.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"As Steve Rogers struggles to embrace his role in the modern world, he teams up with a fellow Avenger and S.H.I.E.L.D agent, Black Widow, to battle a new threat from history: an assassin known as the Winter Soldier.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=1752&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Captain America: The Winter Soldier\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230220/1676864117389_4b4eb028ad0136943b5046ceb3d00eea蚁人 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":31301,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230220/1676864114672_b0b99e18ae085aa9d914d7e73d0c6cad蚁人 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Scott Lang and Hope Van Dyne, along with Hank Pym and Janet Van Dyne, explore the Quantum Realm, where they interact with strange creatures and embark on an adventure that goes beyond the limits of what they thought was possible.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=31301&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632889452441_2346b87d68b39c3e934d5bba8cc1011eqhPtAc1TKbMPqNvcdXSOn9Bn7hZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2806,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632889447875_df4311163c37a89a780c65bc546f61b0qhPtAc1TKbMPqNvcdXSOn9Bn7hZ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Marvel's \\\"Iron Man 3\\\" pits brash-but-brilliant industrialist Tony Stark/Iron Man against an enemy whose reach knows no bounds. When Stark finds his personal world destroyed at his enemy's hands, he embarks on a harrowing quest to find those responsible. This journey, at every turn, will test his mettle. With his back against the wall, Stark is left to survive by his own devices, relying on his ingenuity and instincts to protect those closest to him. As he fights his way back, Stark discovers the answer to the question that has secretly haunted him: does the man make the suit or does the suit make the man?\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2806&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Iron Man 3\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"王的女人\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84293,\"homeSectionName\":\"The King's Woman\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260202/1770018837251_870d6bd3a44008bfbbd37fb590da4ef721世纪大君夫人0.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":126366,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260310/1773136575252_d43263153400f740254d8bec97999c5cuyau9OSO6Je9mfBHPiAlLv97DzD.webp\",\"introduction\":\"In a modern Korea with a constitutional monarchy, a Chaebol heiress and a powerless prince enter a contract marriage, discovering love and courage as they confront social barriers and personal scars.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=126366&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":null,\"rankDesc\":\"Popularity above 30000\",\"rankId\":null,\"rankType\":0},\"releaseTime\":2026,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":12,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Perfect Crown\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211013/1634117556443_d66606b3414d33f86a8684be300aa2feKing 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":3309,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211013/1634117553146_e89e9bacb9cacacc9b29ebba54f66662King 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In 1994, the Kingdom of Corea encounters severe upheaval. The King is murdered by his brother Lee Lim and the King's son Lee Gon is stabbed in the neck, but he survives. The murderous Lee Lim seeks to possess the Manpasikjeok, which is legendary flute that holds supernatural powers. After a mysterious figure appears with a gun, Lee Lim slips away with only half of the now broken flute. The young Lee Gon holds onto a police badge he grabbed from the mysterious figure. The next day, Lee Gon is appointed the next ruler of the Kingdom of Corea. 25 years later, in the autumn of 2019, King Lee Gon governs the Kingdom of Corea as its benevolent leader. He is still haunted by what happened when he was a child and the mystery behind the police badge left by his savior. The police badge he held was issued on November 11, 2019 for Lieutenant Jeong Tae Eul. Autumn 2019, in the Republic of Korea. Jeong Tae Eul is a detective in the Violent Crimes Division at the Seoul Jongo Police Station. She is working undercover to take down the operator of an illegal online gambling operation. Meanwhile, in the Kingdom of Corea, King Lee Gon chases after someone that is dressed like a rabbit with a clock. King Lee Gon has a feeling that the person dressed like a rabbit may be his mysterious savior from 25 years earlier. King Lee Gon mounts his horse Maximus and enters the forest. Soon, he crosses over from the Kingdom of Corea into the parallel world of the Republic of Korea, where Lee Gon finally meets Detective Jeong Tae Eul.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3309&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The King: Eternal Monarch\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211020/1634703504849_200d51c5e9186989050443af43353eff王后 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":3856,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220915/1663240689285_251301754e415ed30cd6b812e8e2480d11.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In the present day, Jang Bong Hwan is a chef who works for the country's top politicians at the Blue House. He has a free spirit, but his spirit somehow finds its way into the body of Queen Cheorin (Shin Hye-sun) in the Joseon period. King Cheoljong (Kim Jung-hyun), the reigning monarch, is a gentle and easy-going person. However, he is only king in name. Queen Sunwon (Bae Jong-ok), the late King Sunjo's wife, wields true power in the country and has relegated King Cheoljong to a figurehead. Her ambitious younger brother, Kim Jwa Geun (Kim Tae-woo), also desires power. Queen Cheorin soon discovers that King Cheoljong is not what he seems, and that he has a dark and suspicious side to him.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3856&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"History\",\"Romantic\",\"Costume\"],\"title\":\"Mr. Queen\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211108/1636351530300_4dd1889eccbcdd9a8e079f4495be0138aYagJuQhXpeuq9PEc5ktrk9eukc.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":5764,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221025/1666667629779_ae76cc24cf07d45c60605323b43f2fa01647682175227_ae76cc24cf07d45c60605323b43f2fa0c0xkumbQcInSXSYjJVIm7SnQ9H5.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Spirited art student Shin Chae-Kyung's life turns upside-down when she is told she has been betrothed to her classmate, Lee Shin, who also happens to be the crown prince of South Korea. To save her family from debt, she agrees to the marriage. But complications arise from all sides. The newlyweds can barely stand each other. Shin still pines for former girlfriend and ballerina Min Hyo Rin. Chae-Kyung finds adjusting to palace life difficult. And after years abroad, Lee Yul returns. A past family scandal had displaced him from the line of succession. Now, he is caught between his mother's machinations and his growing feelings towards his cousin's young bride.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5764&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2006,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":24,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Palace\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210918/1631949326695_a26139838e03f9e0e18a77dd68e28abd3yEHM2HT2vrUtO93YzTJNgEfiZG.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":2595,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220909/1662704688454_0c37738be0593210a88911a9fb18db0e爱的迫降竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"The absolute top secret love story of a chaebol heiress who made an emergency landing in North Korea because of a paragliding accident and a North Korean special officer who falls in love with her and who is hiding and protecting her.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2595&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"Crash Landing on You\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211111/1636610522462_a982c853c9ea97b9b001bf5fce6b66756C5m9nzCTB0ijS9PjYus0eTYpct.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":6153,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211111/1636610519784_3f4d980e7609656a1e72f7c9139ef5b6kWJw89ce4gxGREKxaFSiQmETWQN.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in an alternate universe, in which Korea is a constitutional monarchy in 2018, Oh Sunny is a bright and vivacious musical actress who marries the emperor. She becomes involved in the palace power struggle and a mysterious murder that sets off events that threaten the monarchy itself, while searching for true love and happiness. But, she ends up falling in love with Na Wang Sik who works as a bodyguard for the imperial family. He started working in the palace to take revenge on the person responsible for his mother's death.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6153&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":26,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"The Last Empress\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211027/1635324276329_ffb3df1ea930086424bf093632650650七日 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":4685,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211027/1635324273599_5682e73f09a9da88aa48f2cc6f49da00七日 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Kyung is the daughter of a powerful politician during the Joseon Dynasty. She falls in love with Crown Prince Lee Yuk, who lives under the tyranny of his half-brother, King Yeon San Gun. When Lee Yuk rises to the throne and becomes King Jung Jong, Chae Kyung becomes Queen Dan Kyung, who becomes caught in the cross-fires of different political factions as well as the jealousies between the brothers When Dan Kyung's own father stages a coup against the king, Queen Dan Kyung is dethroned only after seven days and expelled from the palace. What will happen to the love between the king and queen when they can no longer be together?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=4685&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2017,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Queen For Seven Days\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231016/1697451667837_6430cadeaeef447a2f0f7f9a78ec0592p2890271804.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":37841,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231122/1700622556300_0fcc859e3f785ce2d89f57cc98cece85c9xQuvJKm46nVJ913EeFqyLJWmR.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"About chaebol heiress Do Do Hee who is everyone’s enemy and the demon Jung Koo Won who loses his powers one day as they end up living together. Jung Koo Won is superior to humans in every way, but when he loses his powers, he will have to work with Do Do Hee to recover them, and romance begins to bloom in this process.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37841&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"My Demon\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211110/1636538033962_8d48679fcc459193a1c5577f2355cf1c恋慕.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":3252,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220719/1658201948599_4b56f0915e0f2c481df921ab1f2c6456恋.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Crown Prince's wife gave birth to twins, but twins were considered an ominous sign. The twin daughter was supposed to be killed, but her mother begged to save her life. Secretly, the twin daughter is sent out of the palace. A few years later, the twin son Lee Hwi dies due to a disease. The Crown Prince's wife hides her twin son's death and brings her twin daughter back to the palace and raises her as Prince Lee Hwi. Lee Hwi eventually becomes a crown prince, but she is afraid her real identity will be revealed. Because of her secret, Lee Hwi is unable to have anyone close to her. She hides her emotions from others and she makes biting remarks. Jung Ji Woon is Lee Hwi's teacher. Jung Ji Woon comes from a noble family. He is handsome, smart and an optimist who enjoys life. Crown Prince Lee Hwi develops feeling for Jung Ji Woon.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3252&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"The King's Affection\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230508/1683535039562_973a30bdc27ab9efbd56e0af696dedfeking 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":33710,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230518/1684403707756_27f7e6054df424dc85dae578df12edc3King the Land.png\",\"introduction\":\"Graceful, charismatic, intelligent, and chic, the heir of King Group Goo Won has everything but memories of his mother. In an attempt to recover his memory, he returns to King Hotel. Known as King Hotel's queen of smiles and hospitality, Cheon Sa-rang worked her way up from the front desk to now work at the glamorous \\\"King the Land\\\" space, where she meets Goo Won.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33710&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romantic\",\"Youth\"],\"title\":\"King the Land\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211020/1634703720647_b1279a0a73c1dc9bb5ed0947a4b71e22月光 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":3857,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220805/1659681106738_a222f2284d643da1ee149a1b0437b79bqKir5S1ka8UkWVo8aGW9T19IIHC.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"There is a crown prince who falls in love with his political eunuch. Yet, Lee Yeong, the prince, knows he cannot possibly propose his feeling. Meanwhile, Hong Raon, the subject, is scared she might show herself in true colors. What are they? Friends or lovers? Should they not have met each other?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3857&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":18,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Love in the Moonlight\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211122/1637576792041_7b9ec2013c4f5c68bdb32de712d713c84kUZ8OkcafQri7vn3ADLlDel9S0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":6962,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211122/1637576788393_72605986103d00880c4a8263a45306ca7eVpYaLdFperkEV7LHlapQlN3Wu.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Kang Eun Bo (Jin Se Yeon) is a woman on a mission. When her twin sister is murdered, she vows to find the killer and bring them to justice. But during the ultra-conservative Joseon Dynasty era (1392-1910), the only woman with the power to order a manhunt for a murderer is the Queen. So Kang Eun Bo resolves to win the prized royal title so she can one day avenge her sister's death. To do so, however, she must first win the heart of Joseon King Yi Kyung (Kim Min Kyu). Yi Kyung grew up in a time of great political unrest, and is less interested in matters of the heart - and more concerned with bringing peace to the realm. Kang Eun Bo soon discovers that winning the king's favor will not be easy - the royal court is also inundated with beautiful young women, many of whom hope to wed the king. But when the king suddenly realizes that he recognizes Kang Eun Bo from a dream, the two begin to form an unlikely bond. Will Kang Eun Bo ever find her twin's killer? And could love bloom between the streetwise Kang Eun Bo and the idealistic king?\\n\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6962&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\",\"Costume\"],\"title\":\"Queen: Love and War\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211116/1637044350101_5cb8cf273bc59ac16878a0c79ea4ad3epefCiIoIrWglxwpoqIdnhL0IlGZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":6495,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220816/1660640540006_63ecd8e5f8899ae7c8450cfe575b9f86男孩.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The story of the woman depicts her struggles to become empress and to protect her love.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=6495&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":51,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Costume\"],\"title\":\"The Empress Ki\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210918/1631949534680_6cd691358fe70e502669c1f6b9f6523d3GC4cfyGuUkSx4EMZms2KccUGDg.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":2596,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240312/1710224016145_6da0171138678a44f9f17c71b44b1b421.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Nestled deep in the heart of Seoul's thriving downtown sits a curious hotel, the like of which no one has ever seen before. Old beyond measure, the building has stood for millennia, an ever-present testament to the fact that things are not always what they seem. Running this hotel is Jang Man Wol, a greedy, suspicious soul who has spent the past thousand years acting as the establishment's CEO. Cursed for a sin she can no longer remember committing, Man Wol is doomed to spend all of the eternity running this odd establishment, catering to the needs of a most peculiar clientele. Her only hope of escape is to find someone who has committed a worse sin than her own but after a thousand years, she's beginning to lose hope. However, things take an interesting turn when Goo Chan Seong shows up. Once the youngest assistant manager ever to work at a multinational hotel corporation, Chan Seong finds himself forced to manage the Hotel del Luna because of a deal his father made with Man Wol years ago. A stickler for rules and regulations, he's a perfectionist to the extreme but that may be exactly what this odd establishment and its cursed CEO needs.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2596&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Hotel Del Luna\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"奥斯卡获奖片单\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84496,\"homeSectionName\":\"Oscar-winning films\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260204/1770183915124_67a1ccd01d2366314c1930202b9fbaabyt9m5CiU2MZkQoNl1kqLPODNR4t.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":126651,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20260204/1770183906919_15102639c11cef5bab96c4fcd52cc0c3vbeyOZm2bvBXcbgPD3v6o94epPX.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After losing their son Hamnet to plague, Agnes and William Shakespeare grapple with grief in 16th-century England. A healer, Agnes must find strength to care for her surviving children while processing her devastating loss.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=126651&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"History\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Hamnet\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250612/1749701953550_31d539b3ab355a372cb597ac57568ed0oRxHRlSetf49evkXLsqkAzofJo2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":94485,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250612/1749701936568_f7d6523dd725a3ff347060c8c3efd527zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A world-renowned K-Pop girl group balance their lives in the spotlight with their secret identities as demon hunters.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=94485&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Musical\",\"Singing & Dancing\"],\"title\":\"K-Pop: Demon Hunters\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251105/1762322971629_ce12fe9ea2383c77d471219f5e106082pN3eaCl3sqwrerU8UNdp40F2mK0.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":112979,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251105/1762322964743_b390f9ae7b73d1b0181a8206484e10a15bxrxnRaxZooBAxgUVBZ13dpzC7.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Jake and Neytiri's family grapples with grief after Neteyam's death, encountering a new, aggressive Na'vi tribe, the Ash People, who are led by the fiery Varang, as the conflict on Pandora escalates and a new moral focus emerges.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=112979&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Avatar: Fire and Ash\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251010/1760062423870_d821a3248f8a28ed7034366fdc9ff9c6sy7Y4jCDsGPCzoQIEmxqAgPjAgr.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":110036,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251010/1760062413739_5f21007846d041d9203188881e079d135fqmZYw3o22VoJpXx9bjQuc7ZPV.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Oscar-winning director Guillermo del Toro adapts Mary Shelley's classic tale of Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist who brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=110036&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Frankenstein\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241211/1733901022976_09b89f9ae08592022addb415c6cb8989阿诺拉横版.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":60357,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241211/1733901014870_411fbded9cb89aac4863f8fd417e81e5阿诺拉.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Anora, a young sex worker from Brooklyn, meets and impulsively marries the son of an oligarch. Once the news reaches Russia, her fairytale is threatened as his parents set out for New York to get the marriage annulled.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=60357&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Anora\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250107/1736242891903_3411ae3a915196dba7ab60d4ec1985bb粗野派2.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":66762,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250107/1736242888003_dc4c68263ac6b1ff3005631697c75797粗野派1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When a visionary architect and his wife flee post-war Europe in 1947 to rebuild their legacy and witness the birth of modern United States, their lives are changed forever by a mysterious, wealthy client.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=66762&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"The Brutalist\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241113/1731486068385_3863fddd9bbe573bdc33d81818adb875横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":55248,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241113/1731486061197_b7e2afe4f7077def7d65344b53ddf812竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In Mexico, a lawyer receives an unexpected offer to help a feared cartel boss retire from his business and disappear forever by becoming the woman he's always dreamed of being.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=55248&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Emilia Pérez\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241231/1735639713055_3b35599a0985c67d867dd6c5f0d2cf77nGC3ZkXEcjGbqAAonS1xn6gaNpb.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":65790,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241231/1735639709583_09791dd8a298989dc12cc66d79f3c78338lb62nJcNvVgCDkFt2wiVE0bX4.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Mismatched cousins reunite for a tour through Poland to honor their beloved grandmother, but their old tensions resurface against the backdrop of their family history.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=65790&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"A Real Pain\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241124/1732448789575_9974b34fdf11fe948d75958304dbd5c4uVlUu174iiKhsUGqnOSy46eIIMU.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":56650,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241124/1732448786243_ef8e5bb43a65cde15d92fa3dd153ddd6c5Tqxeo1UpBvnAc3csUm7j3hlQl.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Elphaba, a misunderstood young woman because of her green skin, and Glinda, a popular girl, become friends at Shiz University in the Land of Oz. After an encounter with the Wonderful Wizard of Oz, their friendship reaches a crossroads.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=56650&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Singing & Dancing\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Wicked: Part One\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241008/1728374103546_a36e3e25b5e4bf3d45c9fe898fcdc8cc横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":52615,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241008/1728374099585_43fd9d2e2c4095c548f2cbda3a9f4de7竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A fading celebrity takes a black-market drug: a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=52615&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Substance\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241103/1730612614083_b103c7691edc41e8711162b3577b08d6秘密会议 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":56648,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250425/1745551875512_e5339e788d52970e1d0773c1e072573fm5x8D0bZ3eKqIVWZ5y7TnZ2oTVg.webp\",\"introduction\":\"When Cardinal Lawrence is tasked with leading one of the world's most secretive and ancient events, selecting a new Pope, he finds himself at the center of a conspiracy that could shake the very foundation of the Catholic Church.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=56648&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Conclave\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241018/1729232502756_d750f98b9c3a1f9267050b7128051b62横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":53704,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241018/1729232498966_3e7c31c694077583a0beb4e79bf435df竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The world seems to be destroyed, and human remains are everywhere. A cat's home was destroyed by a large flood, and it found a shelter on a ship full of different animals. Although there are differences between them, it must cooperate with them to face various unknown challenges.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=53704&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Flow\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"青少年奇幻剧\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":83943,\"homeSectionName\":\"Young adult fiction\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632885225553_61b0a39d1d8157f99369fa1bc29ba1faiYE1e8dbaQohYad8g6ySpmsSuj0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2815,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632888885266_7482bd6eff7ffd1fb7be3c0382f52e151ewwtjqAcwZ5abr2X7coGN0UwaI.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a dystopian future, the totalitarian nation of Panem is divided into 12 districts and the Capitol. Each year two young representatives from each district are selected by lottery to participate in The Hunger Games. Part entertainment, part brutal retribution for a past rebellion, the televised games are broadcast throughout Panem. The 24 participants are forced to eliminate their competitors while the citizens of Panem are required to watch. When 16-year-old Katniss' young sister, Prim, is selected as District 12's female representative, Katniss volunteers to take her place. She and her male counterpart, Peeta, are pitted against bigger, stronger representatives, some of whom have trained for this their whole lives.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2815&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2012,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241224/1735021829304_7c4f7d928e0ecf7e02bb8bd772873a9c怪奇物语5.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":63926,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251113/1763005100888_d8e24536e271a59b185c3f064e75e0f0cVxVGwHce6xnW8UaVUggaPXbmoE.webp\",\"introduction\":\"After the fall of Hawkins the gang are all back together one last time but are they alone?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=63926&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":25,\"rankDesc\":\"Sci-Fi list Top 3\",\"rankId\":60,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Stranger Things Season 5\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231123/1700725945364_846dfbc351465f444a4362e1f6340dc05a4JdoFwll5DRtKMe7JLuGQ9yJm.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":38639,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231211/1702273733222_8f13deb43a2a7f63bcb1d91cf09be6799cbeNkXx0OTC9pg30OZIWRi9HmL.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Coriolanus Snow mentors and develops feelings for the female District 12 tribute during the 10th Hunger Games.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=38639&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"War\"],\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: The Ballad of Songbirds & Snakes\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220225/1645758059880_543187314aab2db0cde2599d1ad57b8cq4PPJDf9zgo2cTQY27yl4KZhLSP.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":12912,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220225/1645758055747_8667ead8e2d936e5ae00aa5bf1e92b8345FLfu74nXjhNHhbsTJ4ROsGLR5.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When his lightning bolt is stolen, Zeus accuses Poseidon's son Percy Jackson and gives Poseidon's son fourteen days to return it, otherwise he will initiate a war amongst the gods. Meanwhile the teenager, Percy, who is dyslexic and has ADHD is visiting The Museum of Metropolitan of Art and is attacked by a Fury disguised in his teacher. His physically handicapped best friend Grover reveals that Percy is a demigod and that he is his protector and his teacher Mr Brunner gives him a pen telling him that it is a powerful weapon. They go to Percy's house and together with his mother Sally they drive to the Camp Half-Blood. However Sally is attacked by a Minotaur and vanishes before Percy can help her. In the camp, Percy befriends the gorgeous Annabeth; when they are attacked by Hades who wants the lighting bolt for himself, Percy discovers that his mother is in the Underworld with Hades. Percy decides to travel on a dangerous quest to retrieve the lightning bolt and save his mother. Grover and Annabeth join him and Luke gives a powerful shield of his own to protect Percy. Will they be able to succeed?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12912&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2010,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Percy Jackson & the Olympians: The Lightning Thief\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240419/1713492438683_7797ff6125d2eec13178e00026eb5eecgzryDyEMkhtAYNlVRiMG1nriNdd.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":43237,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240419/1713492435762_63de39785c672a9469dc0349a7c29a88ic5Hs6zYcM4YUuxyezFUAFQie39.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Follows the Grace family as they move from Brooklyn, New York, to their ancestral home in Henson, Michigan, the Spiderwick Estate.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=43237&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Spiderwick Chronicles\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251107/1762494736796_3630ba6799a7a361eaffd8c8755c953dp2926713212.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":113301,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20251210/1765333551158_ebe839c2c61b67d2b30fd5fdb67d0c3d40eFcTzZier3DWLqldsP5VHxeoD.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Percy, Annabeth, Grover, and Clarisse embark on a journey through the sea of monsters to save their camp\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=113301&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2025,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Percy Jackson and the Olympians Season 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220122/1642819892024_3931c9d1680702df3e253448c63f56edzyWbOvKCdA9V9P5xuUG2eiPYsUo.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":11198,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220122/1642819889196_e52192e3dcc8e4c691484c47d14c5937cN4Tb2WDhwJMlYLU9vKctunx4rg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Darling family children receive a visit from Peter Pan, who takes them to Never Never Land where an ongoing war with the evil Pirate Captain Hook is taking place.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=11198&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2003,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Anime\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Peter Pan\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230223/1677144473780_7eeceb528de3a04c42355715d077e16e星尘 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":31459,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230223/1677144471065_6b67ada23ace3254920587a7cc2b2569星尘 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The passage from this world to the fantasy kingdom of Stormhold is through a breach in a wall beside an English village. In the 1800s, a boy becomes a man when he ventures through the breach in pursuit of a fallen star, to prove his love for the village beauty. The star is no lump of rock, it's a maiden, Yvaine. Tristan, the youth, is not the only one looking for her: three witches, led by Lamia, want her heart to make them young; and, the sons of the dead king of Stormhold want her because she holds a ruby that will give one of them title to the throne. Assisting Tristan are his mother, the victim of a spell, and a cross-dressing pirate of the skies. Will Tristan win his true love?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=31459&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2007,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Stardust\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211130/1638240640509_803b44fa85e32a2facf85116f0bb60d1ahiv2gllg7HfJ52CyWW2aBMmtpT.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":876,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211130/1638240637605_b5ca899175f92976289636dd1c709f58lKhF0QX724VS2QqBzSZ4KJif3Ny.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After their father is murdered under mysterious circumstances, the three Locke siblings and their mother move into their ancestral home, Keyhouse, which they discover is full of magical keys that may be connected to their father's death.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=876&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":10,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Locke & Key Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230818/1692325264107_d5d6013ef9aeaa5d1f2a8be2551573b5tXFjtSpK1W6XbEbBbVx5qDbYFj8.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":36451,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230818/1692325259499_46050c4051b43e8ceeb22e4a8d4104capbh99N5Uguoq8XWtOQmCf46eDp7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The story of Mickey Bolitar and his new life with a mom in rehab, a dead father, an annoying aunt, and a new school in New Jersey.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=36451&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Harlan Coben's Shelter\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220720/1658307273628_06a9f9b0be565084ddc5c34f27790de24QiJA2sh3LHSIAlK5MK367lXWvi.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":22424,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220720/1658307264748_1d20ae61799c072edf271a08eed51648rc1PtgsFo4Kc1yCpTAub6BGWORq.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Young Merlin (Colin Morgan) is a teenager, discovering and then learning to master his magical gift. Magister Gaius (Richard Wilson), King Uther Pendragon's (Anthony Head's) learned court physician to whom he's assigned as humble page, teaches him medicine, coaches his magical self-study, and warns him of Uther's strong aversion to magic. Merlin becomes squire to the noble but imprudent crown Prince, Arthur (Bradley James), whose fate is linked with Merlin.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=22424&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2008,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Merlin Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230926/1695708429759_2dd07a03faa4709ab9f5239933e2517b横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":37372,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230926/1695708424838_c032090a3778f1b0167417eaf28dcf5b竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Four teenage friends, on the French-Swiss border, whose lives are turned upside down by an experiment of the LHC, the world's biggest particle collider.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37372&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":6,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Parallels\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220506/1651830499020_c79c19155f0bae9c7e9ccfcfa47dfe4auWHAG2WbZ76fX6QWWDW3X6QegTh.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":17421,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220506/1651830487599_df71b437548fb6c6828706f89d898600AlhcID6tU8GNkNQpXx3f9qDdDqd.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Living among the wolves in the jungle, young man cub Mowgli quickly learns to live life among his wolf pack and all the animals that inhabit the jungle, but when the villainous tiger Shere Khan threatens Mowgli's life, black panther Bagheera offers to take Mowgli to a nearby man village where he will be safe from the tiger's wrath. Along the way, Mowgli gets tangled up in a series of encounters with a sly snake named Kaa, a swimmingly ruthless gigantopithecus named King Louie and a lazy bear named Baloo, who quickly becomes his guide to the 'bear necessities' of life.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=17421&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The Jungle Book\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632813766008_c95def2f99ece8039d401ad9ab4f71b7画板 1 拷贝 31.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":850,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211105/1636116620720_ba7b1f0a25145e1c2657db2edd418732jUrDkXkVXe5cDIYA7Ss81P1CvtX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When a young boy disappears, his mother, a police chief and his friends must confront terrifying supernatural forces in order to get him back.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=850&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Stranger Things Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230119/1674113736203_f98bee724def4c2517a1fc372c1ae1d7tcF46ItZ4aVsUlkTal5ZKeYukNj.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":30445,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230119/1674113733372_76ad26614361ebf1e14613a439027891lxWSGo8D6MbFbQmM9tqhbaG80TP.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In London, where the most gifted teenage ghost-hunters venture nightly into perilous combat with deadly spirits, amidst the many corporate, adult-run agencies, one stands alone: independent of any commercial imperative or adult supervision a tiny startup, run by two teenage boys and a newly arrived, supremely psychically gifted girl, a renegade trio destined to unravel a mystery that will change the course of history.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=30445&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Lockwood & Co\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211208/1638956403416_1528a349c08bb92f4cb260c3fc0ea37enSJvwZziYaGMbftSDQqQ5GIb47a.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":8293,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211208/1638956400827_ab428473033a4a586a23b16120e6750c5AcRJx2OnTJnYXI3xecvktopnNz.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"For Emma Swan, life has been anything but a happy ending. But when she's reunited with Henry - the son she gave up for adoption ten years ago - on the night of her 28th birthday, everything changes. The now 10-year-old Henry is in desperate need of Emma's help because he believes from reading a book of fairy-tales that she's the daughter of Snow White and Prince Charming - who sent her away from the Enchanted Forest to be protected from a curse that was enacted by the Evil Queen. Emma initially refuses to believe a word of Henry's story but soon finds that his hometown of Storybrooke, Maine is more than it seems. Because it's in Storybrooke that all of the classic characters we know are frozen in time with no memories of their former selves - except for the Evil Queen, who is Storybrooke's mayor and Henry's adoptive mother Regina Mills. Now, as the epic \\\"Final Battle\\\" for the future of both worlds approaches, Emma will have to accept her destiny and uncover the mystery behind a place where fairy-tales are to be believed.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=8293&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2011,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":22,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220614/1655185291365_e1a1c69f4c4ce710bb791ea014cd1206bOpen7SOIrOBSVfC4ePNbwy3lrc.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":20655,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220614/1655185285905_82be7d4730553b373824ab3cb1802fbbyD3FHZ5gE0uKpBCYsxlq82UJCcP.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in contemporary New York City, a seemingly ordinary teenager, Clary Fray, discovers she is the descendant of a line of Shadowhunters, a secret cadre of young half-angel warriors locked in an ancient battle to protect our world from demons. After the disappearance of her mother, Clary must join forces with a group of Shadow Hunters, who introduce her to a dangerous alternate New York called the Shadow World, filled with demons, warlocks, vampires, werewolves and other deadly creatures.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=20655&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The Mortal Instruments: City of Bones\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230428/1682672574876_deadd48db840eb46da92cad6787a7fe5彼得潘 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":33546,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230428/1682672572631_30c81ec74512dfefd368ef9e9ad28930彼得潘 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Based on J. M. Barrie's novel Peter and Wendy and inspired by the 1953 animated classic, Peter Pan and Wendy is the timeless tale of a young girl who, defying her parents' wishes to attend boarding school, travels with her two younger brothers to the magical Neverland. There, she meets a boy who refuses to grow up, a tiny fairy and an evil pirate captain, and they soon find themselves on a thrilling and dangerous adventure far, far away from their family and the comforts of home.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33546&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":2.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Musical\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Peter Pan & Wendy\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632823262523_fc0fbee62ce10ba0c95b34f4c65b9039暮光1 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2813,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210928/1632823259101_c5c87b541c83ad4443f18efa3329477c暮光1 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Bella Swan has always been a little bit different. Never one to run with the crowd, Bella never cared about fitting in with the trendy girls at her Phoenix, Arizona high school. When her mother remarries and Bella chooses to live with her father in the rainy little town of Forks, Washington, she doesn't expect much of anything to change. But things do change when she meets the mysterious and dazzlingly beautiful Edward Cullen. For Edward is nothing like any boy she's ever met. He's nothing like anyone she's ever met, period. He's intelligent and witty, and he seems to see straight into her soul. In no time at all, they are swept up in a passionate and decidedly unorthodox romance - unorthodox because Edward really isn't like the other boys. He can run faster than a mountain lion. He can stop a moving car with his bare hands. Oh, and he hasn't aged since 1918. Like all vampires, he's immortal. That's right - vampire. But he doesn't have fangs - that's just in the movies. And he doesn't drink human blood, though Edward and his family are unique among vampires in that lifestyle choice. To Edward, Bella is that thing he has waited 90 years for - a soul mate. But the closer they get, the more Edward must struggle to resist the primal pull of her scent, which could send him into an uncontrollable frenzy. Somehow or other, they will have to manage their unmanageable love. But when unexpected visitors come to town and realize that there is a human among them Edward must fight to save Bella? A modern, visual, and visceral Romeo and Juliet story of the ultimate forbidden love affair - between vampire and mortal.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2813&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2008,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romantic\"],\"title\":\"Twilight\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220221/1645438458341_cf81282072a6cbc2304b6ae41f79137cnaudQkDg4MY2OFlYLBFU8Gq18Yt.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":12680,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220223/1645611639004_9d58ac0cd4362a8bf8969583dccc2bd2硫磺泉镇的秘密_12680竖版.png\",\"introduction\":\"A boy and his family moving into a supposedly haunted hotel on the edge of a small town.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12680&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":11,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Secrets of Sulphur Springs\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220225/1645759005832_9d1a4b3b56f7e3eb9fd16bf9e70df237lfqR5Sx9zjdx90RlnM2Ycg7ECxF.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":12914,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220225/1645758999314_be867b1ee7ed265b794e46404ed7b1a5tAu90qEpLqwqiZLsMqpaMVr55oN.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In this retelling of Rick Riordans book, \\\"The Sea of Monsters\\\", Percy Jackson, accompanied by his friends Annabeth Chase, Clarisse La Rue and Tyson, his half brother, goes on a journey to the Sea of Monsters to retrieve the Golden Fleece and save Camp Half-Blood.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12914&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Percy Jackson: Sea of Monsters\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230214/1676342349353_fa93d525cdbae799b0c7f3379f9e7cb5横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":31070,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230214/1676342357441_1e0ed3ff6e746e5a50104ac48ec00bc1竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"These siblings with superpowers might be twins, but they are very different indeed.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=31070&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":20,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":5.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"title\":\"The Thundermans Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211214/1639473644770_1cc1f94dd7bc56a0cfa9fd35ddca28c2tuDhEdza074bA497bO9WFEPs6O6.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":8795,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211214/1639473730835_6a5fe7925358f01da7a554337c049bb7kzJip9vndXYSKQHCgekrgqbnUrA.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Four children from the same family have to leave their town because of the bombings of WWII. A woman and a professor take the children to their house. While playing a game of hide-and-seek, the youngest member of the family, Lucy, finds a wardrobe to hide in. She travels back and back into the wardrobe and finds a place named Narnia. After going in twice, the four children go in together for the last time. They battle wolves, meet talking animals, encounter an evil white witch and meet a magnificent lion named Aslan. Will this be the end of their journey to Narnia or will they stay?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=8795&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2005,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"The Chronicles of Narnia: The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211109/1636438906188_f3acda73b747d3269230a663358efb4a8z9qQkx7wA6FXpLV8Tiw9mfsRFK.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":892,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211109/1636438901936_ee0ad93c1116a45c911792062682af06uBVX9ZQuHAvnzihvKEKTSvjFJuW.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Dark forces conspire against orphan mapmaker Alina Starkov when she unleashes an extraordinary power that could change the fate of her war-torn world.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=892&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\"],\"title\":\"Shadow and Bone 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211217/1639712616316_6e2d9864d697ddbb3d4ab8667c041e1eqGqlWb5izTPtFngBWdbJAEmninR.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":9117,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211217/1639712609828_d596c9a34400d83db6d4ef5a0da85eb72lAItR73KJcH3uIBJNFCe7xyegc.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Earth was ravaged by the Formics, an alien race seemingly determined to destroy humanity. Fifty years later, the people of Earth remain banded together to prevent their own annihilation from this technologically superior alien species. Ender Wiggin, a quiet but brilliant boy, may become the savior of the human race. He is separated from his beloved sister and his terrifying brother and brought to battle school in orbit around earth. He will be tested and honed into an empathetic killer who begins to despise what he does as he learns to fight in hopes of saving Earth and his family.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=9117&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Ender's Game\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220314/1647221382075_fd3d0329b4b41f656cd52b0e0605a276ipikQozG6cAtLqhaFqRneA0LI4o.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":13861,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220314/1647221379780_aced21099fa5f9824564d99cff05061caNh4Q3iuPKDMPi2SL7GgOpiLukX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a world divided by factions based on virtues, Tris learns she's Divergent and won't fit in. When she discovers a plot to destroy Divergents, Tris and the mysterious Four must find out what makes Divergents dangerous before it's too late.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=13861&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Divergent\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220927/1664249334076_fc8be2afa580e82c309088122e8e3050l56gka4kw2R4K7M4hSJRt12M6R6.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":25704,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220927/1664247714588_23f645095c8b308c54e017f0dbc7287ez7TQV2AwI2bLYyQ68QHxfAPfaJZ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A sleuthing, supernaturally infused mystery charting Wednesday Addams' years as a student at Nevermore Academy. Wednesday's attempts to master her emerging psychic ability, thwart a monstrous killing spree that has terrorized the local town, and solve the supernatural mystery that embroiled her parents 25 years ago - all while navigating her new and very tangled relationships at Nevermore.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=25704&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":{\"groupId\":25,\"rankDesc\":\"Horror list Top 2\",\"rankId\":57,\"rankType\":1},\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":8,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230407/1680851802121_ca4de2862d1430719956d86bec8720ad横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":23401,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230407/1680851797720_6aa5de42c62644fef8af59aeeadf839d竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A preteen's life turns upside down when he befriends the new girl in school and they imagine a whole new fantasy world to escape reality.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=23401&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2007,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Bridge to Terabithia\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211126/1637918895098_4cb337e30157a34e706f0ab04cca5c758IRT0XYSJuEbT7hqtOhNtoQMjjw.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":7342,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211126/1637918894518_a8772bc2b3c61e043ac12e02abda8cbccmYt3dPxb4Ogj5vt3HJfJ6lHdeZ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Awakening in an elevator, remembering nothing of his past, Thomas emerges into a world of about thirty teenage boys, all without past memories, who have learned to survive under their own set of rules in a completely enclosed environment, subsisting on their own agriculture and supplies. With a new boy arriving every thirty days, the group has been in \\\"The Glade\\\" for three years, trying to find a way to escape through the Maze that surrounds their living space (patrolled by cyborg monsters named 'Grievers'). They have begun to give up hope when a comatose girl arrives with a strange note, and their world begins to change with the boys dividing into two factions: those willing to risk their lives to escape and those wanting to hang onto what they've got and survive.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=7342&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231010/1696938709804_ffd50d549a2545d3e507c0055e092853h72ewwxrJMfozSMLp7jmj2aq23p.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":37671,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231010/1696938707720_2025a60a1334fc2fe4f4fe9bd0b328ed1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Kelly Quinn and her two best friends, Darbie and Hannah, find Kelly's grandmother's cookbook in the attic and discover some strange recipes. They soon begin to realize they have a book full of magic recipes.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37671&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2015,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":13,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"title\":\"Just Add Magic Season 1\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"邪典cult\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84329,\"homeSectionName\":\"Cult Films\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241126/1732591896098_f74a921cfdc16cd033094365da7c2d15横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":56834,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241126/1732591890913_f0395d7d7afaa4eb29dc701b7a29bfc9竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a future with toxic air, a model takes a drug causing a transformation. She tries reversing it but learns her mutations could save humanity.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=56834&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"The Fix\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241008/1728374103546_a36e3e25b5e4bf3d45c9fe898fcdc8cc横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":52615,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241008/1728374099585_43fd9d2e2c4095c548f2cbda3a9f4de7竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A fading celebrity takes a black-market drug: a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=52615&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Substance\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221022/1666420247866_ffbaec5250cf93a1ea9b1a244429be696.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":26640,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221026/1666777272476_2128eb4d5c4ba84490de602c128271cbwRKHUqYGrp3PO91mZVQ18xlwYzW.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After being resurrected by a sinister entity, Art the Clown returns to the timid town of Miles County where he targets a teenage girl and her younger brother on Halloween night.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=26640&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Terrifier 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230724/1690186155296_b4b0911ce576bc4960dda677de07a261snbRXbkzEpc35mFDlwUg41cN8aw.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":35831,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230724/1690186150596_a862c2a04c3fd1796fe09d21d5c6f1556ilIBfycIpd5TnnZo8EX7Dw6XlT.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Matt and Kate buy an isolated house. While moving, they discover a strange room that grants them an unlimited number of material wishes. But since Kate has had two miscarriages, what they long for the most is a child.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=35831&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"The Room\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211202/1638425540136_fc44e29055abcc859efbbdc724dab820dVOlJVHYRWx7DhMQRNLnbf5bT1q.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3941,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241014/1728877556499_b6d82e76a51b0acc5329b4720dfea267p2870563433.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Following a series of unexplained crimes, a father is reunited with the son who has been missing for 10 years. Titane: A metal highly resistant to heat and corrosion, with high tensile strength alloys.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3941&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Titane\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230327/1679907632003_a8532f2c72ef6bffcdd9ad5d21a8185c着魔 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":32528,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230327/1679914523180_4cfddf7dc03a5a79117ae9ed70d3100ep2604314064.png\",\"introduction\":\"A young woman left her family for an unspecified reason. The husband determines to find out the truth and starts following his wife. At first, he suspects that a man is involved. But gradually, he finds out more and more strange behaviors and bizarre incidents that indicate something more than a possessed love affair.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=32528&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":1981,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Possession\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221020/1666245428769_6dbbe005e74bd6411d3ce9b7b737d955微笑 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":26491,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221115/1668509881523_2482eb7fa718df3734314bce7d283468HbNIA43R6a9pcZXh3enCX0XfCg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After witnessing a bizarre, traumatic incident involving a patient, Dr. Rose Cotter starts experiencing frightening occurrences that she can't explain. Rose must confront her troubling past in order to survive and escape her horrifying new reality.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=26491&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Smile\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220223/1645602767385_c723a0a4cd82f332aa5b61a3ce16c2bcoPXWnMlpBoVrSeA9ElbnU13G1fV.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":12825,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220223/1645602760399_b17693f5ddaad3cca74ef40d96b22720kc8jT1MAiKM0iwdjAwC5lQrTNry.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A young woman, studying to be a vet, develops a craving for human flesh.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=12825&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Raw\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240419/1713509191169_39428b759d26429b837e002fd166cee94yrOyO3N55XazHQXXYoqiiPQd40.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":43257,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240419/1713509185904_891e5f68fba682025eaf0e21447be1fczvunKmAOoBHRSNBpM5oWRNlv3Gg.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A live television broadcast in 1977 goes horribly wrong, unleashing evil into the nation's living rooms.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=43257&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Late Night with the Devil\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241014/1728883677174_2fa4fdd2d3a44b3aa321df23c71f9727xPGiAPvneeicUxvJJfBpdnO99s.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":53222,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241014/1728883673061_d58f47a1cf291b888fb4071b09bf54963pyE6ZqDbuJi7zrNzzQzcKTWdmN.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A newly-engaged couple have a breakdown in an isolated area and must seek shelter at the bizarre residence of Dr. Frank-n-Furter.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=53222&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":1975,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Singing & Dancing\"],\"title\":\"The Rocky Horror Picture Show\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241014/1728883932929_f91db512fe237d2d0b893c72518f17af2eGDwLLsKKC8t4CdHO7CR2Amvi0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":53224,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241014/1728884466148_5e8bc3f4dc652d97a273abb79ac6e33d81WxuJkCJSL._AC_UF894,1000_QL80_(1).jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Outfitted with special weapons, two sisters take on the boss of an organ-harvesting ring and her army of henchmen\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=53224&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Rise of the Machine Girls\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"反乌托邦惊悚\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":84318,\"homeSectionName\":\"Dystopian Sci-Fi Horror\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240715/1721031214037_c1344b923a808751e3d1709e722a1673aSvAKp2wCObifgR0tj9qYRNN1Fi.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":46946,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240715/1721031208282_6a76d4d107ad35677c5f34798f6573aetvIpBg12IIA5Dr9Sjn38ygS1vQp.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A thrilling physical journey that allows an approach to the darkness, where it is scary to look. It appeals to the viewer's civil responsibility and forces them to face the limits of their own solidarity.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=46946&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Platform 2\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241015/1728969787007_bb0692d82795ee8c83953ede254fe6585nw5fm2fUzTffKA7hqBy3sNWuXr.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":53358,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241015/1728969733908_cdbd3b9e411afea90fc90a84c8781b17yiYbpmjmnjif9b4BNa02ObfhVfm.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A sociopolitical metaphor of the world as a formal dinner that takes an unexpected turn when there's no more food to be served.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=53358&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Anime\",\"Drama\"],\"title\":\"Dinner for Few\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221001/1664620538531_2dbd82ba65a978051fb3e44426aa2914维斯 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":25879,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221001/1664620535835_949081bf296311bccb572cde2d1f14a9维斯 竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After the collapse of Earth's ecosystem, Vesper, a 13-year-old girl struggling to survive with her paralyzed father, meets a woman with a secret who will force her to use her wits, strengths and bio-hacking abilities to fight for the possibility of having a future.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=25879&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.6,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Vesper\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231010/1696915042715_fbc88f52e2153d2b98867ff61a67e0a6横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":37635,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231010/1696915038965_c1b99dad85068fbd9289194f60370e4c竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"During an opulent banquet, eleven pampered guests participate in what appears to be a ritualistic gastronomic carnage. In this grotesque universe, an unexpected sequence of events destabilizes the endless symphony of abundance.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37635&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2008,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Short film\"],\"title\":\"Next Floor\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632885225553_61b0a39d1d8157f99369fa1bc29ba1faiYE1e8dbaQohYad8g6ySpmsSuj0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":2815,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20210929/1632888885266_7482bd6eff7ffd1fb7be3c0382f52e151ewwtjqAcwZ5abr2X7coGN0UwaI.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a dystopian future, the totalitarian nation of Panem is divided into 12 districts and the Capitol. Each year two young representatives from each district are selected by lottery to participate in The Hunger Games. Part entertainment, part brutal retribution for a past rebellion, the televised games are broadcast throughout Panem. The 24 participants are forced to eliminate their competitors while the citizens of Panem are required to watch. When 16-year-old Katniss' young sister, Prim, is selected as District 12's female representative, Katniss volunteers to take her place. She and her male counterpart, Peeta, are pitted against bigger, stronger representatives, some of whom have trained for this their whole lives.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=2815&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2012,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240820/1724146784540_133a62b9c4394a813bac807a8615a166eQQQuvIrDNVM4wA1Qfzlqlv1QZ6.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":49578,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240820/1724146780559_e60ce2d116e8ffc95167d95a8cc98c93t6WP4kilpxPzHttWQjH5x7Iu6Bo.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A world in which a compulsory operation wipes out physical differences and makes everyone pretty.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=49578&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Uglies\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230926/1695718114589_fc5f96df6243bbe33e66726fd848bede9x5NZIBphD7pLI3GkKDeJrlI1jn.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":37390,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230927/1695796325773_85f1d1faa6d9cd48271e2277d7be81621.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The film is about those who survived in a city that went to ruins after a massive earthquake destroyed all the concrete.\\n\\nYoung Tak is a leader who works to protect Hwang Goong Apartment from outsiders. Min Sung is a salaryman who gets chosen to assist Young Tak and becomes increasingly bold as he encounters crises. Myung Hwa is Min Sung’s wife and former nurse, a warm character who cares for those who are hurt in dangerous situations.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37390&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Concrete Utopia\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220314/1647221382075_fd3d0329b4b41f656cd52b0e0605a276ipikQozG6cAtLqhaFqRneA0LI4o.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":13861,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220314/1647221379780_aced21099fa5f9824564d99cff05061caNh4Q3iuPKDMPi2SL7GgOpiLukX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In a world divided by factions based on virtues, Tris learns she's Divergent and won't fit in. When she discovers a plot to destroy Divergents, Tris and the mysterious Four must find out what makes Divergents dangerous before it's too late.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=13861&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Divergent\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211126/1637918895098_4cb337e30157a34e706f0ab04cca5c758IRT0XYSJuEbT7hqtOhNtoQMjjw.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":7342,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211126/1637918894518_a8772bc2b3c61e043ac12e02abda8cbccmYt3dPxb4Ogj5vt3HJfJ6lHdeZ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Awakening in an elevator, remembering nothing of his past, Thomas emerges into a world of about thirty teenage boys, all without past memories, who have learned to survive under their own set of rules in a completely enclosed environment, subsisting on their own agriculture and supplies. With a new boy arriving every thirty days, the group has been in \\\"The Glade\\\" for three years, trying to find a way to escape through the Maze that surrounds their living space (patrolled by cyborg monsters named 'Grievers'). They have begun to give up hope when a comatose girl arrives with a strange note, and their world begins to change with the boys dividing into two factions: those willing to risk their lives to escape and those wanting to hang onto what they've got and survive.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=7342&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2014,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211202/1638424084878_88eebd277e2db758ff36fc88e82be0cc9DET8yv7MYMwOWe1eR2CigFkev4.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3836,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220706/1657088045120_da79c8e03c3906f3127f84ee26165043雪国.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Set in 2031, the entire world is frozen except for those aboard the Snowpiercer. For seventeen years, the world's survivors are on a train hurtling around the globe creating their own economy and class system. Led by Curtis (Chris Evans), a group of lower-class citizens living in squalor at the back of the train are determined to get to the front of the train and spread the wealth around. Each section of the train holds new surprises for the group who have to battle their way through. A revolution is underway.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3836&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Snowpiercer\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220314/1647222720406_597361ffa873c9586384234b2410cf4f40c44BcAfrv0VxuD89ZUsyyjqWI.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":13867,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220314/1647222718037_32dcc6e980e9fe326077f4eb8c9c2701bkuuvDoPkOJpg0ZDzHkUWt8ZG5A.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In the near future, a financial crisis will hit Korea and slums arise. From those areas, a group of young people commit crime to survive.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=13867&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Time to Hunt\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221025/1666669148731_a2aae1e527f7282e577116c458aaaed98HbqSozBJxv6UldR9lMUECUlbLI.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":26727,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20221025/1666669142135_653f5cd72ae69d59cac2c73875ade1beijJm0RSeKIr67qkHLtSmtigS6ra.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"After a colossal and mysterious accident a young talented architect comes back to his senses in a very odd world that only resembles the reality. This world is based on the memories of the ones who live in it - people who are currently finding themselves in a deep coma. Human memory is spotty, chaotic and unstable. The same is the COMA - odd collection of memories and recollections - cities, glaciers and rivers can all be found in one room. All the laws of physics can be broken. The architect must find out the exact laws and regulations of COMA as he fights for his life, meets the love of his life and keeps on looking for the exit to the real world which he will have to get acquainted with all over again after the experience of COMA.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=26727&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2020,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Suspense\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"title\":\"Coma\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null},{\"bannerProportion\":null,\"category\":\"\",\"cnName\":\"恐怖精选\",\"coverType\":1,\"homeSectionId\":83921,\"homeSectionName\":\"Horror Selection\",\"homeSectionType\":\"SINGLE_ALBUM\",\"recommendContentVOList\":[{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211109/1636453346133_f900c5dbcc2a4ddc2c905f6aceef7101dXkLEI5sVe1wM7CPVn85D7ZwQA3.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":5896,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220816/1660633880310_e712f55bd2e13698abc267062f1c6ef6满足.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"In the small village Goksung in South Korea, police officer Jong-Goo investigates bizarre murders caused by a mysterious disease. His partner relays gossip that a Japanese stranger, who lives in a secluded house in the mountains, would be an evil spirit responsible for the illness. Jong-Goo decides to visit the stranger along with his partner and a young priest who speaks Japanese. They find an altar with a goat head, pictures on the walls of the infected people that died, and an attacking guard dog that prevents their departure until the stranger arrives. Jong-Goo finds one shoe of his beloved daughter, Hyo-jin, in the house of the stranger, and soon she becomes sick. His mother-in-law summons the shaman Il-gwang to save her granddaughter while a mysterious woman tells Jong-Goo that the stranger is responsible. Who might be the demon that is bringing sickness to Goksung?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5896&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2016,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.5,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Wailing\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240910/1725973504476_076f3f9cab7f55921f1e7ac64e7d417dThe Well.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":51070,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240911/1726033896571_9498a97f148e2cfad88505048b2084b2zK1X5T7gAdXxLFhj0hYyCTVrvpU.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A budding art restorer travels to a small Italian village to bring a medieval painting back to its former glory. Little does she know she is placing her life in danger from an evil curse and a monster born of myth and brutal pain.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=51070&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Well\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230912/1694484303913_128fcb1d763fd706d6e4488423c5bb20lDCIQ1Qe7cRnhZ4ybQVVEbadMZ.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":36999,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230912/1694487258427_1134648908160a4a34e679d842dc2bb9x5sWVFL78X6KC4dil7QSOqCDqS8.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When a group of friends discover how to conjure spirits using an embalmed hand, they become hooked on the new thrill, until one of them goes too far and opens the door to the spirit world forcing them to choose who to trust: the dead or the living.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=36999&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2022,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Talk to Me\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250405/1743861594339_d8d6c805892ea81ec66c2f981bb01267yEDDodWPhzzmryhrPGA8oWqFbfy.webp\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":83863,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20250405/1743861589754_fa1f84b5b817ba898d6e3b97f1fd6f3az2TWhTRFzriygLygsjTbIHFYcQW.webp\",\"introduction\":\"Nakrob, a young real estate swindler, discovers an abandoned hillside hotel by the beach. Seeing an opportunity, he decides to turn it into a luxury hotel scam.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=83863&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"404 Run Run\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231025/1698202267707_81c1959c2e19689a2ca80ea8cd5552df横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":37994,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231025/1698202262853_4dab0790f03fbfd5dd6c8ff042ce779d竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A mother of two who inherits a house is confronted with murderous intruders on the first night in their new home and fights for her daughters' lives. Sixteen years later when the daughters reunite at the house, things get really strange.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37994&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Ghostland\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240910/1725970242384_29b3580f3202e976eef3dbd37a087a13愿者安息.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":51068,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240910/1725970220340_24ce5099f9ebae65e8f3de0622d87714愿者安息1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Cemal drives a hearse for a living. He's entrusted with secretly carrying the body of a young girl at the request of her family. One night, he hears strange groans from the back of the truck, even though she the girl hasn't got a pulse.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=51068&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Funeral\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230509/1683624888876_93509a743f16987f4d5f5df91ec8034ctNVri3EgpXQ0wXmGJqIvTvd6kGj.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":33750,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230509/1683624876598_207402ee84ccfd17aaf2243c7dd60f68mGt7LOIjgmBIXsNyHgUSZGBaZZK.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Seventeen year-old Nell Margaret Sweetzer is found completely insane when trying to explain her possession by the demon called Abalam. After medical and psychological treatment, she is sent to the Deveraux transition house in New Orleans managed by Frank Merle, who helps her to start a new life. She finds a job as a hotel housekeeper, befriends her new roommates, and develops a crush on her coworker, Chris. Soon, Nell comes to realize that she is haunted by people from her cult... and by the same evil force that once possessed her. When Nell meets Miss Cecile, she tells Nell that she has been following her since the hospital. Further, she discloses that she belongs to the sect Order of The Right Hand, and that they can protect her from the evil in an attempt to divert the prophecy of an apocalypse. Will Nell accept help, and be protected from the extremely powerful, evil force Abalam -- Or will she come to accept... herself?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33750&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2013,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Last Exorcism Part II\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230321/1679392629175_226da51b85f229f52bb985c0653d097dly4vC69g78oVRogaSyBFDRu52kG.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":32356,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230327/1679907663395_1667ff993ffff4f3fd86f3011b8301df8.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Grace, a young eye doctor, is summoned to a remote convent in Scotland after the alleged suicide of her priest brother. Distrusting the Church's account, Grace tries to find out what really happened with the help of Vatican priest Father Romero. As she explores the convent's sepulchral cloisters, and the wild cliffs and windswept beaches nearby, she uncovers not only murder and sacrilege, but a disturbing truth about her own past which brings long-buried trauma to the surface.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=32356&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Consecration\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230829/1693289695258_e3bbe22d426a0d649fd1dbc1968dcf5amK0a3t62lM8ho3mmvBWf6NxdWvw.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":36698,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230829/1693292215889_a100628d777529f30bc8f0bb3e7282d22ikRhOvFwvKlSBm3btJiQh5YtGL.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Still reeling from the tragic death of their mother, a teenage girl and her younger sister find themselves plagued by a sadistic presence in their house and struggle to get their grieving father to pay attention before it's too late.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=36698&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Boogeyman\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231024/1698129663367_5fa5af414d0949a4c4d57e96f1f9a5e74DpVWbDmYanToTTkTp2SQLQX1p4.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":37983,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20231024/1698134586419_91b351aef1cac0a048d7728f6ccc08623.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When single father Victor Fielding's daughter, Angela, and her friend Katherine, show signs of demonic possession, it unleashes a chain of events that forces him to confront the nature of evil. Terrified and desperate, he seeks out Chris MacNeil, the only person alive who's witnessed anything like it before.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37983&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Exorcist: Believer\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"lgbt\",\"sort\":2}],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240423/1713851558553_31284199b623f42a5d270aa4f756cb58xLfP6FxRyN4EkqcqYJIaR8s7QdM.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":43334,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240423/1713851555212_34d0b0b43db3c996bc1e9bcb5d6554c5p7jyFWiLyHPttqYBFAlLJwtYTYH.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Gym manager Lou falls for Jackie, a bodybuilder who is passing through town en route to a competition in Las Vegas.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=43334&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Romantic\",\"Thriller\",\"LGBTQ\"],\"title\":\"Love Lies Bleeding\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211021/1634813575246_8dd724f0f5c815e301627d94552afb9b9SISFlf6SEiIb7CMk8h0Gu3NYow.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":4088,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220715/1657871642257_76e988b56b1a72a0fed8e19ffaf03b53灵.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A horrifying story of a shaman's inheritance in the Isan region of Thailand. What could be possessing a family member might not be the Goddess they make it out to be.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=4088&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2021,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Medium\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211201/1638354670565_8894fb136d2ee35d7b6494edede38217l5BNdekn7J7sYUOKruCMJfMzOQO.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":3436,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220908/1662626046963_429613a3db1b16616383e6e5a846a33ehFVWRWDRMdH6piSb3NmSq0E9kh7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Every town has its own ghost story, and a local folktale around Ravens Fair is about a ventriloquist named Mary Shaw. After she went mad in the 1940s, she was accused of kidnapping a young boy who yelled out in one of her performances that she was a fraud. Because of this she was hunted down by townspeople who in the ultimate act of revenge, cut out her tongue and then killed her. They buried her along with her \\\"children,\\\" a handmade collection of vaudeville dolls, and assumed they had silenced her forever. However, Ravens Fair has been plagued by mysterious deaths around them after Mary Shaws collection has returned from their graves and have come to seek revenge on people that killed her and their families. Far from the pall of their cursed hometown, newlyweds Jamie and Lisa Ashen thought they had established a fresh start, until Jamie's wife is grotesquely killed in their apartment. Jamie returns to Ravens Fair for the funeral, intent on unraveling the mystery of Lisa's death. Once reunited with his ill father, Edward, and his father's new young bride, Ella, Jamie must dig into the town's bloody past to find out who killed his wife and why. All the while, he is doggedly pursued by a detective who doesn't believe a word he says. As he uncovers the legend of Mary Shaw, he will unlock the story of her curse and the truth behind the threat from a rhyme in his childhood: if you see Mary Shaw and scream, she'll take your tongue. And the last thing you will hear before you die...is your own voice speaking back to you.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=3436&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2007,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Dead Silence\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240410/1712756999489_4c383bce5eba2041c5dcc60f4d3c4031kic44ybFEIy12W1e9UXG0kcY9SB.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":42971,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240410/1712756996609_feb866e4aaab7e9c34ec355fce6be8eccIzk6GhxEZuweekGFXWEoAyuaMX.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A young American woman is sent to Rome to begin a life of service to the church, but encounters a darkness that causes her to question her faith and uncovers a terrifying conspiracy that hopes to bring about the birth of evil incarnate.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=42971&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The First Omen\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230823/1692782242910_4d1d8198955d37c5be1f2ce17967859eiP1i4fztyyPNRy2C6Rv3oZuyAIz.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":36590,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230823/1692782236213_31796e7768f27b0f8520b06715501923wdk78Zn12fAYTpCB8lvRtCfOLPx.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Yaşar, a young man, has a hard time after his father's death. His inheritance from his father causes Yaşar to have problems with his stepmother. Meanwhile, Yaşar learns that her sister-in-law, Canan, who is living in the same house, is in love with her. While Yaşar is dealing with the inheritance issue and his sister-in-law, he realizes that there are some strange events at home. Yasar's mentally disordered daughter Efsun's dark past is unearthed, making things even more complicated. The pain of the family, who had to face the dark past of Efsun, is just the beginning for them.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=36590&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.1,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Siccin 6\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240415/1713165559461_cc9dc80af14dfb738d0bb80155cb1cb7b4xaqpUZFUkgyJ1VcFEPXmDML34.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":43089,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240415/1713165553203_031473ed5d5e978a0b0b13a67f66e78blbOyeiiRYAE6Nm2e7xiNAAaRwZB.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A young woman inherits a run-down pub and discovers a dark secret within its basement - Baghead - a shape-shifting creature that will let you speak to lost loved ones, but not without consequence.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=43089&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.8,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Baghead\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230915/1694748876674_01d64ea659595ec274a5ed8506d8e614qaykuAPezrTTQAWDjP8lLnV3cJx.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":37128,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230915/1694748869031_c36c47005a96ccbd2c51c4e2bf0b07c03VGfYYIyYyJcsjRajBT0FwEMv9J.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Supernatural horror, based on the eponymous online phenomenon, a ritual conducted in an elevator, in which players attempt to travel to another dimension using a set of rules that can be found online.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=37128&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Elevator Game\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240424/1713927090187_ba14028059dff4d3a5baa0b08396f184oLu4szayJyyWk9E1QkuiJrErbcu.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":43361,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240424/1713927086313_4725e5bf96b7220a4dc8dee9f4735799nMmkLfWTpWrlfu6Qo5tpEXDDueE.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"“Taste of Horror” is omnibus series with a total of 10 short films. Each film is directed by different directors tells separate stories .\\n\\n\\\"Tick Tock Tick Tock\\\"\\nAn emotional horror flick that occurs when a child abused by a mother meets a ghost.\\n\\n\\\"Resident-only Fitness Center\\\"\\nA daily horror that takes place in an era where interest in fitness is higher than ever and there are ghosts at a gym only available to residents.\\n\\n\\\"Rehabilitation\\\"\\nAn emergency rescue worker, Ji Yeon, is trapped in a secret and mysterious space after being injured during a rescue operation.\\n\\n\\\"Delivery Complete\\\"\\nA story combining the Untact-era phenomena interacting through devices with fear.\\n\\n\\\"Ding Dong Challenge\\\"\\nThe story depicts high school girls challenging a bizarre dance that grants them their wishes if they succeed.\\n\\n\\\"Hey, Marmons\\\"\\nA story about a married couple's relationship breaking down due to today's fortune told by AI speakers.\\n\\n\\\"Four-legged Beast\\\"\\nA ghost story in which the blood of a four-legged animal increases grades.\\n\\n\\\"Gold Tooth\\\"\\nThe story is about Jin Tae, who steals gold teeth off of bodies and pays off his investment fraud debt.\\n\\n\\\"Jackpot\\\"\\nA greedy thriller by cheap humans that takes place when a man who won the jackpot stays at a motel for a day.\\n\\n\\\"Gluttony\\\"\\nA famous mukbang BJ, who suffers from anorexia, vomits something weird during a live broadcast.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=43361&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Taste of Horror\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240927/1727416230492_16c328cbdd93aa861e81fdbb2eac3d2e9FX2a2QHtDPavm3LaUvX5Upzie0.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":52081,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240927/1727418714142_088ac85df183effd57d27a2ba5be9ce24m11l8D2Jn8D1mAJephVpN2d7ir.png\",\"introduction\":\"A struggling dancer finds herself drawn into dark forces by a peculiar couple promising her fame.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=52081&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":9.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Apartment 7A\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":1,\"contentType\":\"DRAMA\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230726/1690363860638_387172359a91629cc56795c26088ed7cthe gust.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"drama\",\"dramaType\":\"TV\"},\"id\":5852,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20211109/1636453267240_501a66ef25a552d6571864dd4ab8a6415Y0apzo2oc0dBjDKQRZR7vjGRC7.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Twenty years ago, Yoon Hwa Pyung (Kim Dong Wook), a young psychic born into a shaman family, learns about the powerful demon called \\\"Sohn\\\" (Guest). The demon is very powerful and possesses the power to control other demons and allow them to possess weak people. The possessed people then go mad, kill their families, and stab themselves in the eye. Hwa Pyung, Choi Yoon (Kim Jae Wook); a young boy born in a religious Catholic family, and Kang Gil Young (Jung Eun Chae); the daughter of a detective, fatefully meet when their families are killed by a demon. Twenty years later, the demon killings started again. Hwa Pyung is now a taxi driver who uses his power to seek out possessed people in order to help them, Yoon is a Catholic priest who is talented in exorcism, and Gil Young is a detective who doesn't believe in ghosts. The trio meets again and tries to work together to defeat \\\"Sohn\\\".\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5852&type=1\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":16,\"resourceStatus\":2,\"score\":8.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Crime\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Son: The Guest\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241022/1729568696783_34479f6cd58119a3ea20c9e2530f0b55夺命假期1.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":53787,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241022/1729568637406_831159beb470946fab8883c0ec08b80b夺命假期.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Keenan family's simple weekend getaway truly turns into a vacation to die for, as four deranged killers playing a sadistic game lock down their hotel and compete for the most creative murders of all the guests.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=53787&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":5.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Stream\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240715/1721056916580_ba4ac3608ff1b54e9af6176ee3432cachK0FFcNLaJYWcDCrN254nE1Lqvk.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":46970,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20240715/1721056912854_e9a89e8e5ab233719cbd9dcaa10533ectxGP42LsRw0ylD7X4f6MvxHD2js.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Realtor Jung Tae’s hobby is sneaking into strangers’ homes and peeping into their lives. One day, an unfamiliar face in the area grabs his attention: Instagram star So Ra. Miraculously, So Ra leaves her house key at Jung Tae’s agency, and Jung Tae visits her home whenever he can, thrilled and excited.\\n\\nLike any other day, Jung Tae makes another visit and finds what he hadn’t expected: the dead body of So Ra. Even worse, all evidences say that Jung Tae is the criminal. Can he find the real killer and clear his name?\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=46970&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":8.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Following\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230713/1689233216390_1af40bbade83f343bbc3b0ca66dcdb60hPcP1kv6vrkRmQO3YgV1H97FE5Q.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":35569,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230713/1689233214502_c859bf4deb6d0f077686c30a31eed8bbuS1AIL7I1Ycgs8PTfqUeN6jYNsQ.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"The Lamberts must go deeper into The Further than ever before to put their demons to rest once and for all.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=35569&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.0,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Suspense\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Insidious: The Red Door\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230726/1690366398503_ed742cc7ded1b5221230f9740ac9fd72cFXjwxtsw5I0Nsdix2B78Xuv4WV.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":33469,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20230427/1682567964021_3d1410eb135acab08a6d2bc08ace424e1.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"Follow Gabriele Amorth, the Vatican's leading exorcist, as he investigates the possession of a child and uncovers a conspiracy the Vatican has tried to keep secret.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=33469&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2023,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.2,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"The Pope's Exorcist\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241008/1728374103546_a36e3e25b5e4bf3d45c9fe898fcdc8cc横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":52615,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20241008/1728374099585_43fd9d2e2c4095c548f2cbda3a9f4de7竖.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"A fading celebrity takes a black-market drug: a cell-replicating substance that temporarily creates a younger, better version of herself.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=52615&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2024,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.9,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"The Substance\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220812/1660287133313_f3be1494d2db0e65d479b92f4ee9f04c修女 横.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":23677,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220812/1660295047753_504470f14f746e5d18cdc240903ea5fdxiunv.png\",\"introduction\":\"While on a weekend trip, a group of friends are forced to seek shelter inside an abandoned prison where a nun named Sister Monday had once been assigned. During her time at the prison, Sister Monday was suspected of killing prisoners who were serving out their sentences but before she could be questioned, she disappeared. Once inside the prison, terrifying childhood memories and family conflict come to the surface for the group where they are forced to face their fears. Don't CROSS Sister Monday. She will PREY for you.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=23677&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2019,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":4.7,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"A Nun's Curse\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220816/1660633424466_ef6e2bf45e660440b463c3ac2bb1d095满足.jpg\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":5898,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220816/1660633391249_756c2eb5ffc828753974a4da517090fb111.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"When her mentally ill mother passes away, Annie (Toni Collette), her husband (Gabriel Byrne), son (Alex Wolff), and daughter (Milly Shapiro) all mourn her loss. The family turn to different means to handle their grief, including Annie and her daughter both flirting with the supernatural. They each begin to have disturbing, otherworldly experiences linked to the sinister secrets and emotional trauma that have been passed through the generations of their family.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5898&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":7.3,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"title\":\"Hereditary\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"},{\"category\":0,\"contentType\":\"MOVIE\",\"cornerInfoList\":[],\"coverHorizontalUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220429/1651223346685_de4b97173f0674b06ae0047b70d790b4昆池岩 横板.png\",\"dramaTypeVo\":{\"dramaName\":\"movie\",\"dramaType\":\"MOVIE\"},\"id\":5850,\"imageUrl\":\"https://img.netpop.app/cover/20220707/1657179053762_7272754d0f93d42ff57b2c294bc70f5e岩.jpg\",\"introduction\":\"An internet broadcaster recruits a handful of people for their 'experience the horror' show at Gonjiam. They are to explore the haunted asylum and stream it live on the show. To attract more viewers, the show hosts play tricks on the guests, but things start to get out of hand when they are inside the place, where tortured souls could really be lurking in the shadows.\",\"jumpAddress\":\"tiktik://jump/detail?id=5850&type=0\",\"jumpType\":\"\",\"onlineTime\":\"\",\"rankInfo\":null,\"releaseTime\":2018,\"reserveNum\":\"\",\"reserved\":false,\"resourceNum\":null,\"resourceStatus\":null,\"score\":6.4,\"showMark\":false,\"tagList\":[\"Horror\"],\"title\":\"Gonjiam: Haunted Asylum\",\"titleCenter\":false,\"videoName\":\"\"}],\"refRedirectUrl\":\"\",\"sequence\":null}]},\"msg\":\"Success\"}"
